	db	'atar... Thou shan\'t gain any more aid from me. I may be bli'
	db	'nd, but I see through thy sham. I\'ll not help thee send the'
	db	' Core into the void." Erethian falls silent, and it would ap'
	db	'pear that he\'ll speak no more.'
