L0000:	db	'The creature ignores you.*'
	db	00
L001B:	db	'The ape-like creature approaches you cautiously. After a few'
	db	' minutes, it says, "You are greeted, human."'
	db	00
L0084:	db	'The emp approaches you cautiously. After a few minutes, it s'
	db	'ays, "You are greeted, human."'
	db	00
L00DF:	db	'"Is more honey had by you?" The Emp asks hopefully.'
	db	00
L0113:	db	'"No honey is had by you," says the Emp, obviously disappoint'
	db	'ed.'
	db	00
L0153:	db	'Obviously disappointed, the Emp says, "That is too bad. What'
	db	' is your wish?"'
	db	00
L019F:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L01A3:	db	'job'
	db	00
L01A7:	db	'name'
	db	00
L01AC:	db	'name'
	db	00
L01B1:	db	'"Terandan is my name."'
	db	00
L01C8:	db	'he'
	db	00
L01CB:	db	'"Sendala is my name."'
	db	00
L01E1:	db	'she'
	db	00
L01E5:	db	'"Tvellum is my name."'
	db	00
L01FB:	db	'he'
	db	00
L01FE:	db	'"Simrek is my name."'
	db	00
L0213:	db	'she'
	db	00
L0217:	db	'name'
	db	00
L021C:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0220:	db	'"No job is had by me. Food is gathered by me."'
	db	00
L024F:	db	'food'
	db	00
L0254:	db	'food'
	db	00
L0259:	db	'"Fruit, milk, cheese are eaten by Emps.'
	db	00
L0281:	db	'cheese'
	db	00
L0288:	db	'milk'
	db	00
L028D:	db	'fruits'
	db	00
L0294:	db	'milk'
	db	00
L0299:	db	'cheese'
	db	00
L02A0:	db	'"Cheese and milk are liked by Emps, but they are hard to fin'
	db	'd. Only from humans can these foods be found."'
	db	00
L030B:	db	'milk'
	db	00
L0310:	db	'cheese'
	db	00
L0317:	db	'fruits'
	db	00
L031E:	db	'"Fruits are found easily in the forest," '
	db	00
L0348:	db	' says. "They are what Emps use as food most often."'
	db	00
L037C:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0380:	db	'"Farewell is said to you."*'
	db	00
