L9596:	db	'     To extend one\'s life is a complicated procedure, takin'
	db	'g years to complete. However, there is an additional side ef'
	db	'fect: invulnerability. I have broken this work down into cha'
	db	'pters based on each individual ritual. It is very important '
	db	'that these steps are performed in the order presented.*'
	db	00
L96BD:	db	'     First, thou must procure a five stone\'s of the dust of'
	db	' crushed rubies. This must be mixed thoroughly with the ooze'
	db	' of a slime, enough to make the rubies into a thick paste. A'
	db	'fter thou hast created the paste, set it in an ivory jar and'
	db	' place the entire container in a bucket of olive oil for thr'
	db	'ee years.*'
	db	00
L97F3:	db	'     The next step is too procure 10 newborn babes, none mor'
	db	'e than six days old. With a knife cut from the bone of a har'
	db	'py, thou must remove of the blood from each newborn. To be k'
	db	'ept fresh, the blood must be stored in an onyx flask, though'
	db	' mixing of each baby\'s blood is quite permissible.*'
	db	00
L9917:	db	'     Now thou shalt seek out...'
