L1B62:	db	'~~Between these columns, upon this pedestal, once sat the CO'
	db	'DEX OF ULTIMATE WISDOM.~~Now it lies in the infinite darknes'
	db	's of the Void, forever shining as a beacon of knowledge to t'
	db	'he races of man and gargoyle.~~Those who would seek the wisd'
	db	'om contained therein must unite the mystic lenses in the sam'
	db	'e manner as the Avatar did more than two hundred years ago.~'
	db	'Lord British~~To search for Singularity through Control, Pas'
	db	'sion, and Dilligence.~~Lord Draxinusom'
	db	00
