L0000:	db	'Avatar'
	db	00
L0007:	db	'The creature ignores you.*'
	db	00
L0022:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0026:	db	'job'
	db	00
L002A:	db	'name'
	db	00
L002F:	db	'The ape-like creature peers at you intently for a few minute'
	db	's. Then, shrugging, it walks cautiously up to you. "I am Tre'
	db	'llek. Your name is?"'
	db	00
L00BC:	db	'The Emp peers at you intensely for a few minutes. Then, shru'
	db	'gging, it walks cautiously up to you. "I am Trellek. Your na'
	db	'me is?"'
	db	00
L013C:	db	'"You are greeted."'
	db	00
L014F:	db	'"You are greeted, '
	db	00
L0162:	db	'."'
	db	00
L0165:	db	'Saralek\'s idea'
	db	00
L0174:	db	'No permission'
	db	00
L0182:	db	'wisps'
	db	00
L0188:	db	'Julius'
	db	00
L018F:	db	'join'
	db	00
L0194:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0199:	db	'"My name is still Trellek."'
	db	00
L01B5:	db	'name'
	db	00
L01BA:	db	'job'
	db	00
L01BE:	db	'He gives you a puzzled look.~~"The meaning of `job\' is not '
	db	'clear to me. Is `work\' the word meant by you?"'
	db	00
L0228:	db	'"I am a gatherer of food."'
	db	00
L0243:	db	'gatherer'
	db	00
L024C:	db	'"No job is had by me."'
	db	00
L0263:	db	'gatherer'
	db	00
L026C:	db	'"All Emps are food-gatherers. Mainly fruits are sought by us'
	db	'."'
	db	00
L02AB:	db	'gatherer'
	db	00
L02B4:	db	'Emps'
	db	00
L02B9:	db	'fruits'
	db	00
L02C0:	db	'fruits'
	db	00
L02C7:	db	'"Fruits are pleasant-tasting, like the honey you gave us!"'
	db	00
L0302:	db	'fruits'
	db	00
L0309:	db	'Emps'
	db	00
L030E:	db	'"I am an Emp. Saralek is an Emp. Salamon is an Emp. You," he'
	db	' smiles, "are a human."'
	db	00
L0362:	db	'Emps'
	db	00
L0367:	db	'Salamon'
	db	00
L036F:	db	'Saralek'
	db	00
L0377:	db	'Saralek'
	db	00
L037F:	db	'"Saralek is my bonded-one. `Wife\' is what you would call he'
	db	'r. My home is her home."'
	db	00
L03D3:	db	'home'
	db	00
L03D8:	db	'Saralek'
	db	00
L03E0:	db	'home'
	db	00
L03E5:	db	'"Silverleaf trees are our homes," he nods.'
	db	00
L0410:	db	'home'
	db	00
L0415:	db	'Silverleaf trees'
	db	00
L0426:	db	'Silverleaf trees'
	db	00
L0437:	db	'"Silverleaf trees cannot be explained by me in human terms. '
	db	'I am sorry. Another human should be asked by you?" he shrugs'
	db	', imitating the human gesture rather well.'
	db	00
L04DA:	db	'Silverleaf trees'
	db	00
L04EB:	db	'Salamon'
	db	00
L04F3:	db	'"Salamon is the wisest Emp. Humans have been met by her. -Ma'
	db	'ny- things have been seen by her. She is very experienced an'
	db	'd knowledgeable."'
	db	00
L057D:	db	'Salamon'
	db	00
L0585:	db	'wisps'
	db	00
L058B:	db	'"Wisps are known to me," he nods. "Wisps are found in the wo'
	db	'ods. What is your concern?"'
	db	00
L05E3:	db	'talk to wisps'
	db	00
L05F1:	db	'woods'
	db	00
L05F7:	db	'wisps'
	db	00
L05FD:	db	'No permission'
	db	00
L060B:	db	'"For you to talk to wisps is still your wish? Then helping y'
	db	'ou is my goal. A whistle can be made by me."'
	db	00
L0674:	db	'No permission'
	db	00
L0682:	db	'whistle'
	db	00
L068A:	db	'Saralek\'s idea'
	db	00
L0699:	db	'"Correct was my bonded-one. A whistle can be made by me."'
	db	00
L06D3:	db	'whistle'
	db	00
L06DB:	db	'Saralek\'s idea'
	db	00
L06EA:	db	'woods'
	db	00
L06F0:	db	'"The residence of the wisps is a stone building in a mountai'
	db	'n in the middle of the forest."'
	db	00
L074C:	db	'woods'
	db	00
L0752:	db	'whistle'
	db	00
L075A:	db	'"A whistling sound is made by Emps when talking is done by u'
	db	's. An imitation of that sound can be created by a special wh'
	db	'istle," he says enthusiastically.~~He begins quickly searchi'
	db	'ng around for a dead, hollow, fallen tree branch. Shortly he'
	db	' finds one that meets his satisfaction. Apparently embarrass'
	db	'ed, he turns his back to you, and makes motions similar to o'
	db	'ne twisting a cork from a flagon.~~After a few minutes of th'
	db	'is, he turns around and presents the whistle to you.'
	db	00
L0933:	db	'"Here is your whistle."'
	db	00
L094B:	db	'"Fewer items must be carried by you to take this whistle."'
	db	00
L0986:	db	'whistle'
	db	00
L098E:	db	'talk to wisps'
	db	00
L099C:	db	'"Your statement is a mystery. For me to talk to wisps is wha'
	db	't you want?"'
	db	00
L09E5:	db	'He looks around, apparently surveying the area.~~ "No wisps '
	db	'are here for conversation."'
	db	00
L0A3D:	db	'go there'
	db	00
L0A46:	db	'"Your want is not conveyed to me." He shrugs.'
	db	00
L0A74:	db	'talk to wisps'
	db	00
L0A82:	db	'Julius'
	db	00
L0A89:	db	'"Julius was a good human. His great deed was saving Emp fami'
	db	'ly from big fire years ago." He stares at you directly.~~"Bu'
	db	't, his story is sad, being about his death from too much smo'
	db	'ke in his body. His body is in the cemetery near the Abbey. '
	db	'He is one human that Emps call \'hero\'."'
	db	00
L0BA1:	db	'Julius'
	db	00
L0BA8:	db	'go there'
	db	00
