L0000:	db	'"Hast thou properly searched the stables?"'
	db	00
L002B:	db	'"What didst thou find?"'
	db	00
L0043:	db	'a body'
	db	00
L004A:	db	'a bucket'
	db	00
L0053:	db	'nothing'
	db	00
L005B:	db	'a key'
	db	00
L0061:	db	'a key'
	db	00
L0067:	db	'"Hmmm, a key. Perhaps if thou dost ask Christopher\'s son ab'
	db	'out it, he may know what it is for."'
	db	00
L00C7:	db	'"Ask Spark about it. He may know something."'
	db	00
L00F4:	db	'a body'
	db	00
L00FB:	db	'"I know that! What ELSE didst thou find? Thou shouldst look '
	db	'again, Avatar!"*'
	db	00
L0148:	db	'a bucket'
	db	00
L0151:	db	'"Yes, obviously it is filled with poor Christopher\'s own bl'
	db	'ood. But surely there was something else that might point us'
	db	' in the direction of the killer or killers - thou shouldst l'
	db	'ook again, Avatar."*'
	db	00
L0219:	db	'nothing'
	db	00
L0221:	db	'"Thou shouldst look again, \'Avatar\'!"*'
	db	00
L0248:	db	'"Well, do so, then come speak with me!"*'
	db	00
L0271:	db	'"Hmmm. Hast thou reconsidered mine offer to investigate the '
	db	'murder?"'
	db	00
L02B6:	db	'"Splendid. Then thou must really be the Avatar after all!"'
	db	00
L02F1:	db	'"Then leave our people to work it out for themselves."*'
	db	00
L0329:	db	'"Avatar! I am ashamed of thee! Thou shouldst reconsider!"*'
	db	00
L0364:	db	'You see a middle-aged nobleman.'
	db	00
L0384:	db	'"Iolo! Who is this stranger?"*'
	db	00
L03A3:	db	'"Why, this is the Avatar!" Iolo proudly proclaims. "Canst th'
	db	'ou believe it? May I introduce thee? This is Finnigan, the T'
	db	'own Mayor. And this is '
	db	00
L0433:	db	', the Avatar!'
	db	00
L0441:	db	'"I simply cannot believe she is here!"*'
	db	00
L0469:	db	'"I simply cannot believe he is here!"*'
	db	00
L0490:	db	'The Mayor looks you up and down, not sure if he believes Iol'
	db	'o or not. He looks at Iolo skeptically.'
	db	00
L04F4:	db	'"I swear to thee, it is the Avatar!"'
	db	00
L0519:	db	'"I have heard that thou art the Avatar. I am not certain tha'
	db	't I believe it.'
	db	00
L0565:	db	'The mayor looks at you again as if he were studying every po'
	db	're on your face. Finally, he smiles.'
	db	00
L05C6:	db	'"Welcome, Avatar."'
	db	00
L05D9:	db	'But just as suddenly, Finnigan\'s face becomes stern.'
	db	00
L060E:	db	'"A horrible murder has occurred. If thou art truly the Avata'
	db	'r, perhaps thou canst help us solve it. I would feel better '
	db	'if thou takest this matter into thine hands. Thou shalt be h'
	db	'andsomely rewarded if thou dost discover the name of the kil'
	db	'ler. Dost thou accept?"'
	db	00
L0716:	db	'"Petre here knows something about all of this."*'
	db	00
L0747:	db	'The peasant interjects. "I discovered poor Christopher and t'
	db	'he Gargoyle Inamo early this morning."*'
	db	00
L07AB:	db	'"Petre, the stables caretaker, discovered poor Christopher a'
	db	'nd Inamo early this morning."'
	db	00
L0805:	db	'The Mayor continues. "Hast thou searched the stables?"'
	db	00
L083C:	db	'"Well, thou could not be the real Avatar then!"*'
	db	00
L086D:	db	'"Yes, Avatar?" Finnigan asks.'
	db	00
L088B:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L088F:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L0896:	db	'job'
	db	00
L089A:	db	'name'
	db	00
L089F:	db	'report'
	db	00
L08A6:	db	'Klog'
	db	00
L08AB:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L08B6:	db	'password'
	db	00
L08BF:	db	'Pay me now, please'
	db	00
L08D2:	db	'name'
	db	00
L08D7:	db	'"My name is Finnigan."'
	db	00
L08EE:	db	'name'
	db	00
L08F3:	db	'job'
	db	00
L08F7:	db	'"I am the Mayor of Trinsic and have been since I arrived her'
	db	'e three years ago."'
	db	00
L0947:	db	'Trinsic'
	db	00
L094F:	db	'Trinsic'
	db	00
L0957:	db	'by one who claimed she was the Avatar.'
	db	00
L097E:	db	'by one who claimed he was the Avatar.'
	db	00
L09A4:	db	'"Trinsic was once the city of Honor. I suppose it still is. '
	db	'Our Rune of Honor was taken many years ago '
	db	00
L0A0C:	db	' I believe it now resides in the Royal Museum in Britain, ye'
	db	't the empty pedestal still remains in the center of town. I '
	db	'feel this is symbolic of the town itself. It is rather empty'
	db	' -- of people, of life, and of honor. \'Tis sad, really."'
	db	00
L0AF9:	db	'"Then there is this murder, of course. We have temporarily c'
	db	'losed the gates of the city and require a password to get in'
	db	' or out."'
	db	00
L0B7B:	db	'Trinsic'
	db	00
L0B83:	db	'password'
	db	00
L0B8C:	db	'Pay me now, please'
	db	00
L0B9F:	db	'"Of course, '
	db	00
L0BAC:	db	'. Here is thy gold."'
	db	00
L0BC1:	db	'"Oh, I am sorry, '
	db	00
L0BD3:	db	'. Thou still cannot carry this amount. Thou must return to m'
	db	'e later."'
	db	00
L0C19:	db	'"Here thou art."'
	db	00
L0C2A:	db	'Pay me now, please'
	db	00
L0C3D:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L0C44:	db	'"A crime like this has never happened in Trinsic before. I c'
	db	'annot believe this happened to Christopher and Inamo. Please'
	db	' -- explore the town! I would appreciate it if thou wouldst '
	db	'bring me a report on thy progress. Be sure to ask everyone i'
	db	'n town about the murder. After speaking with Christopher\'s '
	db	'son, thou mightest next want to speak with Gilberto, the gua'
	db	'rd on watch at the dock last night."'
	db	00
L0DD0:	db	'The mayor hesitates, then leans in to speak quietly.'
	db	00
L0E05:	db	'"Actually, I have seen something like this before. It was ab'
	db	'out four years ago, in Britain."'
	db	00
L0E62:	db	'report'
	db	00
L0E69:	db	'Britain'
	db	00
L0E71:	db	'Inamo'
	db	00
L0E77:	db	'Christopher'
	db	00
L0E83:	db	'Gilberto'
	db	00
L0E8C:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L0E93:	db	'"I hope thou art progressing on the murder investigation."'
	db	00
L0ECE:	db	'Britain'
	db	00
L0ED6:	db	'"\'Twas before I came to Trinsic. There was a murder with st'
	db	'rikingly similar aspects. A body was found mutilated exactly'
	db	' like poor Christopher. It appeared to be a ritualistic kill'
	db	'ing. I would wager that whoever was responsible for that mur'
	db	'der is the culprit behind this one."'
	db	00
L0FEA:	db	'Britain'
	db	00
L0FF2:	db	'son'
	db	00
L0FF6:	db	'"Christopher\'s son is called Spark. Their house is in the n'
	db	'orthwest area of town."'
	db	00
L1049:	db	'son'
	db	00
L104D:	db	'Gilberto'
	db	00
L1056:	db	'"He was struck from behind early this morning and was knocke'
	db	'd senseless. Johnson, the morning watch, found him unconscio'
	db	'us. He is recuperating at Chantu the Healer\'s house on the '
	db	'west side of town."'
	db	00
L111D:	db	'Gilberto'
	db	00
L1126:	db	'Chantu'
	db	00
L112D:	db	'Johnson'
	db	00
L1135:	db	'Chantu'
	db	00
L113C:	db	'"He is our town healer. He hath been here for years. Nice fe'
	db	'llow."'
	db	00
L117F:	db	'Chantu'
	db	00
L1186:	db	'report'
	db	00
L118D:	db	'"I am satisfied with thy report. Please carry on thine inves'
	db	'tigation, Avatar."'
	db	00
L11DC:	db	'"Art thou ready to answer some questions concerning the inve'
	db	'stigation?"'
	db	00
L1224:	db	'"Oh. Well, carry on with thine investigation."'
	db	00
L1253:	db	'"Shall we continue thy report?"'
	db	00
L1273:	db	'"Oh. Well, carry on with thine investigation."'
	db	00
L12A2:	db	'report'
	db	00
L12A9:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L12B4:	db	'"Why, they are an extremely helpful group. Their branch offi'
	db	'ce is just east of mine. Very optimistic group of people."'
	db	00
L132B:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L1336:	db	'Klog'
	db	00
L133B:	db	'"He is the Fellowship branch leader. Kind man."'
	db	00
L136B:	db	'Klog'
	db	00
L1370:	db	'Johnson'
	db	00
L1378:	db	'"He is probably at the dock right now."'
	db	00
L13A0:	db	'Johnson'
	db	00
L13A8:	db	'Christopher'
	db	00
L13B4:	db	'"Christopher was the local blacksmith. He lives, or rather -'
	db	'lived-, with his son in the northwest part of town. The blac'
	db	'ksmith\'s shop is in the southwest corner. Christopher was n'
	db	'ot a rich man by any means -- he barely kept himself and his'
	db	' son alive. But he certainly enjoyed his work."'
	db	00
L14D3:	db	'Christopher'
	db	00
L14DF:	db	'son'
	db	00
L14E3:	db	'Inamo'
	db	00
L14E9:	db	'"The Gargoyle Inamo slept in the stables, as I understand it'
	db	'. I believe he emigrated here from Terfin a few months ago. '
	db	'It seems that he was merely a chance victim of someone inten'
	db	't on violence."'
	db	00
L15AD:	db	'Inamo'
	db	00
L15B3:	db	'password'
	db	00
L15BC:	db	'"Oh, dost thou want the password now?"'
	db	00
L15E3:	db	'"Excellent! I have no doubts now that thou art the one true '
	db	'Avatar!"'
	db	00
L1628:	db	'"Oh-- I almost forgot! The password to leave or enter the to'
	db	'wn is `Blackbird\'!"*'
	db	00
L1679:	db	'"Hmmm. I am afraid that I still have my doubts about thou be'
	db	'ing the Avatar. My public duty disallows me to give thee the'
	db	' password. I am sorry."'
	db	00
L1709:	db	'The Mayor shrugs and looks at you as if you were mad.*'
	db	00
L1740:	db	'"I will give thee the password when thou hast given me a rep'
	db	'ort on the progress of thine investigation."'
	db	00
L17A9:	db	'report'
	db	00
L17B0:	db	'password'
	db	00
L17B9:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L17BD:	db	'The Mayor nods his head at you and goes on about his busines'
	db	's.*'
	db	00
L17FD:	db	'@What a day...@'
	db	00
L180D:	db	'@Another day, another gold coin...@'
	db	00
L1831:	db	'@I shall search the area here...@'
	db	00
L1853:	db	'@I am too old for this...@'
	db	00
