L0000:	db	'"I will speak with thee after the Fellowship meeting."*'
	db	00
L0038:	db	'"I must get to the Fellowship meeting! I am late! May we spe'
	db	'ak tomorrow?"*'
	db	00
L0083:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0087:	db	'job'
	db	00
L008B:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0090:	db	'password'
	db	00
L0099:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L00A0:	db	'Hook'
	db	00
L00A5:	db	'Klog'
	db	00
L00AA:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L00B5:	db	'Crown Jewel'
	db	00
L00C1:	db	'You see an alert and no-nonsense guard.'
	db	00
L00E9:	db	'"What is it?" Johnson asks, sternly.'
	db	00
L010E:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0113:	db	'"Johnson."'
	db	00
L011E:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0123:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0127:	db	'"I have the morning watch guarding the dock. I authorize the'
	db	' comings and goings of every ship."'
	db	00
L0187:	db	'ship'
	db	00
L018C:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L0193:	db	'"I did hear of this. When I arrived at my post at sunrise, I'
	db	' found Gilberto lying felled on the ground. If thou art aski'
	db	'ng if I saw anything -- I did not. No one hath passed by me '
	db	'since I arrived at the dock."'
	db	00
L0265:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L026C:	db	'Crown Jewel'
	db	00
L0278:	db	'"The boat left just after sunrise. It did sail to Britain, I'
	db	' believe. Thou canst ask Gargan the Shipwright about that."'
	db	00
L02F0:	db	'Crown Jewel'
	db	00
L02FC:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0307:	db	'"Yes, I am a member. Wouldst thou like to join?"'
	db	00
L0338:	db	'"Then thou shouldst go to see Batlin in Britain."'
	db	00
L036A:	db	'"\'Tis thy loss."'
	db	00
L037B:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0386:	db	'Klog'
	db	00
L038B:	db	'"Good man. He is our branch leader here in Trinsic."'
	db	00
L03C0:	db	'Klog'
	db	00
L03C5:	db	'ship'
	db	00
L03CA:	db	'"If thou dost want a ship, thou must get a deed from the shi'
	db	'pwright. Thou must also have the password to leave town."'
	db	00
L0440:	db	'deed'
	db	00
L0445:	db	'password'
	db	00
L044E:	db	'ship'
	db	00
L0453:	db	'password'
	db	00
L045C:	db	'"What is it?"'
	db	00
L046A:	db	'Please'
	db	00
L0471:	db	'Long live the king'
	db	00
L0484:	db	'Uhh, I don\'t know'
	db	00
L0496:	db	'Blackbird'
	db	00
L04A0:	db	'Blackbird'
	db	00
L04AA:	db	'"Very well, thou mayest pass."*'
	db	00
L04CA:	db	'"Thou mayest not pass."*'
	db	00
L04E3:	db	'"Thou dost not know the password. I am sorry. The Mayor may '
	db	'give thee the proper password."'
	db	00
L053F:	db	'Hook'
	db	00
L0544:	db	'"A man with a hook? No, I saw no one all night or all mornin'
	db	'g."'
	db	00
L0584:	db	'Hook'
	db	00
L0589:	db	'deed'
	db	00
L058E:	db	'"Thou canst purchase that from Gargan the Shipwright."'
	db	00
L05C5:	db	'deed'
	db	00
L05CA:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L05CE:	db	'"Good day."*'
	db	00
