L0049:	db	'This man exudes kindness and geniality. "Ah, Avatar! I recog'
	db	'nized thee at once! Word has moved through town quickly. I h'
	db	'ad heard thou wert here."'
	db	00
L00DB:	db	'"Hello again, '
	db	00
L00EA:	db	'," Klog asks. "How may I help thee?"'
	db	00
L010F:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0114:	db	'"My name is Klog."'
	db	00
L0127:	db	'name'
	db	00
L012C:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0130:	db	'"I am the Trinsic branch leader for The Fellowship. I work h'
	db	'ere with my wife Ellen."'
	db	00
L0185:	db	'Ellen'
	db	00
L018B:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0196:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L019D:	db	'The Cube vibrates. "Hook did a splendid job, did he not? Too'
	db	' bad\tI missed it. Had to keep up appearances and remain at '
	db	'home.\tHad to have an alibi."'
	db	00
L0231:	db	'"Well," the man says, reflecting, "I was home all night, and'
	db	' my wife Ellen will certainly verify that. But, as we say in'
	db	' The Fellowship, \'Worthiness Precedes Reward\'. Christopher'
	db	' must have done something bad. And the poor gargoyle Inamo! '
	db	'\'Tis a pity."'
	db	00
L032D:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L0334:	db	'Inamo'
	db	00
L033A:	db	'Christopher'
	db	00
L0346:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0351:	db	'"The Fellowship meets here at the branch office in Trinsic e'
	db	'very night at nine. Thou art welcome to attend.'
	db	00
L03BD:	db	'philosophy'
	db	00
L03C8:	db	'"Why, thou shouldst know all about our little family by now!'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L0406:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0411:	db	'Ellen'
	db	00
L0417:	db	'"She is my wife and bookkeeper for our branch."'
	db	00
L0447:	db	'Ellen'
	db	00
L044D:	db	'philosophy'
	db	00
L0458:	db	'philosophy'
	db	00
L0463:	db	'Christopher'
	db	00
L046F:	db	'"Christopher was a valued member of The Fellowship for some '
	db	'time. Unfortunately, we got into a petty argument last week.'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L04E9:	db	'Christopher'
	db	00
L04F5:	db	'argument'
	db	00
L04FE:	db	'Inamo'
	db	00
L0504:	db	'"I did not know the gargoyle. It sounds as if he was in the '
	db	'wrong place at the wrong time. \'Tis a pity."'
	db	00
L056D:	db	'Inamo'
	db	00
L0573:	db	'argument'
	db	00
L057C:	db	'"Last week Christopher stated that he wanted to leave The Fe'
	db	'llowship! Canst thou imagine? Well, we simply attempted to s'
	db	'peak with him and alter his decision. The man verbally assau'
	db	'lted me and my companions with no provocation!"'
	db	00
L0660:	db	'argument'
	db	00
L0669:	db	'companions'
	db	00
L0674:	db	'test'
	db	00
L0679:	db	'"Batlin in Britain will be happy to administer our test to t'
	db	'hee. Thou shouldst certainly take it. Who knows? Thou mayest'
	db	' find something within thee that needs improving."'
	db	00
L0724:	db	'test'
	db	00
L0729:	db	'companions'
	db	00
L0734:	db	'"They have gone to Fellowship Headquarters in Britain. They '
	db	'were here delivering Fellowship funds. Their names are Eliza'
	db	'beth and Abraham."'
	db	00
L07BF:	db	'companions'
	db	00
L07CA:	db	'gold'
	db	00
L07CF:	db	'The Cube vibrates. "That was payment for delivery of the pla'
	db	'ns for the Black Gate pedestals."'
	db	00
L082D:	db	'Black Gate'
	db	00
L0838:	db	'"I do not know what thou art talking about."'
	db	00
L0865:	db	'gold'
	db	00
L086A:	db	'Black Gate'
	db	00
L0875:	db	'"All I know is that it is being built on the Isle of the Ava'
	db	'tar."'
	db	00
L08B7:	db	'Black Gate'
	db	00
L08C2:	db	'medallion'
	db	00
L08CC:	db	'"Christopher had expressed interest in leaving The Fellowshi'
	db	'p. Perhaps he had stored it for safekeeping."'
	db	00
L0936:	db	'medallion'
	db	00
L0940:	db	'scroll'
	db	00
L0947:	db	'The Cube vibrates. "Christopher received his reward prior to'
	db	' showing his worthiness. He reneged on delivery of\tthe plan'
	db	's for the pedestal. It was merely a warning."'
	db	00
L09EC:	db	'"I do not know anything about that."'
	db	00
L0A11:	db	'scroll'
	db	00
L0A18:	db	'Crown Jewel'
	db	00
L0A24:	db	'The Cube vibrates. "That is Hook\'s ship."'
	db	00
L0A4E:	db	'"I do not know that ship."'
	db	00
L0A69:	db	'Crown Jewel'
	db	00
L0A75:	db	'Hook'
	db	00
L0A7A:	db	'The Cube vibrates. "He is the one who was assigned to kill C'
	db	'hristopher. I do not know where he is now."'
	db	00
L0AE2:	db	'"I am afraid I do not know a man of that description."'
	db	00
L0B19:	db	'Hook'
	db	00
L0B1E:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0B22:	db	'"If there is anything else I may help thee with, '
	db	00
L0B54:	db	', let me know."*'
	db	00
