L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L000B:	db	'job'
	db	00
L000F:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0014:	db	'buy'
	db	00
L0018:	db	'room'
	db	00
L001D:	db	'drink'
	db	00
L0023:	db	'food'
	db	00
L0028:	db	'You see a gorgeous and voluptuous woman in her thirties.'
	db	00
L0061:	db	'"Hello again!" Apollonia says, her eyes twinkling.'
	db	00
L0094:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0099:	db	'as her tongue licks her upper lip.'
	db	00
L00BC:	db	'as she sizes you up.'
	db	00
L00D1:	db	'"My name is Apollonia," she says, '
	db	00
	db	00
L00F5:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00FA:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00FE:	db	'"Why, I run the Honorable Hound Pub and Inn," she purrs.'
	db	00
L0137:	db	'"Wouldst thou like a room? Or wouldst thou like something to'
	db	' eat or drink? Just say so and I shall try and please thee w'
	db	'ith my delicacies."'
	db	00
L01C3:	db	'~~You realize she is flirting with you.'
	db	00
L01EB:	db	'flirt'
	db	00
L01F1:	db	'"I shall be happy to serve thee during business hours!"'
	db	00
L0229:	db	'Honorable Hound'
	db	00
L0239:	db	'Honorable Hound'
	db	00
L0249:	db	'"I can think of no better place in all of Trinsic to lay thi'
	db	'ne head to rest or to nibble upon treats to satisfy thine ap'
	db	'petite."'
	db	00
L02CA:	db	'Honorable Hound'
	db	00
L02DA:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L02E1:	db	'Apollonia shuts her eyes and shakes her head as if she had j'
	db	'ust bitten into a very sour lemon. "Oooh. That was so... hid'
	db	'eous! How could anyone do something so horrible? Art thou se'
	db	'arching for information? I do hope thou dost find the person'
	db	' responsible."'
	db	00
L03E0:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L03E7:	db	'food'
	db	00
L03EC:	db	'"We serve the finest meat, fish, and cake. Our specialty is '
	db	'a Silverleaf meal. If thou wouldst like to buy something, pl'
	db	'ease say so!"'
	db	00
L0472:	db	'Silverleaf'
	db	00
L047D:	db	'food'
	db	00
L0482:	db	'drink'
	db	00
L0488:	db	'"I can offer thee mead, wine and ale."'
	db	00
L04AF:	db	'drink'
	db	00
L04B5:	db	'room'
	db	00
L04BA:	db	'"Our rooms are cheap. Only 6 gold per person per night. Want'
	db	' a room?"'
	db	00
L0500:	db	'"Oh dear. Thou art carrying too much to take the room key."'
	db	00
L053C:	db	'"Here is thy room key. It is good only until thou dost leave'
	db	'."'
	db	00
L057B:	db	'"Thou dost not have enough gold, '
	db	00
L059D:	db	'."'
	db	00
L05A0:	db	'"Some other night, then."'
	db	00
L05BA:	db	'room'
	db	00
L05BF:	db	'Silverleaf'
	db	00
L05CA:	db	'"Mmmm. What a delicacy! It is the most wonderful delicacy th'
	db	'at thou shalt ever eat! It is worth every gold piece spent."'
	db	00
L0643:	db	'Silverleaf'
	db	00
L064E:	db	'flirt'
	db	00
L0654:	db	'Apollonia blushes and bats her eyelashes. "Oh, '
	db	00
L0684:	db	'! I would wager that thou dost say that to all the barmaids!'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L06C2:	db	'flirt'
	db	00
L06C8:	db	'buy'
	db	00
L06CC:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L06D0:	db	'Apollonia blows a kiss at you. "Do come again!"*'
	db	00
L0701:	db	'Apollonia waves at you. "Do come again!"*'
	db	00
