L0014:	db	'You see a solid-looking but seemingly bored fighter.'
	db	00
L0049:	db	'"Yes?" Markus asks.'
	db	00
L005D:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0062:	db	'"I am Markus the trainer."'
	db	00
L007D:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0082:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0086:	db	'"I am a trainer here in Trinsic," he says gruffly. "If thou '
	db	'dost wish to increase thy skill in combat I can help thee."'
	db	00
L00FE:	db	'train'
	db	00
L0104:	db	'Trinsic'
	db	00
L010C:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L0113:	db	'"I heard about it, but I assure thee I know nothing of the d'
	db	'etails." Markus yawns.'
	db	00
L0166:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L016D:	db	'Trinsic'
	db	00
L0175:	db	'The fighter shrugs. "The town is all right." He sniffs.'
	db	00
L01AD:	db	'Trinsic'
	db	00
L01B5:	db	'train'
	db	00
L01BB:	db	'"The cost to train with me is 20 gold. Too costly, right?"'
	db	00
L01F6:	db	'Markus yawns. "Very well."'
	db	00
L0211:	db	'"Please come to my place of business during normal daylight '
	db	'hours."'
	db	00
L0255:	db	'train'
	db	00
L025B:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L025F:	db	'"Goodbye," the fighter bows.*'
