L0000:	db	'Caroline asks you to keep your voice down. The Fellowship me'
	db	'eting is in progress.*'
	db	00
L0053:	db	'"Oh! I cannot stop to speak with thee now! I am late for the'
	db	' Fellowship meeting!"*'
	db	00
L00A6:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L00AA:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L00B1:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00B5:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00BA:	db	'You see a young woman with a bright smile.'
	db	00
L00E5:	db	'"Hello again!" Caroline says brightly.'
	db	00
L010C:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0111:	db	'"My parents named me Caroline," she says proudly.'
	db	00
L0143:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0148:	db	'job'
	db	00
L014C:	db	'"I have no \'job\' per se. I have devoted mine energies to h'
	db	'elping The Fellowship. I hope to recruit new members."'
	db	00
L01BD:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L01C8:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L01CF:	db	'She looks concerned. "\'Tis awful! Christopher was a nice ma'
	db	'n. Didst thou know he was one of our members? I cannot belie'
	db	've he is dead..."'
	db	00
L0258:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L025F:	db	'members'
	db	00
L0267:	db	'members'
	db	00
L026F:	db	'"Of The Fellowship. We meet every night at the hall. Thou sh'
	db	'ouldst visit!"'
	db	00
L02BA:	db	'members'
	db	00
L02C2:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L02CD:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L02D8:	db	'philosophy'
	db	00
L02E3:	db	'society'
	db	00
L02EB:	db	'society'
	db	00
L02F3:	db	'"Every night at nine o\'clock we have a meeting in the Fello'
	db	'wship hall. Thou mayest consider thyself invited to attend."'
	db	00
L036B:	db	'society'
	db	00
L0373:	db	'philosophy'
	db	00
L037E:	db	'philosophy'
	db	00
L0389:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L038D:	db	'"Goodbye!"*'
	db	00
L0399:	db	'@Come to Fellowship Hall!@'
	db	00
L03B4:	db	'@Strive For Unity!@'
	db	00
L03C8:	db	'@Trust Thy Brother!@'
	db	00
L03DD:	db	'@Worthiness Precedes Reward!@'
	db	00
