	db	'an when you last saw him. His eyes gleam at the sight of you'
	db	'.~~"Welcome, my friend," he says, embracing you. "Please. Te'
	db	'll me what brings thee to Britannia! Or, more importantly, w'
	db	'hat \'brought\' thee here?"'
