L04E9:	db	'Lord British rolls his eyes. "Must we go through this formal'
	db	'ity?" He laughs, shaking his head.'
	db	00
L0548:	db	'"Very well. As thou well knowest, I am sovereign of Britanni'
	db	'a and have been for some time now. Even though I come from t'
	db	'hine homeland, I have chosen to live my life here."'
	db	00
L05F4:	db	'homeland'
	db	00
L05FD:	db	'Britannia'
	db	00
L0607:	db	'homeland'
	db	00
L0610:	db	'"I know that it has been many a year since I visited our Ear'
	db	'th, but surely thou dost remember that the two of us hail fr'
	db	'om the same time and place? And, as brothers in origin, thou'
	db	' shouldst also remember that thou canst ask me for aid at an'
	db	'y time thou mightest require it."'
	db	00
L0722:	db	'homeland'
	db	00
L072B:	db	'aid'
	db	00
L072F:	db	'aid'
	db	00
L0733:	db	'"Do not forget, Avatar, that I have the power to heal thee. '
	db	'That is one bit of magic that still seems to work for me. An'
	db	'd I could probably provide thee with some equipment and a sp'
	db	'ellbook."'
	db	00
