L0A4B:	db	'"Well, \'things\' are indeed fine. It is the \'people\' I am'
	db	' concerned about.~~"There is something wrong in Britannia, b'
	db	'ut I do not know what it is. Something is hanging over the h'
	db	'eads of the Britannian people. They are unhappy. One can see'
	db	' it in their eyes. There is nothing that is unifying the pop'
	db	'ulation, since there has been peace for so long.~~"Perhaps t'
	db	'hou couldst determine what is happening. I implore thee to g'
	db	'o out amongst the people. Watch them in their daily tasks. S'
	db	'peak with them. Work with them. Break bread with them. Perha'
	db	'ps they need someone like the Avatar to take an interest in '
	db	'their lives."'
