L0CC7:	db	'You relate the story of how a red Moongate appeared behind y'
	db	'our house and mysteriously took you to Trinsic.~~Lord Britis'
	db	'h\'s brow creases as you speak. Finally he says, "I did not '
	db	'send the red Moongate to fetch thee. Someone or something mu'
	db	'st have activated that Moongate. And that is strange indeed,'
	db	' because we have been having a bit of trouble with Moongates'
	db	' as of late. In fact, we have been having trouble with magic'
	db	' in general!"'
