L148C:	db	'The king pauses a moment. "Now that thou dost mention it, I '
	db	'have had reports of other similar murders in the past few mo'
	db	'nths. In fact, there was one here in Britain three or four y'
	db	'ears ago. The body was mutilated in a ritualistic fashion. A'
	db	'pparently there is a maddened killer on the loose. But I hav'
	db	'e no doubt that someone such as thee, Avatar, can find him!"'
