L233D:	db	'"The Moongates are not functioning! We cannot use them as we'
	db	' have in the past. Not only are they dysfunctional, they are'
	db	', in fact, dangerous! One of my trusted sages used mine own '
	db	'Orb of the Moons to travel to the Shrine of Humility, and hi'
	db	's body did shatter upon entering the gate! If only that mage'
	db	' in Cove hadn\'t gone mad!"'
