L24A5:	db	'The ruler leans forward and speaks quietly.~~"There is a mad'
	db	' mage in Cove by the name of Rudyom. Dost thou remember him?'
	db	' Rudyom was working with a magical substance called \'blackr'
	db	'ock\'. Before he went mad, he claimed that this mineral coul'
	db	'd solve the problems of the Moongates. I suggest that thou s'
	db	'houldst go to Cove and find him. Try to learn what it was he'
	db	' was doing with this blackrock material. It could be our onl'
	db	'y hope."'
	db	00
