	db	'uipment."'
	db	00
L28B5:	db	'spellbook'
	db	00
L28BF:	db	'equipment'
	db	00
L28C9:	db	'"Thou art welcome to any of mine equipment. I keep it in a l'
	db	'ocked storeroom here in the castle. Thou wilt find the key i'
	db	'n my study."'
	db	00
L294E:	db	'equipment'
	db	00
L2958:	db	'study'
	db	00
L295E:	db	'storeroom'
	db	00
L2968:	db	'storeroom'
	db	00
L2972:	db	'"I am sure thou canst find it."~~The ruler smiles slyly. "Co'
	db	'nsider it something of a game!"'
	db	00
L29CE:	db	'storeroom'
	db	00
L29D8:	db	'study'
	db	00
L29DE:	db	'"\'Tis in the western end of the castle."'
	db	00
L2A07:	db	'study'
	db	00
L2A0D:	db	'heal'
	db	00
L2A12:	db	'Weston'
	db	00
L2A19:	db	'Lord British listens to your story about Weston. He looks co'
	db	'ncerned.~~"I do not recall this case. Let me check... Hmmm..'
	db	'." He quickly scans a large scroll.~~"Imprisoned for the the'
	db	'ft of one apple from the Royal Orchards... Ludicrous! Someon'
	db	'e must have usurped mine authority. Thou mayest consider thi'
	db	's man pardoned. An investigation will commence immediately i'
	db	'nto the circumstances surrounding his arrest, and into this '
	db	'fellow, Figg. My thanks to thee, Avatar."'
	db	00
L2BE7:	db	'Weston'
	db	00
L2BEE:	db	'rumble'
	db	00
L2BF5:	db	'Lord British looks at you gravely, "The foundation of Britan'
	db	'nia was shaken with the rising of an island. This event was '
	db	'no random disaster, it was one of sorcerous intent."'
	db	00
L2CA2:	db	'island'
	db	00
L2CA9:	db	'rumble'
	db	00
L2CB0:	db	'island'
	db	00
L2CB7:	db	'"Yes, '
	db	00
L2CBE:	db	'. I felt a great disturbance in the ether when this island a'
	db	'rose from the sea. The island is none other than the Isle of'
	db	' Fire where thou defeated the Hellspawn Exodus."'
	db	00
L2D67:	db	'Exodus'
	db	00
L2D6E:	db	'Isle of Fire'
	db	00
L2D7B:	db	'island'
	db	00
L2D82:	db	'Isle of Fire'
	db	00
L2D8F:	db	'"'
	db	00
L2D91:	db	', thou shouldst know that when I created the shrines of the '
	db	'Virtues, I also set upon this island three great shrines, de'
	db	'dicated to the Priciples of Truth, Love, and Courage.'
	db	00
L2E3F:	db	'They reside within the walls of the Castle of Fire. I never '
	db	'revealed this to thee before as I thought them forever lost '
	db	'when the Isle of Fire mysteriously sank beneath the waves.'
	db	00
L2EF2:	db	'The shrines are meant for the use of an Avatar only, and the'
	db	'refore a talisman will be necessary to use one.'
	db	00
L2F5E:	db	'The talismans are guarded by tests that thou shouldst have n'
	db	'o problem passing if thou wishest to seek thier counsel."'
	db	00
L2FD4:	db	'Isle of Fire'
	db	00
L2FE1:	db	'Exodus'
	db	00
L2FE8:	db	'"Thy battle with that strange mixture of machine and spirit '
	db	'is now legendary. Do be careful if thou art going to the isl'
	db	'e, for the remains of that being now reside in one of the ch'
	db	'ambers of the Castle of Fire."'
	db	00
L30BB:	db	'Exodus'
	db	00
L30C2:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L30C6:	db	'"Goodbye, '
	db	00
L30D1:	db	'. Do come back soon."*'
	db	00
L30E8:	db	'"I congratulate and thank thee, '
	db	00
L3109:	db	'. Thy deeds continue to speak well of thee."'
	db	00
