	; Function at file offset 00050932H
	.funcnumber  0429H
	.data
	.msize       10DAH
	.dsize       0E80H
L0000:	db	'Candice is listening intently to the Fellowship meeting.*'
	db	00
L003A:	db	'"Hast thou seen Batlin? He has not shown up for the Fellowsh'
	db	'ip meeting!"'
	db	00
L0083:	db	'"Oh! I must not stop to speak with thee! I am late for a Fel'
	db	'lowship meeting!"*'
	db	00
L00D2:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L00D6:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00DA:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00DF:	db	'This is a bright woman who looks much younger than she actua'
	db	'lly is.'
	db	00
L0123:	db	'"Well! Thy reputation precedes thee! The Avatar in person! W'
	db	'ord has spread that thou wert in Britain!"'
	db	00
L018A:	db	'Candice looks guilty about something. She gives you a little'
	db	' wave, but says nothing. She looks at Patterson, hoping that'
	db	' he will do the talking.*'
	db	00
L021C:	db	'"Yes, Avatar?" Candice says.'
	db	00
L0239:	db	'"Yes, Avatar?" Candice says.'
	db	00
L0256:	db	'name'
	db	00
L025B:	db	'"My name is Candice," she says brightly. "I must say I am ho'
	db	'nored to meet the Avatar!" She curtsies.'
	db	00
L02C0:	db	'name'
	db	00
L02C5:	db	'job'
	db	00
L02C9:	db	'"I am the curator of the Royal Museum.'
	db	00
L02F0:	db	'"Feel free to ask about any of the exhibits.'
	db	00
L031D:	db	'"I hope to see thee there when the museum is open.'
	db	00
L0350:	db	'"I spend the rest of my time working with The Fellowship."'
	db	00
L038B:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0396:	db	'exhibits'
	db	00
L039F:	db	'Royal Museum'
	db	00
L03AC:	db	'Royal Museum'
	db	00
L03B9:	db	'"It has been in Britain for many, many years. It contains hi'
	db	'storical artifacts, as well as works of art."'
	db	00
L0423:	db	'Royal Museum'
	db	00
L0430:	db	'works of art'
	db	00
L043D:	db	'artifacts'
	db	00
L0447:	db	'exhibits'
	db	00
L0450:	db	'"We have just opened a special section in which thou might b'
	db	'e interested -- an exhibit of \'Avatar artifacts\'!"'
	db	00
L04BF:	db	'Avatar artifacts'
	db	00
L04D0:	db	'"Come to the museum when it is open!"'
	db	00
L04F6:	db	'exhibits'
	db	00
L04FF:	db	'artifacts'
	db	00
L0509:	db	'"There are relics from early Britannia and even from the Thr'
	db	'ee Ages of Darkness -- back when Britannia was known as Sosa'
	db	'ria."'
	db	00
L0587:	db	'artifacts'
	db	00
L0591:	db	'Avatar artifacts'
	db	00
L05A2:	db	'"Well, thou surely must recognize them. They are supposed to'
	db	' be authentic! Things like the Silver Horn and the eight sto'
	db	'nes. I understand the stones were used for teleportation, an'
	db	'd if mages were not so sick in the head these days, they cou'
	db	'ld cast a \'Recall\' spell on them to teleport to specific p'
	db	'laces around Britannia. I believe if one casts a \'Mark\' sp'
	db	'ell on one, thou canst re-assign the teleportation location!'
	db	' But I suppose none of that works anymore."'
	db	00
L076E:	db	'Iolo whispers to you, "Er, Avatar, thou dost know that I do '
	db	'not condone stealing. But, er, I do believe these stones may'
	db	' be useful to us. Perhaps we should come back later when the'
	db	' museum is closed, if thou dost know what I mean? After all,'
	db	' these items technically belong to thee!"'
	db	00
L0888:	db	'Avatar artifacts'
	db	00
L0899:	db	'works of art'
	db	00
L08A6:	db	'"Britannia is proud of the artists who donate their works to'
	db	' the museum. Thou wilt see pieces all over the country by Br'
	db	'itannian artists Watson, Richard Fox, Randi Frank, Glen John'
	db	'son, and Denis Loubet."'
	db	00
L0972:	db	'works of art'
	db	00
L097F:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L098A:	db	'"We meet every evening at the Hall. Thou must come and visit'
	db	'!'
	db	00
L09C8:	db	'"Thou must know all about it by now! I hope to see thee at a'
	db	'n evening meeting!'
	db	00
L0A17:	db	'"The Fellowship has given me a great purpose in life. I have'
	db	' made new friends, and have even found love!" She giggles. "'
	db	'Ooops! I gave away my secret! I must not speak of it. Do for'
	db	'get I said that, please?"'
	db	00
L0AE5:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0AF0:	db	'secret'
	db	00
L0AF7:	db	'purpose'
	db	00
L0AFF:	db	'purpose'
	db	00
L0B07:	db	'"I want to attain a higher level of acceptance in The Fellow'
	db	'ship. I want to hear the \'voice\'. That is mine one true go'
	db	'al."'
	db	00
L0B82:	db	'purpose'
	db	00
L0B8A:	db	'voice'
	db	00
L0B90:	db	'voice'
	db	00
L0B96:	db	'"Dost thou not know? The longer one is a member of The Fello'
	db	'wship, the greater the chances that one will hear the \'voic'
	db	'e\'. Supposedly, it is a man\'s voice that thou wilt hear --'
	db	' perhaps in thy dreams, perhaps while thou art concentrating'
	db	' on something else -- it is a voice that tells thee things, '
	db	'suggests things. I do not know, really. I have not heard it '
	db	'yet, so I am only speaking of what I have heard from others '
	db	'more fortunate than I."'
	db	00
L0D4F:	db	'voice'
	db	00
L0D55:	db	'secret'
	db	00
L0D5C:	db	'"What secret? I do -not- have a secret! It was a slip of the'
	db	' tongue. I cannot really speak to anyone about it. Why, if w'
	db	'ord got out that the Mayor and I... I mean, uhm, -may- I... '
	db	'er, ask thee to forget that I said anything?"~~Candice turns'
	db	' beet red and turns away.*'
	db	00
L0E67:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0E6B:	db	'"Good day, Avatar."*'
	db	00
