L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see a fighter with intense eyes and a serious dispositio'
	db	'n.'
	db	00
L004C:	db	'"Yes, Avatar?" Denby asks.'
	db	00
L0067:	db	'name'
	db	00
L006C:	db	'"I am Denby."'
	db	00
L007A:	db	'name'
	db	00
L007F:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0083:	db	'"I am a trainer. I specialize in a form of combat which reli'
	db	'es on one\'s ability to use intelligence and physical abilit'
	db	'y to activate minor magical effects. But I am not a mage. I '
	db	'am a fighter."'
	db	00
L0145:	db	'train'
	db	00
L014B:	db	'fighter'
	db	00
L0153:	db	'magical effects'
	db	00
L0163:	db	'magical effects'
	db	00
L0173:	db	'"For example, I simply teach a combination of physical and m'
	db	'ental exercises which increases one\'s intelligence. This, i'
	db	'n turn, gives one an advantage if one desires to practice ma'
	db	'gic."'
	db	00
L022C:	db	'"Thou shouldst be aware, however, that magic is not working '
	db	'in Britannia these days. It is a dying phenomenon. No one un'
	db	'derstands why. Nevertheless, my training should increase any'
	db	' magic user\'s primary chances for casting a spell, as well '
	db	'as their fighting skill."'
	db	00
L0335:	db	'magical effects'
	db	00
L0345:	db	'fighter'
	db	00
L034D:	db	'"Although I am a fighter, I have dedicated my life to peace.'
	db	' There has been too much fighting in the world as it is. Let'
	db	' history take care of the adversarial qualities which exist '
	db	'in man. I believe in using my skills as a deterrent."'
	db	00
L0437:	db	'fighter'
	db	00
L043F:	db	'train'
	db	00
L0445:	db	'"My fee for training is 75 gold. Does this meet with the app'
	db	'roval of thy purse strings?"'
	db	00
L049E:	db	'Denby bows. "I am sorry my fee is too high for thee. Perhaps'
	db	' at another time thou wilt realize the value of my services.'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L0518:	db	'"Please return during daylight hours if thou dost wish to tr'
	db	'ain."'
	db	00
L055A:	db	'train'
	db	00
L0560:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0564:	db	'Denby puts his palms together and bows.*'
	db	00
