	.dsize       0AEDH
L0000:	db	'Coop is onstage with The Avatars. He sees you and says, "Uhm'
	db	', there is someone special listening tonight, and this next '
	db	'tune is dedicated to them."'
	db	00
L0094:	db	'He signals to his partners and they begin to play. He sings '
	db	'the following lyrics:'
	db	00
L00E6:	db	'"Across the country we do fly -- ~Best to heed our battle cr'
	db	'y!'
	db	00
L0125:	db	'"We fight for virtues, far and wide, ~And we cause the damse'
	db	'l\'s sigh."'
	db	00
L016C:	db	'Then Neno and Judith join in on the chorus:'
	db	00
L0198:	db	'"Oh, Avatars are we ~And virtuous we doth be!'
	db	00
L01C6:	db	'"Beware ye ogre and ye beast ~Lest thou be served at our nex'
	db	't feast!'
	db	00
L020B:	db	'"We rescue damsels, oh so fair, ~And battle pirates on a dar'
	db	'e!'
	db	00
L024A:	db	'"No evil liche doth daunt or sway! ~Against them all we win '
	db	'the day!'
	db	00
L028F:	db	'"We are the Av-atars! ~We are the Av-atars! ~We are the Aaaa'
	db	'-Vaaa-Taaars!"'
	db	00
L02DA:	db	'The applause is tumultuous.*'
	db	00
L02F7:	db	'"Hmmm. They must have seen thee coming, '
	db	00
L0320:	db	'."*'
	db	00
L0324:	db	'"Must not stop to speak now! I am late for a performance of '
	db	'The Avatars! Come and hear us play at The Blue Boar!"*'
	db	00
L0397:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L039B:	db	'job'
	db	00
L039F:	db	'name'
	db	00
L03A4:	db	'Iolo'
	db	00
L03A9:	db	'You see a young, wiry teen.'
	db	00
L03C5:	db	'"Hello, lad! This is '
	db	00
L03DB:	db	', the Avatar! This is my young apprentice, Coop. How go thin'
	db	'gs, Coop?"*'
	db	00
L0423:	db	'"Not too badly, milord. I sold a triple crossbow this mornin'
	db	'g."*'
	db	00
L0464:	db	'"Lovely! Lovely! Keep that gold coming in, that\'s what I al'
	db	'ways say!"*'
	db	00
L04AB:	db	'"Hello!" Coop says.'
	db	00
L04BF:	db	'name'
	db	00
L04C4:	db	'"My name is Coop."'
	db	00
L04D7:	db	'name'
	db	00
L04DC:	db	'job'
	db	00
L04E0:	db	'"I am the manager of Iolo\'s Bows! Master Iolo has entrusted'
	db	' me with this responsibility!'
	db	00
L0539:	db	'"If there is anything thou dost want in the way of bows and '
	db	'arrows, please say so!"'
	db	00
L058D:	db	'buy'
	db	00
L0591:	db	'bows and arrows'
	db	00
L05A1:	db	'"Thou must come by the shoppe when it is open!"'
	db	00
L05D1:	db	'responsibility'
	db	00
L05E0:	db	'Iolo\'s Bows'
	db	00
L05EC:	db	'Iolo\'s Bows'
	db	00
L05F8:	db	'"Iolo opened this shoppe many, many years ago. He opened Iol'
	db	'o\'s South in Serpent\'s Hold more recently. He is becoming '
	db	'quite an entrepreneur!"'
	db	00
L0686:	db	'Iolo\'s Bows'
	db	00
L0692:	db	'responsibility'
	db	00
L06A1:	db	'"I sell many goods but I also plan to perpetuate the good na'
	db	'me of Iolo by becoming a master archer! Iolo has taught me w'
	db	'ell!"*'
	db	00
L0720:	db	'"Yes, the lad is good! He was good before I taught him the f'
	db	'irst lesson."*'
	db	00
L076B:	db	'"What I would not give to join thy group and go adventuring!'
	db	' But, then there would be no one to run the shoppe. So I can'
	db	'not go. But someday... Anyway, I please myself in the evenin'
	db	'gs by singing with a musical group."'
	db	00
L0844:	db	'responsibility'
	db	00
L0853:	db	'singing'
	db	00
L085B:	db	'Iolo'
	db	00
L0860:	db	'"Hello, boss!"*'
	db	00
L0870:	db	'"Greetings, lad. Thou art looking well."*'
	db	00
L089A:	db	'"The same to thee, milord!"*'
	db	00
L08B7:	db	'Iolo'
	db	00
L08BC:	db	'singing'
	db	00
L08C4:	db	'"My group is called... well, it is called \'The Avatars\'. I'
	db	' hope that does not offend thee."'
	db	00
L0920:	db	'singing'
	db	00
L0928:	db	'The Avatars'
	db	00
L0934:	db	'The Avatars'
	db	00
L0940:	db	'"The band is just me and two musicians from The Music Hall. '
	db	'We play at the Blue Boar every night. I sing and write lyric'
	db	's. The other two play the instruments. Please come to hear u'
	db	's!"'
	db	00
L09F8:	db	'The Avatars'
	db	00
L0A04:	db	'bows and arrows'
	db	00
L0A14:	db	'"We sell all kinds of bows, along with arrows and bolts. If '
	db	'thou dost wish to buy something, please say so!"'
	db	00
L0A81:	db	'bows and arrows'
	db	00
L0A91:	db	'buy'
	db	00
L0A95:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0A99:	db	'"Goodbye!"*'
	db	00
L0AA5:	db	'@Arrows? Bows?@'
	db	00
L0AB5:	db	'@Iolo\'s is open!@'
	db	00
L0AC7:	db	'@Bolts? Arrows?@'
	db	00
L0AD8:	db	'@Archery equipment!@'
	db	00
