L0000:	db	'Grayson shushes you, as you are disturbing the Fellowship me'
	db	'eting.*'
	db	00
L0044:	db	'"Now where could that Batlin be? I suppose we shall have to '
	db	'have the meeting without him!"'
	db	00
L009F:	db	'"I must run! I must run! I must! I must! I am late for the F'
	db	'ellowship meeting!"*'
	db	00
L00F0:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L00F4:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00F8:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00FD:	db	'You see a shrewd-looking man who smiles as if he has just se'
	db	'en his next customer.'
	db	00
L014F:	db	'"Hello again, my good friend," says Grayson.'
	db	00
L017C:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0181:	db	'"I am Grayson, '
	db	00
L0191:	db	'. A humble and honest man."'
	db	00
L01AD:	db	'name'
	db	00
L01B2:	db	'job'
	db	00
L01B6:	db	'"Why, here in Britain I sell the best armour and weapons tha'
	db	't money can buy. In my spare time, I do deeds for The Fellow'
	db	'ship."'
	db	00
L0235:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0240:	db	'buy'
	db	00
L0244:	db	'armour'
	db	00
L024B:	db	'Grayson looks you up and down. "Dost thou truly believe that'
	db	' thou art sufficiently protected in what thou art wearing? I'
	db	'n truth I fear for thy safety if thou shouldst become involv'
	db	'ed in combat. Are thou interested in buying something today?'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L033D:	db	'"Another time, then."'
	db	00
L0353:	db	'armour'
	db	00
L035A:	db	'weapons'
	db	00
L0362:	db	'After looking at you, Grayson says, "I can see that thou art'
	db	' in sore need of weaponry. Dost thou want to buy something t'
	db	'oday?"'
	db	00
L03E1:	db	'"Another time, then."'
	db	00
L03F7:	db	'weapons'
	db	00
L03FF:	db	'buy'
	db	00
L0403:	db	'"I sell a complete line of armour and weapons."'
	db	00
L0433:	db	'"Which wouldst thou care to inspect?"'
	db	00
L0459:	db	'weapons'
	db	00
L0461:	db	'armour'
	db	00
L0468:	db	'"Please come to the shop when it is open."'
	db	00
L0493:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L049E:	db	'"I see that thou art a member of The Fellowship!"'
	db	00
L04D0:	db	'"It has been very beneficial in my life. I was on the verge '
	db	'of going out of business before I joined and now I am more p'
	db	'rosperous than ever before."'
	db	00
L0565:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0570:	db	'out of business'
	db	00
L0580:	db	'beneficial'
	db	00
L058B:	db	'beneficial'
	db	00
L0596:	db	'"I was never sufficiently forward or aggressive enough to be'
	db	' successful as a merchant but The Fellowship changed all tha'
	db	't for me."'
	db	00
L0619:	db	'beneficial'
	db	00
L0624:	db	'changed'
	db	00
L062C:	db	'changed'
	db	00
L0634:	db	'"By applying the values of the Triad of Inner Strength to my'
	db	' life I have accomplished what I have set out to do with my '
	db	'life. Mine armour and weapon shop is successful and I have a'
	db	' place where I belong in The Fellowship."'
	db	00
L0712:	db	'changed'
	db	00
L071A:	db	'out of business'
	db	00
L072A:	db	'"Thou dost see, I am convinced that my failures were all due'
	db	' to my bad attitude. It took the teachings of The Fellowship'
	db	' to change the way I used my mind and to turn me in the prop'
	db	'er direction."'
	db	00
L07ED:	db	'out of business'
	db	00
L07FD:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0801:	db	'"Goodbye and farewell, '
	db	00
L0819:	db	'."*'
	db	00
L081D:	db	'@Weapons?@'
	db	00
L0828:	db	'@Armour?@'
	db	00
L0832:	db	'@Something to equip thee?@'
	db	00
L084D:	db	'@Need a weapon?@'
	db	00
