L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'absent-minded'
	db	00
L001B:	db	'You see an elderly man with good humor and a warm smile.'
	db	00
L0054:	db	'"Yes, Avatar?" Bennie asks with authority.'
	db	00
L007F:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0084:	db	'"All my friends call me Bennie."'
	db	00
L00A5:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00AA:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00AE:	db	'"I am the Head Servant at the castle. My job consists of kee'
	db	'ping the other servants in line and serving the meals."'
	db	00
L0122:	db	'meals'
	db	00
L0128:	db	'Head Servant'
	db	00
L0135:	db	'Head Servant'
	db	00
L0142:	db	'"Yes, I have been Head Servant for many years. Mine entire f'
	db	'amily works for Lord British. My son is the king\'s gentlema'
	db	'n\'s gentleman. My daughter is the Royal Chambermaid. My wif'
	db	'e is Head Cook. We are pleased to work for Lord British."'
	db	00
L022E:	db	'Head Servant'
	db	00
L023B:	db	'meals'
	db	00
L0241:	db	'"My wife, Boots, is the head cook. Her specialty is roast be'
	db	'ef. She makes wonderful pastries, too. Enough of those will '
	db	'give thee a very un-Avatar-like figure!'
	db	00
L02E1:	db	'"Wouldst thou like to order a meal?"'
	db	00
L0306:	db	'"For thee, it is free!"~~Bennie serves you and your party a '
	db	'delicious meal of beef and pastry.'
	db	00
L0365:	db	'"Return tomorrow and thou canst have another free meal."'
	db	00
L039E:	db	'"Thou art carrying too much to take the beef and pastry!"'
	db	00
L03D8:	db	'"I am sorry, '
	db	00
L03E6:	db	', but I am allowed to serve thee only once per day. Return t'
	db	'omorrow for a meal."'
	db	00
L0437:	db	'"Oh. Well, thou must return when thou art hungry."'
	db	00
L046A:	db	'"Come to the dining room during breakfast or dinner and I wi'
	db	'll be most honored to serve thee!"'
	db	00
L04C9:	db	'meals'
	db	00
L04CF:	db	'absent-minded'
	db	00
L04DD:	db	'"Yes, I suppose I am. I am also becoming a little hard-of-he'
	db	'aring. When thou hast seen as many years as I have, one\'s f'
	db	'aculties are no longer perfect."'
	db	00
L0575:	db	'absent-minded'
	db	00
L0583:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0587:	db	'"Safe journeys, '
	db	00
L0598:	db	'."*'
	db	00
