L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'Rayburt'
	db	00
L0015:	db	'You see a friendly woman in her thirties.'
	db	00
L003F:	db	'"Greetings, again!" Pamela says.'
	db	00
L0060:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0065:	db	'"I am Pamela!"'
	db	00
L0074:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0079:	db	'Rayburt'
	db	00
L0081:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0085:	db	'"I am the Innkeeper at the Out\'n\'Inn."'
	db	00
L00AC:	db	'"If thou wouldst like a room, just say so!"'
	db	00
L00D8:	db	'room'
	db	00
L00DD:	db	'"Please come by if thou wouldst like to rest thy weary feet '
	db	'for the night!"'
	db	00
L0129:	db	'Out\'n Inn'
	db	00
L0133:	db	'room'
	db	00
L0138:	db	'"The room is quite inexpensive. Only 8 gold per person. Want'
	db	' one?"'
	db	00
L017B:	db	'"Thou art carrying too much to take the room key!"'
	db	00
L01AE:	db	'"Here is thy room key. It is good only until thou leavest."'
	db	00
L01EA:	db	'"Thou dost not have enough gold, eh? Too bad."'
	db	00
L0219:	db	'"Another night, then."'
	db	00
L0230:	db	'room'
	db	00
L0235:	db	'Out\'n Inn'
	db	00
L023F:	db	'"Well... Cove is the city of Love and Passion, didst thou no'
	db	't know? Thou must be careful. If thou dost stay too long in '
	db	'Cove, thou wilt fall in love with someone! Mark my words!"'
	db	00
L02F2:	db	'Out\'n Inn'
	db	00
L02FC:	db	'Rayburt'
	db	00
L0304:	db	'"Oooh, he is such a wonderful man, dost thou not think? He i'
	db	's so intense and serious. Handsome, too! Oh, and\tI like Reg'
	db	'al as well."'
	db	00
L0388:	db	'Rayburt'
	db	00
L0390:	db	'Regal'
	db	00
L0396:	db	'Regal'
	db	00
L039C:	db	'"As far as dogs go, he is handsome, too!"'
	db	00
L03C6:	db	'Regal'
	db	00
L03CC:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L03D0:	db	'"See thee soon!"*'
	db	00
