L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'Caddellite'
	db	00
L0018:	db	'You see a man whose long hours of difficult, smouldering wor'
	db	'k have frozen his face into a rigid expression with eyes lik'
	db	'e hot coals.'
	db	00
L009D:	db	'"How may I serve thee?" says Zorn.'
	db	00
L00C0:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00C5:	db	'"I am Zorn."'
	db	00
L00D2:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00D7:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00DB:	db	'"I am the blacksmith of Minoc."'
	db	00
L00FB:	db	'Minoc'
	db	00
L0101:	db	'blacksmith'
	db	00
L010C:	db	'"Dost thou have no respect for the dead? Indeed, trying to s'
	db	'olicit at a terrible time like this! When people have been f'
	db	'ound murdered over at William\'s sawmill!"'
	db	00
L01AE:	db	'murders'
	db	00
L01B6:	db	'blacksmith'
	db	00
L01C1:	db	'"I make weapons and armour."'
	db	00
L01DE:	db	'blacksmith'
	db	00
L01E9:	db	'weapons and armour'
	db	00
L01FC:	db	'Minoc'
	db	00
L0202:	db	'"Minoc is quite a city. Money changes hands here. But it doe'
	db	's not keep people happy. They find something to squabble ove'
	db	'r. And now these terrible murders have everyone afraid."'
	db	00
L02B3:	db	'Minoc'
	db	00
L02B9:	db	'murders'
	db	00
L02C1:	db	'squabble'
	db	00
L02CA:	db	'weapons and armour'
	db	00
L02DD:	db	'"All of the weapons and armour I sell are made by mine own h'
	db	'and. They would serve thee well."'
	db	00
L033B:	db	'buy armour'
	db	00
L0346:	db	'buy weapons'
	db	00
L0352:	db	'"Perhaps we could speak more of these things another time. S'
	db	'ay, perhaps during the business hours of my shop?"'
	db	00
L03C1:	db	'weapons and armour'
	db	00
L03D4:	db	'buy weapons'
	db	00
L03E0:	db	'"The smithy is currently closed for outside business. Thou s'
	db	'halt have to return some other time."'
	db	00
L0442:	db	'"I have an assortment of very lethal weapons to show thee."'
	db	00
L047E:	db	'buy armour'
	db	00
L0489:	db	'"The smithy is currently closed for outside business. Thou s'
	db	'halt have to return some other time."'
	db	00
L04EB:	db	'"Thou mayest buy fine armour from me."'
	db	00
L0512:	db	'squabble'
	db	00
L051B:	db	'"This noise over Owen\'s monument, for instance. People ough'
	db	't to tend to their own business and let others handle their '
	db	'own, foolish or not."'
	db	00
L05A8:	db	'monument'
	db	00
L05B1:	db	'Owen'
	db	00
L05B6:	db	'squabble'
	db	00
L05BF:	db	'Owen'
	db	00
L05C4:	db	'"He is our town shipwright. He is a man who has an exceeding'
	db	'ly high opinion of himself."'
	db	00
L061D:	db	'Owen'
	db	00
L0622:	db	'monument'
	db	00
L062B:	db	'"Owen is building a monument to himself. It is forty feet ta'
	db	'll, depicting him holding up a roll of plans. Pigeons will h'
	db	'ave a place to sit, forevermore. Why argue over something as'
	db	' unimportant as that?"'
	db	00
L06F6:	db	'monument'
	db	00
L06FF:	db	'murders'
	db	00
L0707:	db	'"No one in this town ever really hated the gypsies, at least'
	db	' not that I have ever been aware of. Who could have done suc'
	db	'h a thing?"'
	db	00
L078B:	db	'murders'
	db	00
L0793:	db	'Caddellite'
	db	00
L079E:	db	'You present the Caddellite to Zorn. "This is amazing! Why I '
	db	'thought that the only place to find Caddellite was the lost '
	db	'island of Ambrosia. What should I make with this?"'
	db	00
L0849:	db	'Caddellite'
	db	00
L0854:	db	'helmet'
	db	00
L085B:	db	'helmet'
	db	00
L0862:	db	'You describe the sort of helmet that you require, one that c'
	db	'an block out the dangerous sound from the cube generator. Zo'
	db	'rn nods. "Yes, I can make some for thee. I shall start work '
	db	'immediately."'
	db	00
L0924:	db	'"But thou dost not have any Caddellite chunks with which to '
	db	'make helmets!"'
	db	00
L096F:	db	'"Thou hast '
	db	00
L097B:	db	' in thy party. I am afraid thou does not have enough Caddell'
	db	'ite for me to make that many helmets."'
	db	00
L09DE:	db	'Zorn takes the Caddellite from you and begins his work.'
	db	00
L0A16:	db	'"Thou hast '
	db	00
L0A22:	db	' Caddellite chunks. That is how many helmets I can make for '
	db	'thee."'
	db	00
L0A65:	db	'Zorn takes the Caddellite from you and begins his work. You '
	db	'watch in fascination as the master blacksmith softens the or'
	db	'e in the fire, then molds it into\tshape. Zorn quickly takes'
	db	' the necessary measurements, then makes some adjustments wit'
	db	'h the hot material. Finally, it is done.'
	db	00
L0B7D:	db	'Zorn dips the helmet in water to cool it.'
	db	00
L0BA7:	db	'Zorn dips the helmets in water to cool them.'
	db	00
L0BD4:	db	'"Here, I have met thy request to thy precise specifications.'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L0C12:	db	'He hands you the helmet.'
	db	00
L0C2B:	db	'He hands you the helmets.'
	db	00
L0C45:	db	'"Thou art too encumbered!"'
	db	00
L0C60:	db	'helmet'
	db	00
L0C67:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0C6B:	db	'"Goodbye, '
	db	00
L0C76:	db	'."*'
	db	00
L0C7A:	db	'@Weapons?@'
	db	00
L0C85:	db	'@Armour?@'
	db	00
L0C8F:	db	'@Helms? Shields?@'
	db	00
L0CA1:	db	'@Need armour or weapons?@'
	db	00
