	; Function at file offset 00083A34H
	.funcnumber  0461H
	.data
	.msize       08C9H
	.dsize       0778H
L0000:	db	'Mikos is lost in meditation at the Fellowship meeting and do'
	db	'es not hear you.*'
	db	00
L004E:	db	'"I must run to the Fellowship meeting! I shall speak with th'
	db	'ee another time!"*'
	db	00
L009D:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L00A1:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00A5:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00AA:	db	'silver fluid'
	db	00
L00B7:	db	'A sneering man watches as you approach. His eyes shift back '
	db	'and forth suspiciously.'
	db	00
L010B:	db	'Mikos heaves his shoulders and sighs. "What dost thou want t'
	db	'his time?"'
	db	00
L0152:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0157:	db	'"I am Mikos."'
	db	00
L0165:	db	'name'
	db	00
L016A:	db	'job'
	db	00
L016E:	db	'"I am the foreman of the Minoc mine."'
	db	00
L0194:	db	'mine'
	db	00
L0199:	db	'Minoc'
	db	00
L019F:	db	'Minoc'
	db	00
L01A5:	db	'He spits on the ground. "A pox on them! Down here I am safe '
	db	'from all of their arguing. Next, they will be killing each o'
	db	'ther."'
	db	00
L0224:	db	'Minoc'
	db	00
L022A:	db	'mine'
	db	00
L022F:	db	'"This mine is run by the Britannian Mining Company. It is in'
	db	'side what was once the dungeon Covetous. They mine for iron '
	db	'ore, lead and other minerals with highly trained miners and '
	db	'special mining machinery."'
	db	00
L02FE:	db	'mine'
	db	00
L0303:	db	'machinery'
	db	00
L030D:	db	'miners'
	db	00
L0314:	db	'miners'
	db	00
L031B:	db	'"Currently most of the miners are away as the machines are b'
	db	'eing repaired. Right now we have two engineers, Owings and M'
	db	'alloy, down in a branch of the main tunnel. Do not disturb t'
	db	'hem, for they are involved in a special project. We also hav'
	db	'e a gargoyle, Fodus, who is helping to maintain a semblance '
	db	'of the mine\'s usual operations."'
	db	00
L0468:	db	'miners'
	db	00
L046F:	db	'Owings and Malloy'
	db	00
L0481:	db	'machinery'
	db	00
L048B:	db	'"This place is full of machinery that is very dangerous if t'
	db	'hou dost not know what thou art doing. Thou dost not wish to'
	db	' see what one of those digging contraptions can do to a man '
	db	'if he gets too close!"'
	db	00
L0556:	db	'machinery'
	db	00
L0560:	db	'Owings and Malloy'
	db	00
L0572:	db	'Mikos shakes his head slowly. "I am not sure where the Brita'
	db	'nnian Mining Company found them."'
	db	00
L05D0:	db	'Owings and Malloy'
	db	00
L05E2:	db	'silver fluid'
	db	00
L05EF:	db	'You repeat the words to Mikos that you heard Fodus say. Miko'
	db	's gives you a shocked look. "I have no idea what he is talki'
	db	'ng about, but I would say it is typical for a gargoyle. Just'
	db	' trying to shirk of his duty. Say, thou hadst better leave t'
	db	'his place if thou ist spending all thy time disrupting the w'
	db	'ork of the mine!"*'
	db	00
L072E:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0732:	db	'"Do not wander around down here, '
	db	00
L0754:	db	'. Thou shouldst leave right away."*'
	db	00
