L0000:	db	'You see a wingless gargoyle with a terrible skin disease. It'
	db	' looks as if his face is falling off in patches.'
	db	00
L006D:	db	'"To want something else?" Fodus asks.'
	db	00
L0093:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0097:	db	'job'
	db	00
L009B:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00A0:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00A5:	db	'"To be named Fodus."'
	db	00
L00BA:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00BF:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00C3:	db	'"To be a digger in the mines. To be looking for iron ore and'
	db	' lead and..."'
	db	00
L010D:	db	'and...'
	db	00
L0114:	db	'and...'
	db	00
L011B:	db	'"The secret ore..."'
	db	00
L012F:	db	'A wave of delirium passes over the gargoyle. "To... to be go'
	db	'ing back to work now, Mikos!... To be working hard!... To ha'
	db	've no need to give me any more of the the silver fluid..."'
	db	00
L01E2:	db	'and...'
	db	00
L01E9:	db	'silver fluid'
	db	00
L01F6:	db	'secret ore'
	db	00
L0201:	db	'secret ore'
	db	00
L020C:	db	'"To be called... blackrock."'
	db	00
L0229:	db	'secret ore'
	db	00
L0234:	db	'blackrock'
	db	00
L023E:	db	'blackrock'
	db	00
L0248:	db	'"To be the lode located in a hidden area of the mine..." The'
	db	' gargoyle\'s eyes roll up into his head. He is obviously sic'
	db	'k.'
	db	00
L02C2:	db	'blackrock'
	db	00
L02CC:	db	'silver fluid'
	db	00
L02D9:	db	'"To need the venom... to have more venom..."'
	db	00
L0306:	db	'silver fluid'
	db	00
L0313:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0317:	db	'"To be going back to work now, Mikos..."*'
	db	00
