	.dsize       0766H
L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see a man leaning on a longbow.'
	db	00
L0031:	db	'Bradman greets you. "Hail, '
	db	00
L004D:	db	'."'
	db	00
L0050:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0055:	db	'"I am Bradman."'
	db	00
L0065:	db	'name'
	db	00
L006A:	db	'job'
	db	00
L006E:	db	'"Why, \'tis my job to train the many who visit Yew to become'
	db	' more agile."'
	db	00
L00B7:	db	'many'
	db	00
L00BC:	db	'train'
	db	00
L00C2:	db	'Yew'
	db	00
L00C6:	db	'Penni'
	db	00
L00CC:	db	'many'
	db	00
L00D1:	db	'"The forest attracts a lot of people who want to spend some '
	db	'time away from the larger towns like Minoc and Britain. So t'
	db	'hey come to Yew.~~"And, something about the woods makes most'
	db	' people want to explore." He pats his bow.~~"That is where t'
	db	'his comes in. The bow is the tool of survival in the forest.'
	db	' And I," he jerks his thumb to his chest, "teach proficiency'
	db	' with the bow."'
	db	00
L0249:	db	'many'
	db	00
L024E:	db	'bow'
	db	00
L0252:	db	'explore'
	db	00
L025A:	db	'explore'
	db	00
L0262:	db	'"There are many exciting things to see in the forest. Not a '
	db	'day goes by when I do not see something interesting: a new t'
	db	'ype of bird, a beautiful butterfly, or, best of all -- a dee'
	db	'r."'
	db	00
L031A:	db	'explore'
	db	00
L0322:	db	'bow'
	db	00
L0326:	db	'"\'Tis my weapon of choice. It takes a keen eye and a steady'
	db	' arm to shoot accurately. I think it has more finesse than a'
	db	' sword or a spear, for example."'
	db	00
L03BE:	db	'bow'
	db	00
L03C2:	db	'Yew'
	db	00
L03C6:	db	'"I love the forest. It is very beautiful. Also," he raises h'
	db	'is bow, "I moved out here to be near the two great archers, '
	db	'Iolo and Tseramed."*'
	db	00
L0453:	db	'Iolo blushes. "I am honored, my friend. I was not aware I ha'
	db	'd an admirer in this part of the land." He bows to Bradman, '
	db	'who returns the gesture.*'
	db	00
L04E5:	db	'"Thank you for thy kind words, good sir. Perhaps we may prac'
	db	'tice sometime in the future."*'
	db	00
L0540:	db	'"I would be greatly honored, milord!"'
	db	00
L0566:	db	'Tseramed'
	db	00
L056F:	db	'Yew'
	db	00
L0573:	db	'Tseramed'
	db	00
L057C:	db	'"He is a great archer who resides in the forest. He moved he'
	db	're to get away from the far-too-quickly growing towns."'
	db	00
L05F0:	db	'Tseramed'
	db	00
L05F9:	db	'train'
	db	00
L05FF:	db	'"If thou wantest to train, my charge is 30 gold. Art thou st'
	db	'ill interested?"'
	db	00
L064C:	db	'"I understand, '
	db	00
L065C:	db	'."'
	db	00
L065F:	db	'Penni'
	db	00
L0665:	db	'"Thou hast met Penni? I hope thou hast not trained with her,'
	db	'" he winks. "She is a valuable friend, but she hunts as well'
	db	' as a weed and she is as clumsy as an ox. I am afraid she kn'
	db	'ows nothing about fighting."'
	db	00
L0736:	db	'Penni'
	db	00
L073C:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0740:	db	'"May the trees part around thee, '
	db	00
L0762:	db	'."*'
	db	00
