L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'At your approach, the woman raises her eyebrows to indicate '
	db	'she is aware of your presence and interested in what you are'
	db	' about to say.'
	db	00
L0094:	db	'"And how may I help thee, '
	db	00
L00AF:	db	'?" asks Carlyn.'
	db	00
L00BF:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00C4:	db	'"I am Carlyn." She smiles broadly.'
	db	00
L00E7:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00EC:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00F0:	db	'"I am the tailor of Moonglow."'
	db	00
L010F:	db	'"I also tend the bar for Phearcy in the evenings."'
	db	00
L0142:	db	'buy refreshment'
	db	00
L0152:	db	'Phearcy'
	db	00
L015A:	db	'Moonglow'
	db	00
L0163:	db	'tailor'
	db	00
L016A:	db	'buy refreshment'
	db	00
L017A:	db	'"Wouldst thou prefer food or drink, '
	db	00
L019F:	db	'?"'
	db	00
L01A2:	db	'drink'
	db	00
L01A8:	db	'food'
	db	00
L01AD:	db	'buy refreshment'
	db	00
L01BD:	db	'food'
	db	00
L01C2:	db	'food'
	db	00
L01C7:	db	'drink'
	db	00
L01CD:	db	'drink'
	db	00
L01D3:	db	'Phearcy'
	db	00
L01DB:	db	'here'
	db	00
L01E0:	db	'at the Friendly Knave'
	db	00
L01F6:	db	'"He is the owner and bartender. Every night at 9, he goes to'
	db	' the Fellowship meetings, so I serve refreshment for him '
	db	00
L026C:	db	'."'
	db	00
L026F:	db	'Phearcy'
	db	00
L0277:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0282:	db	'Moonglow'
	db	00
L028B:	db	'"\'Tis a very pleasant town, '
	db	00
L02A8:	db	'. There are so many different types of people here. I wish I'
	db	' knew more of them.~~"If thou hast any questions about them,'
	db	' I highly recommend to thee that thou speakest with Phearcy.'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L035E:	db	'Phearcy'
	db	00
L0366:	db	'Moonglow'
	db	00
L036F:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L037A:	db	'"I know little about the group. Every night at 9 they have a'
	db	' meeting or some such of all the members. And, if I remember'
	db	' correctly, the leader of that branch doth give a speech -- '
	db	'a sermon is what I believe it is called.~~"There is another '
	db	'member in town, if thou hast questions about The Fellowship.'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L04A8:	db	'leader'
	db	00
L04AF:	db	'another'
	db	00
L04B7:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L04C2:	db	'another'
	db	00
L04CA:	db	'"I believe his name is Tolemac. He is a farmer, from what I '
	db	'have heard. Phearcy would know more than I. Or thou couldst '
	db	'ask their clerk."'
	db	00
L0554:	db	'clerk'
	db	00
L055A:	db	'another'
	db	00
L0562:	db	'clerk'
	db	00
L0568:	db	'"\'Tis a woman, I know that, but I do not know her name."'
	db	00
L05A1:	db	'clerk'
	db	00
L05A7:	db	'leader'
	db	00
L05AE:	db	'"His name is Rankin. I do not believe he has been here terri'
	db	'bly long."'
	db	00
L05F5:	db	'leader'
	db	00
L05FC:	db	'tailor'
	db	00
L0603:	db	'"Yes, I love sewing clothing. Wouldst thou be interested in '
	db	'seeing or purchasing some of my creations?"'
	db	00
L066B:	db	'Shock covers her face.~~"Well," she huffs.'
	db	00
L0696:	db	'"Yes, '
	db	00
L069D:	db	'. \'Tis my job, and my passion. I love sewing clothing. If t'
	db	'hou were to come to my shop when it was open, I could show t'
	db	'hee many exquisite things."'
	db	00
L0730:	db	'tailor'
	db	00
L0737:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L073B:	db	'"Fare thee well, '
	db	00
L074D:	db	'."*'
	db	00
