L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'Gorn'
	db	00
L0012:	db	'You see a striking woman in fighter\'s gear. She looks at yo'
	db	'u fiercely.'
	db	00
L0059:	db	'"Halt!"'
	db	00
L0061:	db	'"What dost thou want?" Iriale demands.'
	db	00
L0088:	db	'name'
	db	00
L008D:	db	'"I am called Iriale Silvermist. Who art thou?"'
	db	00
L00BC:	db	'The Avatar'
	db	00
L00C7:	db	'"I do not know thee!"'
	db	00
L00DD:	db	'The Avatar'
	db	00
L00E8:	db	'"I do not approve of jokes."'
	db	00
L0105:	db	'name'
	db	00
L010A:	db	'job'
	db	00
L010E:	db	'Iriale smiles devilishly.~~"I bar people from entering. Thou'
	db	' hast disobeyed the rule of the Meditation Retreat. Ian will'
	db	' be most displeased. Thou had best leave now."'
	db	00
L01B5:	db	'Meditation Retreat'
	db	00
L01C8:	db	'rule'
	db	00
L01CD:	db	'rule'
	db	00
L01D2:	db	'"Thou dost know it. Attendees of the Retreat must stay out o'
	db	'f this cave."'
	db	00
L021C:	db	'rule'
	db	00
L0221:	db	'"Come, '
	db	00
L0229:	db	', we had better leave. I believe this woman is serious."'
	db	00
L0262:	db	'Gorn'
	db	00
L0267:	db	'"Is that the name of that smelly barbarian who was here? If '
	db	'thou dost see him on the -way out-, tell him that if he appr'
	db	'oaches me again, I shall cut off his head!"'
	db	00
L030B:	db	'Gorn'
	db	00
L0310:	db	'Meditation Retreat'
	db	00
L0323:	db	'"Yes, I work for the Meditation Retreat.~~"And I work for -h'
	db	'im-. -He- does not want thee here. I give thee only one chan'
	db	'ce to turn around and leave.'
	db	00
L03B8:	db	'"Wilt thou leave?"'
	db	00
L03CB:	db	'"Do so and I shall spare thee!" She watches as you turn away'
	db	'.*'
	db	00
L040A:	db	'She sees your jaw set with determination and nods her head. '
	db	'"Then die, foolish one!"*'
	db	00
L0460:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0464:	db	'"Away with thee!"*'
	db	00
