L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'blackrock'
	db	00
L0017:	db	'ring'
	db	00
L001C:	db	'The mage, having been asleep for 200 years, looks just as sh'
	db	'e did upon your last visit to Britannia.~~"Avatar! I cannot '
	db	'believe \'tis thee! Thou didst come and wake me! I knew thee'
	db	' would!"'
	db	00
L00D8:	db	'Suddenly, Penumbra grabs her head in pain. "Oh!" she cries. '
	db	'"Mine head! The pain! What is happening? What didst thou do '
	db	'to me?" She closes her eyes and concentrates. "There is a di'
	db	'sturbance in the ether! I can feel my magical powers fading!'
	db	' Help me, '
	db	00
L01D3:	db	'! Help me!!"'
	db	00
L01E0:	db	'ether'
	db	00
L01E6:	db	'Penumbra is in so much pain she can barely speak. "Yes, '
	db	00
L021F:	db	'?"'
	db	00
L0222:	db	'"Oh! I feel so much better! The pain is ebbing. Now we may c'
	db	'onverse much more easily."'
	db	00
L0279:	db	'"Yes, '
	db	00
L0280:	db	'?"'
	db	00
L0283:	db	'ether'
	db	00
L0289:	db	'name'
	db	00
L028E:	db	'"I am Penumbra. Surely thou dost remember me?"'
	db	00
L02BD:	db	'name'
	db	00
L02C2:	db	'job'
	db	00
L02C6:	db	'Penumbra is in pain. "I cannot think straight whilst the eth'
	db	'er is disturbed. I can do nothing until it is flowing smooth'
	db	'ly again!"'
	db	00
L0349:	db	'"I am a practicing mage. Once I get my business going again,'
	db	' I should be able to sell spells and reagents. After all, I '
	db	'have been asleep for 200 years!"'
	db	00
L03E2:	db	'ether'
	db	00
L03E8:	db	'"The ether controls all the magic in the world. When there i'
	db	's a disturbance in the ether, no mage can cast successful sp'
	db	'ells. A mage might even lose his mind after a long period of'
	db	' time! Thou must find a way to protect me from the warped et'
	db	'hereal waves!"'
	db	00
L04E7:	db	'protect'
	db	00
L04EF:	db	'"I feel much better. The damaged ethereal waves are not stri'
	db	'king my mind. But now we must destroy what is causing this p'
	db	'roblem!"'
	db	00
L0570:	db	'Penumbra thinks a moment. "I feel that the damaged ethereal '
	db	'waves are coming from a source very near here. I suspect the'
	db	're is something in a dungeon on these islands that is creati'
	db	'ng the havoc. Try Dungeon Deceit. I have a strong sense that'
	db	' thy goal is there.'
	db	00
L0674:	db	'She closes her eyes a moment.'
	db	00
L0692:	db	'"In my mind\'s eye, I see a large object shaped like a tetra'
	db	'hedron. I am beginning to understand what this is."'
	db	00
L0701:	db	'"In my mind\'s eye, I see a large object in a dungeon north '
	db	'of here. Thou dost know of what I speak, dost thou not?"'
	db	00
L0775:	db	'Tetrahedron'
	db	00
L0781:	db	'"The ether is flowing smoothly now. I thank thee, '
	db	00
L07B4:	db	'. Thou hast saved all mages everywhere!"'
	db	00
L07DD:	db	'ether'
	db	00
L07E3:	db	'Draxinusom'
	db	00
L07EE:	db	'"Thou shalt find him on the island of Terfin. Ask him about '
	db	'the ring."'
	db	00
L0835:	db	'Draxinusom'
	db	00
L0840:	db	'Tetrahedron'
	db	00
L084C:	db	'"Please! I cannot help thee until I am protected from the da'
	db	'maged ether!"'
	db	00
L0896:	db	'"Yes, that is the shape of the thing I have seen in my mind'
	db	'\'s eye. It appears to be some type of magic generator which'
	db	' damages the ethereal flow."'
	db	00
L0929:	db	'Penumbra thinks a moment. "This generator is producing dange'
	db	'rous ethereal waves. Thou must find the Ethereal Ring and we'
	db	'ar it to break the generator\'s defense. Now where is that r'
	db	'ing...?"'
	db	00
L09E5:	db	'Penumbra consults some books and cross references them with '
	db	'a map. "I believe that the Ethereal Ring was last in the pos'
	db	'session of King Draxinusom of the Gargoyles. Once thou hast '
	db	'found the ring, thou must bring it back to me. I must perfor'
	db	'm an enchantment upon it so that it may work for thee."'
	db	00
L0B0D:	db	'Draxinusom'
	db	00
L0B18:	db	'"The enchanted ring shall protect thee."'
	db	00
L0B41:	db	'"The ethereal ring must be enchanted."'
	db	00
L0B68:	db	'ring'
	db	00
L0B6D:	db	'"Thou hast destroyed it! All the mages thank thee!"'
	db	00
L0BA1:	db	'Tetrahedron'
	db	00
L0BAD:	db	'protect'
	db	00
L0BB5:	db	'"I need some kind of barrier to protect me from the ethereal'
	db	' waves. There must be a material we could use!"~~ Penumbra c'
	db	'lutches her temples. She is obviously in great pain.'
	db	00
L0C62:	db	'"Dost thou know of a material that is impenetrable?"'
	db	00
L0C97:	db	'"What is it?"'
	db	00
L0CA5:	db	'lead'
	db	00
L0CAA:	db	'blackrock'
	db	00
L0CB4:	db	'gold'
	db	00
L0CB9:	db	'iron ore'
	db	00
L0CC2:	db	'blackrock'
	db	00
L0CCC:	db	'"Yes! That is what we need!'
	db	00
L0CE8:	db	'"No, I do not think that will work. Oh, I cannot think, the '
	db	'pain is so great!'
	db	00
L0D36:	db	'"There must be something! Oh, I cannot think, the pain is so'
	db	' great!'
	db	00
L0D7A:	db	'"Please -- canst thou find a few pieces of blackrock to set '
	db	'about my room? I will need four pieces! But hurry! I do not '
	db	'think I can last much longer! Please go!"'
	db	00
L0E1C:	db	'protect'
	db	00
L0E24:	db	'blackrock'
	db	00
L0E2E:	db	'"Thou hast brought the blackrock! I did not think I could ma'
	db	'nage much longer! Hurry! Place the pieces on the pedestals a'
	db	't the north, south, east, and west ends of the room! I shall'
	db	' wait here!"*'
	db	00
L0EF0:	db	'"But thou dost not have the blackrock! Thou must get four pi'
	db	'eces and help me! Thou wilt need to place the pieces on the '
	db	'pedestals at the north, south, east, and west ends of the ro'
	db	'om! Hurry!"*'
	db	00
L0FB1:	db	'"The blackrock is working! I no longer feel the painful ethe'
	db	'r!"'
	db	00
L0FF1:	db	'blackrock'
	db	00
L0FFB:	db	'"It is quite a material, is it not? I imagine it could be us'
	db	'ed for many magical things."'
	db	00
L1054:	db	'blackrock'
	db	00
L105E:	db	'ring'
	db	00
L1063:	db	'"Thou hast the ethereal ring? Good! I must enchant it! Quick'
	db	'ly!"~~Penumbra takes the ring from you and intones a few mag'
	db	'ical words upon it. After a moment, she hands it back to you'
	db	'.'
	db	00
L1119:	db	'"Now thou must go to the generator. Be sure thou art wearing'
	db	' the ring! It should now protect thee from the ethereal atta'
	db	'cks. Be aware that it is functional only near the Tetrahedro'
	db	'n. And tell thy companions to wait out of range. Thou must e'
	db	'nter the generator alone!"'
	db	00
L1224:	db	'Penumbra thinks a moment. "By the way. How didst thou happen'
	db	' to know to come to me about this problem?"'
	db	00
L128C:	db	'Time Lord'
	db	00
L1296:	db	'Nicodemus'
	db	00
L12A0:	db	'Nicodemus'
	db	00
L12AA:	db	'Time Lord'
	db	00
L12B4:	db	'You tell Penumbra the story of how you need to get the hourg'
	db	'lass enchanted.'
	db	00
L1300:	db	'"I see. Well, thou best be on thy way, so that thou canst in'
	db	'deed get thine hourglass enchanted!"'
	db	00
L1361:	db	'"Where is the ring? Dost thou not have it? We can do nothing'
	db	' without the ring! Go and find it! Please!"*'
	db	00
L13CA:	db	'"What dost thou want? I have already enchanted the ring!"'
	db	00
L1404:	db	'"What dost thou want? I have already enchanted the ring. It '
	db	'can do no more for thee!"'
	db	00
L145A:	db	'ring'
	db	00
L145F:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L1463:	db	'Penumbra waves at you and then closes her eyes in pain.*'
	db	00
L149C:	db	'"Farewell, '
	db	00
L14A8:	db	'! And good luck to thee!"*'
	db	00
