L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'This spritely fairy flutters around you, sprinkling some kin'
	db	'd of sparkling dust on your head as she giggles.~~ "I love t'
	db	'hee! Yes, I do! I love thee!"'
	db	00
L00A3:	db	'"Yes, my love?" Kissme asks.'
	db	00
L00C0:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00C5:	db	'"Kissme! Kissme!" She giggles.'
	db	00
L00E4:	db	'"Don\'t do it, '
	db	00
L00F3:	db	'! Who knows what evil this strange creature might possess!" '
	db	'He inspects the sprite more closely. "Mayhaps I should try i'
	db	't first to be sure it is safe..."*'
	db	00
L018E:	db	'"Hey, -I\'ll- kiss her! She doesn\'t scare me!"*'
	db	00
L01BD:	db	'"She -doth- look rather inviting, doth she not?"*'
	db	00
L01EF:	db	'"My liege has asked thee thy -name-, foul creature!"*'
	db	00
L0225:	db	'"But that -is- my name! Kissme! Kissme! It is true!"'
	db	00
L025A:	db	'name'
	db	00
L025F:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0263:	db	'"My purpose is to spread love dust all around and welcome th'
