L000D:	db	'You see a woman who meets your gaze with an icy stare.'
	db	00
L0044:	db	'"What dost thou need now?"'
	db	00
L005F:	db	'Brion\'s feelings'
	db	00
L0070:	db	'Nelson\'s feelings'
	db	00
L0082:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0087:	db	'"I am Zelda."'
	db	00
L0095:	db	'name'
	db	00
L009A:	db	'Brion\'s feelings'
	db	00
L00AB:	db	'Nelson\'s feelings'
	db	00
L00BD:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00C1:	db	'"I am the advisor at the Lycaeum."'
	db	00
L00E4:	db	'advisor'
	db	00
L00EC:	db	'Lycaeum'
	db	00
L00F4:	db	'North East sea'
	db	00
L0103:	db	'Lycaeum'
	db	00
L010B:	db	'She rolls her eyes. "The Lycaeum is the building in which th'
	db	'ou dost stand. It is a great library designed to house a wea'
	db	'lth of knowledge. Though the structure has changed a bit ove'
	db	'r the past two hundred years, the essence of learning has no'
	db	't."'
	db	00
L01FF:	db	'Lycaeum'
	db	00
L0207:	db	'advisor'
	db	00
L020F:	db	'"Yes," she says. "My job is to manage and regulate the event'
	db	's in the Lycaeum. And," she adds, "provide assistance to the'
	db	' people here in Moonglow -- when they need it!"'
	db	00
L02B7:	db	'advisor'
	db	00
L02BF:	db	'townspeople'
	db	00
L02CB:	db	'events'
	db	00
L02D2:	db	'events'
	db	00
L02D9:	db	'"I am in charge of maintaining the reading areas and bringin'
	db	'g in new books. In addition, I help organize special group s'
	db	'essions for Jillian\'s tutorials and set up educational ente'
	db	'rtainment programs."'
	db	00
L03A1:	db	'events'
	db	00
L03A8:	db	'Jillian'
	db	00
L03B0:	db	'North East sea'
	db	00
L03BF:	db	'"I have not the time for these petty geography questions. Ch'
	db	'eck an atlas!"'
	db	00
L040A:	db	'North East sea'
	db	00
L0419:	db	'townspeople'
	db	00
L0425:	db	'"I have little time for this," she sighs. "I know only the L'
	db	'ycaeum head and his twin, Brion, at all well. The trainer al'
	db	'so studies here in the Lycaeum." She looks up at the ceiling'
	db	', as if reading from an invisible, overhead list.~~"Thou dos'
	db	't already know about Penumbra. Mariah is here. If thou wishe'
	db	'st to know about a member of The Fellowship, ask the clerk t'
	db	'here. Otherwise," she eyes you coldly, "let me return to my '
	db	'duties." As an afterthought, she adds, "And keep thy voice d'
	db	'own. People are trying to read."'
	db	00
L0626:	db	'Penumbra'
	db	00
L062F:	db	'Brion'
	db	00
L0635:	db	'Lycaeum head'
	db	00
L0642:	db	'Mariah'
	db	00
L0649:	db	'trainer'
	db	00
L0651:	db	'townspeople'
	db	00
L065D:	db	'Mariah'
	db	00
L0664:	db	'"Well, they say she used to be an adept mage, but all I see '
	db	'is a woman who wanders around complimenting the furniture. T'
	db	'hou mayest speak to her if thou wishest, but I doubt she wil'
	db	'l make sense to thee. And do not disorganize the shelves whi'
	db	'le looking for her!"'
	db	00
L0769:	db	'Mariah'
	db	00
L0770:	db	'trainer'
	db	00
L0778:	db	'Jillian'
	db	00
L0780:	db	'"Jillian? She is very well-behaved. Also quiet and tidy. I b'
	db	'elieve she is an excellent scholar. If thou art going to see'
	db	'k her out, try not to overturn any shelves. Some new books h'
	db	'ave just arrived and I have not finished placing all of them'
	db	'."'
	db	00
L0873:	db	'trainer'
	db	00
L087B:	db	'Jillian'
	db	00
L0883:	db	'new books'
	db	00
L088D:	db	'new books'
	db	00
L0897:	db	'"Yes, they arrived not long ago, including the recently redi'
	db	'scovered copy of DeMaria and Spector\'s work,`The Avatar Adv'
	db	'entures.\' If thou canst avoid creating too much of a distur'
	db	'bance, I recommend it to thee."'
	db	00
L0969:	db	'new books'
	db	00
L0973:	db	'Avatar Adventures'
	db	00
L0985:	db	'Avatar Adventures'
	db	00
L0997:	db	'"If I tell thee this last thing, wilt thou depart so I may r'
	db	'eturn to my job?"'
	db	00
L09E5:	db	'her'
	db	00
L09E9:	db	'his'
	db	00
L09ED:	db	'"We discovered the tome in the lower depths of the basement.'
	db	' We have no way to account for the accuracy of the contents,'
	db	' but have noticed many parallels between the events in the w'
	db	'ork and the events in Britannia\'s recent history.~~ "The bo'
	db	'ok is a copy of the Avatar\'s diary, written about two hundr'
	db	'ed years ago during '
	db	00
L0B2C:	db	' most recent visit to Britannia. Of course," she smiles sard'
	db	'onically, "it has been annotated by others.~~"It was recentl'
	db	'y published to give the general public more courage and conf'
	db	'idence.~~"And now, goodbye."'
	db	00
L0BFD:	db	'"Fine."'
	db	00
L0C05:	db	'Penumbra'
	db	00
L0C0E:	db	'she'
	db	00
L0C12:	db	'he'
	db	00
L0C15:	db	'She shakes her head, muttering, "Why doth '
	db	00
L0C40:	db	' waste my time in this manner?" Looking back up at you, she '
	db	'says, "Penumbra is the sage who put herself to sleep two cen'
	db	'turies ago. Rumor has it that only the Avatar can awaken her'
	db	'."'
	db	00
L0CF7:	db	'Penumbra'
	db	00
L0D00:	db	'Lycaeum head'
	db	00
L0D0D:	db	'"Nelson is very competent, although a little eccentric. I do'
	db	' wish he would refrain from showing off his collection of tr'
	db	'inkets to everyone who enters the building. It always makes '
	db	'such a commotion."'
	db	00
L0DD4:	db	'Lycaeum head'
	db	00
L0DE1:	db	'Brion'
	db	00
L0DE7:	db	'Her chilly expression melts away. "Brion," she says, smiling'
	db	', "is very open-minded and idealistic. He knows the heavens '
	db	'quite well." She looks up to emphasize `heavens.\' "I find h'
	db	'im very attractive. But, I do not know how to convey mine in'
	db	'tentions." She turns away, shyly.~~"Unless, perchance, '
	db	00
L0F0E:	db	' wilt aid me?" she asks, hopefully. "Wilt thou agree to tell'
	db	' him for me, '
	db	00
L0F58:	db	'?"'
	db	00
L0F5B:	db	'"Thank thee, '
	db	00
L0F69:	db	'. Thank thee." She blushes.'
	db	00
L0F85:	db	'"For thy kindness, I will give thee this white potion I foun'
	db	'd once while straightening the basement."'
	db	00
L0FEB:	db	'Her cold glare returns. "Very well."*'
	db	00
L1011:	db	'Brion'
	db	00
L1017:	db	'Brion\'s feelings'
	db	00
L1028:	db	'She looks down for a moment. "I thought as much." As she rai'
	db	'ses her head, tears are visible in her eyes. "I thank thee f'
	db	'or trying."*'
	db	00
L10AD:	db	'Nelson\'s feelings'
	db	00
L10BF:	db	'"Nelson? I never really thought about him." She shrugs. "Hmm'
	db	', I suppose he is not a bad second best. I will try," she sa'
	db	'ys, smiling.'
	db	00
L1144:	db	'Nelson\'s feelings'
	db	00
L1156:	db	'second best?'
	db	00
L1163:	db	'second best?'
	db	00
L1170:	db	'"Well, his brother, Brion, is quite attractive, I think."'
	db	00
L11AA:	db	'second best?'
	db	00
L11B7:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L11BB:	db	'"Good day."*'
	db	00
