L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L000F:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0013:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0018:	db	'The troll snarls at you, obviously displeased at your presen'
	db	'ce.'
	db	00
L0058:	db	'"What you want?" asks Grod.'
	db	00
L0074:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0079:	db	'"I Grod. Why you want know? Is voice unhappy?"'
	db	00
L00A8:	db	'He seems truly worried.~~"I will do job better. I promise! I'
	db	' beat harder and more often!"'
	db	00
L0102:	db	'*'
	db	00
L0104:	db	'Anton,'
	db	00
L010B:	db	'a prisoner,'
	db	00
L0117:	db	'"Thank thee ever so much, '
	db	00
L0132:	db	'," says '
	db	00
L013B:	db	' sarcastically.*'
	db	00
L014C:	db	'"Now, now, Anton, the nice person was simply answering a que'
	db	'stion."*'
	db	00
L0191:	db	'"Good. I do my job good!"'
	db	00
L01AB:	db	'"I Grod. Who you?"'
	db	00
L01BE:	db	'the Avatar'
	db	00
L01C9:	db	'"I not know you." He shrugs.'
	db	00
L01E6:	db	'"Funny name. But, all humans have funny names." He shrugs.'
	db	00
L0221:	db	'"The Avatar?" He begins laughing. "The Avatar not been here '
	db	'for...," he begins counting on his fingers. After several at'
	db	'tempts, he gives up, saying, "for many years!~~"You no Avata'
	db	'r."'
	db	00
L02D9:	db	'name'
	db	00
L02DE:	db	'job'
	db	00
L02E2:	db	'"I torture prisoners," he says, thumping his chest proudly.*'
	db	00
L031F:	db	'Spark\'s eyes light up.~"Torture? Wow! He quickly looks at y'
	db	'ou and changes expressions.~~ "I, er, mean, that is very awf'
	db	'ul."*'
	db	00
L039C:	db	'"Want to help?"'
	db	00
L03AC:	db	'He points to one of the prisoners.~~"He not fun like the oth'
	db	'er. Torture other first."*'
	db	00
L0403:	db	'"What? No, that\'s all right, '
	db	00
L0421:	db	'. Torture me, first."*'
	db	00
L0438:	db	'"Yes, '
	db	00
L043F:	db	'. Torture him first."*'
	db	00
L0456:	db	'"I thank thee," he says to the other.*'
	db	00
L047D:	db	'"Go ahead," says Grod.*'
	db	00
L0495:	db	'He hands you a whip.'
	db	00
L04AA:	db	'"You too wimpy to use whip!"'
	db	00
L04C7:	db	'"No one here to abuse." He appears disappointed.'
	db	00
L04F8:	db	'"You make funny joke. Go ahead, torture."*'
	db	00
L0523:	db	'prisoners'
	db	00
L052D:	db	'torture'
	db	00
L0535:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0540:	db	'"Yes," he nods. "I belong, too. I strive for unity. I be wor'
	db	'thy for my reward. And I trust my brother."~~ He smiles, obv'
	db	'iously pleased with himself."'
	db	00
L05D6:	db	'trust'
	db	00
L05DC:	db	'worthy'
	db	00
L05E3:	db	'strive'
	db	00
L05EA:	db	'"Big group, many people. You should join!"'
	db	00
L0615:	db	'join'
	db	00
L061A:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0625:	db	'trust'
	db	00
L062B:	db	'worthy'
	db	00
L0632:	db	'strive'
	db	00
L0639:	db	'"You don\'t know?" He frowns.~~ "You should learn before the'
	db	' voice become angry!"'
	db	00
L068A:	db	'trust'
	db	00
L0690:	db	'worthy'
	db	00
L0697:	db	'strive'
	db	00
L069E:	db	'join'
	db	00
L06A3:	db	'"Good, join. See Abraham or Danag about join."'
	db	00
L06D2:	db	'join'
	db	00
L06D7:	db	'prisoners'
	db	00
L06E1:	db	'"None here at the moment..." he appears truly disconcerted.'
	db	00
L071D:	db	'"There one!" he says, pointing to a man.*'
	db	00
L0747:	db	'"There another one!" he says, indicating the other man.'
	db	00
L077F:	db	'"How art thou today, '
	db	00
L0795:	db	'?" he says, smiling.'
	db	00
L07AA:	db	'prisoners'
	db	00
L07B4:	db	'torture'
	db	00
L07BC:	db	'"Much fun! Prisoners scream loudly."*'
	db	00
L07E2:	db	'"Except that one. He not scream. He just talk. And talk. I g'
	db	'et so bored I get mad. So I torture more. And," he throws up'
	db	' his hands, "he just talk more! I no know what to do."*'
	db	00
L0892:	db	'"That is terrible, '
	db	00
L08A6:	db	'. We must command him to stop!"*'
	db	00
L08C7:	db	'"I try make him stop. But he talk and talk. You try? Maybe h'
	db	'e stop."'
	db	00
L090C:	db	'stop torturing'
	db	00
L091B:	db	'torture'
	db	00
L0923:	db	'stop torturing'
	db	00
L0932:	db	'"Oh, no! Grod love job! Grod never stop. You go away now."*'
	db	00
L096E:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0972:	db	'"Come back and visit Grod. Hear victims squeal!"*'
	db	00
