L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see a young woman with an intellectual bearing.'
	db	00
L0041:	db	'"Greetings, '
	db	00
L004E:	db	'. As usual, I have much to do. However, I can spare a moment'
	db	' for thee if necessary."'
	db	00
L00A3:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00A8:	db	'"I am Jillian, '
	db	00
L00B8:	db	'."'
	db	00
L00BB:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00C0:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00C4:	db	'"I am a scholar, '
	db	00
L00D6:	db	'. I also tutor and train those who seek knowledge here in Mo'
	db	'onglow."'
	db	00
L011B:	db	'tutor'
	db	00
L0121:	db	'Moonglow'
	db	00
L012A:	db	'North East sea'
	db	00
L0139:	db	'Moonglow'
	db	00
L0142:	db	'"The town occupies almost the entire island of the same name'
	db	'. The island is located due east and a few degrees south of '
	db	'the city of Britain."'
	db	00
L01D0:	db	'Moonglow'
	db	00
L01D9:	db	'North East sea'
	db	00
L01E8:	db	'"Long ago there was a small continent -- an island really --'
	db	' called Ambrosia. However, meteorites struck it, destroying '
	db	'its primary city. The island was located in the North East s'
	db	'ea. I suppose the ruins still lie far beneath the rubble."'
	db	00
L02D7:	db	'North East sea'
	db	00
L02E6:	db	'tutor'
	db	00
L02EC:	db	'"My price is 35 gold for each training session. Art thou wil'
	db	'ling to pay that?"'
	db	00
L033B:	db	'"Then I really should return to my studies."'
	db	00
L0368:	db	'"A better time to train thee would be when I am in my study.'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L03A6:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L03AA:	db	'"Fare thee well, '
	db	00
L03BC:	db	'," she says, returning to her previous activity.*'
	db	00
