L0000:	db	'Avatar'
	db	00
L0007:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L000B:	db	'job'
	db	00
L000F:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0014:	db	'You see a lithe-looking fighter smile in your direction.'
	db	00
L004D:	db	'Chad smiles. "Hello, '
	db	00
L0063:	db	'. I hope thy days are going well."'
	db	00
L0086:	db	'name'
	db	00
L008B:	db	'"Chad, at thy service, '
	db	00
L00A3:	db	'. And what is thy name?"'
	db	00
L00BC:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00C1:	db	'"Greetings, '
	db	00
L00CE:	db	'. I am at thy service."'
	db	00
L00E6:	db	'"Greetings, '
	db	00
L00F3:	db	'." He shrugs.'
	db	00
L0101:	db	'"Of course, of course," he smiles. "I should have realized t'
	db	'hat thou wert the Avatar. Why, it must have been, oh, at lea'
	db	'st, two weeks since thy last visit!" He winks.*'
	db	00
L01A9:	db	'"Thou art a fool! Cannot thy feeble eyes see this is the Ava'
	db	'tar?"*'
	db	00
L01EC:	db	'"Yes, yes! I can see that," he laughs. "Then I must be Iolo!'
	db	'"*'
	db	00
L022B:	db	'"No, rogue! He is Iolo!" He nods to Iolo. "Thou... art a bli'
	db	'nd idiot!"*'
	db	00
L0273:	db	'"No, rogue, thou art a blind idiot!"*'
	db	00
L0299:	db	'name'
	db	00
L029E:	db	'job'
	db	00
L02A2:	db	'"I teach expertise with light weapons here in Moonglow."'
	db	00
L02DB:	db	'Moonglow'
	db	00
L02E4:	db	'train'
	db	00
L02EA:	db	'Moonglow'
	db	00
L02F3:	db	'"Dost thou want the location of the city or to know about th'
	db	'e townspeople?"'
	db	00
L033F:	db	'townspeople'
	db	00
L034B:	db	'location'
	db	00
L0354:	db	'Moonglow'
	db	00
L035D:	db	'location'
	db	00
L0366:	db	'"Moonglow is on an island directly east of the border betwee'
	db	'n Britain and Paws."'
	db	00
L03B7:	db	'location'
	db	00
L03C0:	db	'townspeople'
	db	00
L03CC:	db	'"The person to ask for that information would be Phearcy, th'
	db	'e bartender. All I know are other bar patrons: Tolemac and M'
	db	'orz, two farmers."'
	db	00
L0457:	db	'townspeople'
	db	00
L0463:	db	'train'
	db	00
L0469:	db	'"Yes, I train people. But only during the day. Now, \'tis ti'
	db	'me for drink!"'
	db	00
L04B3:	db	'"Wilt thou pay the 45 gold for the training session?"'
	db	00
L04E9:	db	'"Well, mayhap next time thou wilt be willing."'
	db	00
L0518:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L051C:	db	'"Remember, always keeps thy wits about and thy blade ready."'
	db	'*'
	db	00
