L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'The man looks at you through smiling eyes.'
	db	00
L0038:	db	'Elad bows in your direction.~"My pleasure to see thee again.'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L0076:	db	'name'
	db	00
L007B:	db	'"Elad is my name, '
	db	00
L008E:	db	'."'
	db	00
L0091:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0096:	db	'job'
	db	00
L009A:	db	'"I am the healer of the residents of this community."'
	db	00
L00D0:	db	'community'
	db	00
L00DA:	db	'heal'
	db	00
L00DF:	db	'residents'
	db	00
L00E9:	db	'community'
	db	00
L00F3:	db	'"Moonglow is mine home. I have lived in this town for mine e'
	db	'ntire life. But I am weary of my life here. \'Tis time, I th'
	db	'ink, to move on. If only I did not have such strong ties her'
	db	'e."~He sighs sadly.'
	db	00
L01BA:	db	'"There is a traveller visiting from Yew. He has seen many ex'
	db	'citing things in Britannia. I enjoy listening to his many ta'
	db	'les of adventure."'
	db	00
L0245:	db	'traveller'
	db	00
L024F:	db	'ties'
	db	00
L0254:	db	'community'
	db	00
L025E:	db	'traveller'
	db	00
L0268:	db	'"His name is Addom. While he is in town, I am letting him st'
	db	'ay in one of my beds."'
	db	00
L02BB:	db	'traveller'
	db	00
L02C5:	db	'heal'
	db	00
L02CA:	db	'"Yes, I sell mine healing services to those who need them."'
	db	00
L0306:	db	'services'
	db	00
L030F:	db	'heal'
	db	00
L0314:	db	'services'
	db	00
L031D:	db	'"Perhaps thou couldst come for healing when I am working in '
	db	'my shop."'
	db	00
L0363:	db	'services'
	db	00
L036C:	db	'ties'
	db	00
L0371:	db	'"My patients here in Moonglow. Who will help them if not I?"'
	db	00
L03AE:	db	'ties'
	db	00
L03B3:	db	'residents'
	db	00
L03BD:	db	'"There are many people in Moonglow. My father once told me t'
	db	'hat the town was much smaller during his time. In fact, he s'
	db	'aid that Moonglow used to be separate from the Lycaeum!~~"Bu'
	db	't, I digress. Thou didst ask about the people. I know most o'
	db	'f the residents here. Dost thou want to know about the Lycae'
	db	'um, the observatory, The Fellowship, the farmers, the traine'
	db	'r, or the tavern?"'
	db	00
L0538:	db	'tavern'
	db	00
L053F:	db	'trainer'
	db	00
L0547:	db	'farmers'
	db	00
L054F:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L055A:	db	'observatory'
	db	00
L0566:	db	'Lycaeum'
	db	00
L056E:	db	'residents'
	db	00
L0578:	db	'Lycaeum'
	db	00
L0580:	db	'"The Lycaeum is run by a kind man named Nelson. His advisor '
	db	'is Zelda. Do not break any rules in her presence or thou wil'
	db	't receive a sharp reprimand!~"Jillian also studies there. Sh'
	db	'e can teach thee many things. And do not worry about Mariah.'
	db	' She is harmless if thou wilt but leave her be."'
	db	00
L06A1:	db	'Lycaeum'
	db	00
L06A9:	db	'observatory'
	db	00
L06B5:	db	'"The head there is Brion. He is the twin of the head of the '
	db	'Lycaeum. I like him, although he and his brother are both a '
	db	'little eccentric."'
	db	00
L0740:	db	'observatory'
	db	00
L074C:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0757:	db	'"I know these people least of all. The branch opened here ab'
	db	'out five years ago under the direction of a man named Rankin'
	db	'. A few months ago, a clerk joined him. Her name is Balayna.'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L080D:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0818:	db	'farmers'
	db	00
L0820:	db	'"Cubolt owns the farm. He manages it with his younger brothe'
	db	'r Tolemac and their friend Morz. I am not positive, but I be'
	db	'lieve Tolemac recently joined The Fellowship."'
	db	00
L08C7:	db	'farmers'
	db	00
L08CF:	db	'tavern'
	db	00
L08D6:	db	'"Phearcy tends the bar there. He is another good person with'
	db	' whom thou shouldst speak about the townspeople. However, he'
	db	' enjoys gossip, and may be a bit single-minded."'
	db	00
L097F:	db	'tavern'
	db	00
L0986:	db	'trainer'
	db	00
L098E:	db	'"The trainer is named Chad. I believe he specializes in swif'
	db	't, skillful fighting, with knives and swords and such. See h'
	db	'im if thou wishest to improve thy skills."'
	db	00
L0A31:	db	'trainer'
	db	00
L0A39:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0A3D:	db	'"Leaving so soon, '
	db	00
L0A50:	db	'? Very well, may thy journeys be filled with prosperity."~He'
	db	' sighs. Suddenly, his face brightens.~ "Wait! Perhaps I coul'
	db	'd join thee?"~He quickly stands up, smiling. Then, just as s'
	db	'uddenly, his smile fades.~"No. I cannot. I have far too many'
	db	' things to do, too many people to care for. Perhaps in the f'
	db	'uture?"~He forces a smile.~"I hope when we meet next time, '
	db	00
L0BB8:	db	', I will have the opportunity to join thee. Pleasant journey'
	db	', my friend."*'
	db	00
