L0000:	db	'"Sorry, '
	db	00
L0009:	db	', I may talk to thee later. But now I wish to pay attention '
	db	'to the meeting."'
	db	00
L0056:	db	'"Sorry, '
	db	00
L005F:	db	', I must get to the Fellowship meeting!"'
	db	00
L0088:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L008C:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0097:	db	'job'
	db	00
L009B:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00A0:	db	'"Why, Hello, Sir Dupre. Things fare well I trust?"'
	db	00
L00D3:	db	'"Greetings, fair Phearcy. Yes, thank thee, things are well."'
	db	00
L0110:	db	'You see a man who gives you a friendly smile.'
	db	00
L013E:	db	'"How may I help thee, '
	db	00
L0155:	db	'?" asks Phearcy.'
	db	00
L0166:	db	'"Hast thou discovered the reason for Zelda\'s moods?"'
	db	00
L019B:	db	'"Excellent. Thou canst tell me while I get thy refreshment."'
	db	' As he prepares your meal, you tell him what you know about '
	db	'Zelda and Brion.'
	db	00
L0224:	db	'"Too bad, '
	db	00
L022F:	db	'. When thou art carrying less weighty things I shall give th'
	db	'ee thy jerky."'
	db	00
L027A:	db	'"And when thy load is lighter, then I can give thee thy beve'
	db	'rages."'
	db	00
L02BE:	db	'"\'Tis a shame, '
	db	00
L02CE:	db	'. Perhaps thou wilt know next time."'
	db	00
L02F3:	db	'name'
	db	00
L02F8:	db	'"I am Phearcy, at thy service." He gives a short bow.'
	db	00
L032E:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0333:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0337:	db	'"I am the bartender here in Moonglow."'
	db	00
L035E:	db	'buy'
	db	00
L0362:	db	'Moonglow'
	db	00
L036B:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0376:	db	'"Oh, thou referest to this?" he asks, pointing to his medall'
	db	'ion. "Thou hast not heard of The Fellowship? I strongly reco'
	db	'mmend that thou speakest with Rankin or Balayna at the branc'
	db	'h office. The Fellowship has done many things for our town, '
	db	'if not for all of Britannia. I am a firm believer in neo-rea'
	db	'lism."'
	db	00
L04A9:	db	'neo-realism'
	db	00
L04B5:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L04C0:	db	'neo-realism'
	db	00
L04CC:	db	'"That is the fundamental principle of The Fellowship. It is '
	db	'composed of the triad of inner strength, which is strive for'
	db	' unity, trust thy brother, and... one other one.... Oh, yes,'
	db	' thou dost get what thou deservest, or some such."'
	db	00
L05B3:	db	'neo-realism'
	db	00
L05BF:	db	'Moonglow'
	db	00
L05C8:	db	'"Thou wants to know about someone in the town? Thou hast ask'
	db	'ed the right person. I know all about the residents here in '
	db	'Moonglow. I would be happy to tell thee about any of the sho'
	db	'p keepers, scholars, or farmers who live here. Or art thou i'
	db	'nterested in the trainer, healer, mage, or Fellowship leader'
	db	's?'
	db	00
L06F7:	db	'Moonglow'
	db	00
L0700:	db	'leaders'
	db	00
L0708:	db	'mage'
	db	00
L070D:	db	'healer'
	db	00
L0714:	db	'trainer'
	db	00
L071C:	db	'farmers'
	db	00
L0724:	db	'scholars'
	db	00
L072D:	db	'shop keeper'
	db	00
L0739:	db	'no one'
	db	00
L0740:	db	'scholars'
	db	00
L0749:	db	'"Ah, the learned scholars. I can tell thee about Brion, Nels'
	db	'on, Zelda, and Jillian."'
	db	00
L079E:	db	'Jillian'
	db	00
L07A6:	db	'Zelda'
	db	00
L07AC:	db	'Nelson'
	db	00
L07B3:	db	'Brion'
	db	00
L07B9:	db	'no one'
	db	00
L07C0:	db	'leaders'
	db	00
L07C8:	db	'"Dost thou want to know about the one in charge or his clerk'
	db	'?"'
	db	00
L0807:	db	'clerk'
	db	00
L080D:	db	'charge'
	db	00
L0814:	db	'no one'
	db	00
L081B:	db	'mage'
	db	00
L0820:	db	'"Ah, yes, Mariah is very nice."'
	db	00
L0840:	db	'"She can sell thee many spells."'
	db	00
L0861:	db	'"But I am more interested in discussing Zelda."'
	db	00
L0891:	db	'mage'
	db	00
L0896:	db	'shop keeper'
	db	00
L08A2:	db	'"She is a tailor. Lovely woman, that Carlyn. She minds the b'
	db	'ar when I go to the Fellowship meetings at night."'
	db	00
L0911:	db	'"But I would rather discuss Zelda."'
	db	00
L0935:	db	'shop keeper'
	db	00
L0941:	db	'Jillian'
	db	00
L0949:	db	'"Wonderful scholar. Very nice woman. Married to Effrem."'
	db	00
L0982:	db	'Effrem'
	db	00
L0989:	db	'"But I am more interested in discussing Zelda."'
	db	00
L09B9:	db	'Jillian'
	db	00
L09C1:	db	'Effrem'
	db	00
L09C8:	db	'"Friendly fellow -- I like him."'
	db	00
L09E9:	db	'"He stays home to care for their son."'
	db	00
L0A10:	db	'"But I am more interested in discussing Brion."'
	db	00
L0A40:	db	'Effrem'
	db	00
L0A47:	db	'trainer'
	db	00
L0A4F:	db	'"Chad is a friendly fellow -- I like him."'
	db	00
L0A7A:	db	'"But I would rather discuss Brion."'
	db	00
L0A9E:	db	'trainer'
	db	00
L0AA6:	db	'farmers'
	db	00
L0AAE:	db	'"Tolemac and Cubolt are brothers. With Morz\'s help, they ru'
	db	'n a farm."'
	db	00
L0AF4:	db	'"But I would prefer to talk about Brion."'
	db	00
L0B1E:	db	'farmers'
	db	00
L0B26:	db	'healer'
	db	00
L0B2D:	db	'"Friendly fellow -- I like him. His name is Elad."'
	db	00
L0B60:	db	'"Sadly, his true desire is to leave Moonglow in search of ad'
	db	'venture. But he will not leave, for he feels too much obliga'
	db	'tion for his patients." Phearcy shrugs.~"Perhaps not without'
	db	' reason."'
	db	00
L0C1E:	db	'"But Brion is more interesting to me."'
	db	00
L0C45:	db	'healer'
	db	00
L0C4C:	db	'Nelson'
	db	00
L0C53:	db	'"He is Brion\'s twin brother."'
	db	00
L0C71:	db	'"Speaking of that, I would like to discuss Brion."'
	db	00
L0CA4:	db	'Nelson'
	db	00
L0CAB:	db	'charge'
	db	00
L0CB2:	db	'"Rankin is in charge of the entire local branch. If thou has'
	db	't any questions about The Fellowship, he can answer them."'
	db	00
L0D29:	db	'charge'
	db	00
L0D30:	db	'clerk'
	db	00
L0D36:	db	'"If thou hast any questions about The Fellowship, Balayna ca'
	db	'n answer them."'
	db	00
L0D82:	db	'clerk'
	db	00
L0D88:	db	'Zelda'
	db	00
L0D8E:	db	'Brion'
	db	00
L0D94:	db	'"Well, as thou dost know, Brion is the head of Observatory, '
	db	'and Zelda, the advisor at the Lyceaum, is in love with him."'
	db	00
L0E0D:	db	'"Ah, so thou dost wonder, too. All I know is that every time'
	db	' someone mentions Brion\'s name to Zelda, her serious expres'
	db	'sion changes to a smile.~~"I have a deal for thee. Find out '
	db	'what their story is, and I will give thee and thy friends a '
	db	'free meal and drink. Thou canst find Brion at the observator'
	db	'y and Zelda at the Lyceaum."'
	db	00
L0F55:	db	'Zelda'
	db	00
L0F5B:	db	'Brion'
	db	00
L0F61:	db	'no one'
	db	00
L0F68:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0F6C:	db	'buy'
	db	00
L0F70:	db	'"Food or drink, '
	db	00
L0F81:	db	'?"'
	db	00
L0F84:	db	'drink'
	db	00
L0F8A:	db	'food'
	db	00
L0F8F:	db	'buy'
	db	00
L0F93:	db	'food'
	db	00
L0F98:	db	'food'
	db	00
L0F9D:	db	'drink'
	db	00
L0FA3:	db	'drink'
	db	00
L0FA9:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0FAD:	db	'"Remember! Tell them thou didst eat at the Friendly Knave!"*'
	db	00
