L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'thief'
	db	00
L0013:	db	'thief'
	db	00
L0019:	db	'theft solved'
	db	00
L0026:	db	'You see a cheerful, handsome young man who gives you a frien'
	db	'dly wave as you approach.'
	db	00
L007C:	db	'"Greetings, '
	db	00
L0089:	db	'," says Andrew.'
	db	00
L0099:	db	'name'
	db	00
L009E:	db	'"My name is Andrew. How art thou, '
	db	00
L00C1:	db	'?"'
	db	00
L00C4:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00C9:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00CD:	db	'"I am the owner and proprietor of the dairy here in Paws."'
	db	00
L0108:	db	'Paws'
	db	00
L010D:	db	'dairy'
	db	00
L0113:	db	'dairy'
	db	00
L0119:	db	'"Yes, I sell milk and cheese. Thou mayest find the dairy bet'
	db	'ween Camille\'s farm and the slaughterhouse."'
	db	00
L0182:	db	'dairy'
	db	00
L0188:	db	'cheese'
	db	00
L018F:	db	'milk'
	db	00
L0194:	db	'slaughterhouse'
	db	00
L01A3:	db	'Camille'
	db	00
L01AB:	db	'milk'
	db	00
L01B0:	db	'"A gallon will cost thee 3 gold. Art thou interested in buyi'
	db	'ng some?"'
	db	00
L01F6:	db	'"Here it is," he says, handing you the jug. "Wouldst thou li'
	db	'ke another?"*'
	db	00
L0240:	db	'"Thou hast not the room for the jug."'
	db	00
L0266:	db	'"Thou hast not the gold for this, '
	db	00
L0289:	db	'. Perhaps some other time."'
	db	00
L02A5:	db	'"Perhaps next time, '
	db	00
L02BA:	db	'."'
	db	00
L02BD:	db	'"I would be more than happy to sell thee a jug of milk, but '
	db	'for now the dairy is closed."'
	db	00
L0317:	db	'milk'
	db	00
L031C:	db	'cheese'
	db	00
L0323:	db	'"I sell wedges for 2 gold each. Still interested?"'
	db	00
L0356:	db	'"How many dost thou want?"'
	db	00
L0371:	db	'"Here it is."'
	db	00
L037F:	db	'"Thou hast not the room for this cheese."'
	db	00
L03A9:	db	'"Thou hast not the gold for this, '
	db	00
L03CC:	db	'. Perhaps something else."'
	db	00
L03E7:	db	'"I understand, '
	db	00
L03F7:	db	'. Perhaps when thou dost become more hungry."'
	db	00
L0425:	db	'"I would be more than happy to sell thee some cheese, but fo'
	db	'r now the dairy is closed."'
	db	00
L047D:	db	'cheese'
	db	00
L0484:	db	'Camille'
	db	00
L048C:	db	'"Camille is a good woman. She is still an advocate of the ol'
	db	'd virtues. She runs the farm by herself. Well, with the help'
	db	' of her son, Tobias."'
	db	00
L051A:	db	'Camille'
	db	00
L0522:	db	'Tobias'
	db	00
L0529:	db	'Tobias'
	db	00
L0530:	db	'"A rather defensive young lad, I cannot say that I know that'
	db	' much about him."'
	db	00
L057E:	db	'Tobias'
	db	00
L0585:	db	'Paws'
	db	00
L058A:	db	'"Of course everyone is up in arms about this business concer'
	db	'ning the missing venom."'
	db	00
L05DF:	db	'Paws'
	db	00
L05E4:	db	'venom'
	db	00
L05EA:	db	'"It could be hidden anywhere. With all the trade that occurs'
	db	' in this town, it would be easy to hide. I do not know much '
	db	'else about the substance. Perhaps Morfin himself would know '
	db	'what kinds of effects it might produce."'
	db	00
L06C7:	db	'venom'
	db	00
L06CD:	db	'thief'
	db	00
L06D3:	db	'"Be wary, for there is a thief in this town! Some silver ser'
	db	'pent venom was stolen from Morfin."'
	db	00
L0733:	db	'thief'
	db	00
L0739:	db	'venom'
	db	00
L073F:	db	'Morfin'
	db	00
L0746:	db	'theft solved'
	db	00
L0753:	db	'"Thou hast put the people in our town at ease by finding the'
	db	' culprit!"'
	db	00
L079A:	db	'theft solved'
	db	00
L07A7:	db	'slaughterhouse'
	db	00
L07B6:	db	'"The slaughterhouse is run by Morfin, the merchant. He is al'
	db	'ways busy, coming and going at all hours, sometimes carrying'
	db	' things."'
	db	00
L0838:	db	'slaughterhouse'
	db	00
L0847:	db	'Morfin'
	db	00
L084E:	db	'Morfin'
	db	00
L0855:	db	'"He bought the slaughterhouse a few years ago, soon after he'
	db	' joined The Fellowship. I knew the previous owner."'
	db	00
L08C5:	db	'Morfin'
	db	00
L08CC:	db	'previous owner'
	db	00
L08DB:	db	'previous owner'
	db	00
L08EA:	db	'"I was just a lad when I first saw the old slaughterhouse. T'
	db	'he old man who owned it even showed me the storeroom in ther'
	db	'e once. The door to it is locked. I think Morfin has the key'
	db	' somewhere in his house."'
	db	00
L09B8:	db	'previous owner'
	db	00
L09C7:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L09CB:	db	'"I hope I was of some assistance to thee, '
	db	00
L09F6:	db	'."*'
	db	00
