	.dsize       06B1H
L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'You are greeted by a friendly gargoyle.'
	db	00
L0035:	db	'"To see you are doing well, human," says Inmanilem.'
	db	00
L0069:	db	'name'
	db	00
L006E:	db	'"To be called Inmanilem, human. To wish information about Te'
	db	'rfin?"'
	db	00
L00B1:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00B6:	db	'Inmanilem'
	db	00
L00C0:	db	'information'
	db	00
L00CC:	db	'Inmanilem'
	db	00
L00D6:	db	'"To be Gargoyle for `make healed one.\'"'
	db	00
L00FE:	db	'Inmanilem'
	db	00
L0108:	db	'job'
	db	00
L010C:	db	'"To be the healer."'
	db	00
L0120:	db	'heal'
	db	00
L0125:	db	'conflicts'
	db	00
L012F:	db	'heal'
	db	00
L0134:	db	'"To feel sorry, but to be busy with other things now. To ask'
	db	' you to come back when I have the time to heal you."'
	db	00
L01A5:	db	'Heal'
	db	00
L01AA:	db	'information'
	db	00
L01B6:	db	'"To tell you to seek out Draxinusom, human, or Forbrak. To h'
	db	'ave much information about Terfin."'
	db	00
L0216:	db	'information'
	db	00
L0222:	db	'Terfin'
	db	00
L0229:	db	'Forbrak'
	db	00
L0231:	db	'Draxinusom'
	db	00
L023C:	db	'Forbrak'
	db	00
L0244:	db	'"To be the tavernkeeper. To be very strong of body, and of m'
	db	'ind."'
	db	00
L0286:	db	'Forbrak'
	db	00
L028E:	db	'Terfin'
	db	00
L0295:	db	'"To be the city of gargoyles. To be the one of two towns whe'
	db	're many gargoyles live. To like it here," he adds, smiling.'
	db	00
L030D:	db	'Terfin'
	db	00
L0314:	db	'one?'
	db	00
L0319:	db	'one?'
	db	00
L031E:	db	'"To tell you the other is called Vesper. To be in the desert'
	db	' in northeastern Britannia. To have also humans living there'
	db	', unlike here."'
	db	00
L03A6:	db	'one?'
	db	00
L03AB:	db	'Draxinusom'
	db	00
L03B6:	db	'"To be our leader. To live near the Hall of Knowledge."'
	db	00
L03EE:	db	'Draxinusom'
	db	00
L03F9:	db	'Hall'
	db	00
L03FE:	db	'Hall'
	db	00
L0403:	db	'"To be where the three altars of singularity are kept."'
	db	00
L043B:	db	'Hall'
	db	00
L0440:	db	'altars'
	db	00
L0447:	db	'altars'
	db	00
L044E:	db	'"To be Passion, Control, and Diligence. To be the values tha'
	db	't most gargoyles hold as the key of our existence."'
	db	00
L04BE:	db	'altars'
	db	00
L04C5:	db	'key'
	db	00
L04C9:	db	'most gargoyles'
	db	00
L04D8:	db	'key'
	db	00
L04DC:	db	'He nods his head emphatically. "To be quite similar to the h'
	db	'uman concept of virtues."'
	db	00
L0532:	db	'key'
	db	00
L0536:	db	'most gargoyles'
	db	00
L0545:	db	'"There is a rival now -- The Fellowship. To know not if it i'
	db	's good or bad, but to know I do not follow it!"'
	db	00
L05B1:	db	'most gargoyles'
	db	00
L05C0:	db	'conflicts'
	db	00
L05CA:	db	'"To know only of one dissatisfied gargoyle. To have always b'
	db	'een problem, but now acting hostile and aggressive. To be na'
	db	'med Silamo, the gardener.~~"To recommend you talk to Silamo.'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L0680:	db	'conflicts'
	db	00
L068A:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L068E:	db	'"To wish you good health, human."*'
	db	00
