	; Function at file offset 000D8053H
	.funcnumber  04B7H
	.data
	.msize       172CH
	.dsize       145AH
L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see a winged gargoyle in his physical prime.~~"Hail, hum'
	db	'an! To be welcome to the house of the altars. To be helpful '
	db	'to you in any way?"'
	db	00
L0099:	db	'"To have returned! To be glad to see you again, human," says'
	db	' Teregus. "To be welcome to the house of the altars. To be h'
	db	'elpful to you?"'
	db	00
L0121:	db	'evidence'
	db	00
L012A:	db	'Inamo'
	db	00
L0130:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0135:	db	'"To be called Teregus."'
	db	00
L014D:	db	'Inamo'
	db	00
L0153:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0158:	db	'job'
	db	00
L015C:	db	'"To be caring for the altars of Control, Passion, and Dilige'
	db	'nce. To be a position of great responsibility. To be especia'
	db	'lly important in these times of trouble."'
	db	00
L01FE:	db	'altars'
	db	00
L0205:	db	'trouble'
	db	00
L020D:	db	'trouble'
	db	00
L0215:	db	'"To have been many disagreements in town lately. To be much '
	db	'tension between the followers of the principles of the altar'
	db	's and the followers of The Fellowship. To have heard rumors '
	db	'of threats to the altars."'
	db	00
L02E4:	db	'rumors'
	db	00
L02EB:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L02F6:	db	'trouble'
	db	00
L02FE:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0309:	db	'"To be glad that Quan is now running our branch. To believe '
	db	'that he is misguided, but to be a much more reasonable gargo'
	db	'yle to deal with now that Runeb is gone."'
	db	00
L03AB:	db	'"To be wary of Fellowship ideals. To be ignoring the altars '
	db	'in their search for unity, and to be losing respect for the '
	db	'old ways. To be not bad. To tell you our branch is run by Qu'
	db	'an and Runeb."'
	db	00
L046E:	db	'Runeb'
	db	00
L0474:	db	'Quan'
	db	00
L0479:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0484:	db	'rumors'
	db	00
L048B:	db	'"To be sorry that we have lost Runeb. Perhaps to be for the '
	db	'best. To be certainly overjoyed to have avoided damage to th'
	db	'e altars."'
	db	00
L050E:	db	'"To have heard that someone in town is planning to destroy t'
	db	'he physical representations of the altars. To be not the sam'
	db	'e, of course, as actually destroying the basic principles of'
	db	' Control, Passion, and Diligence, but to be bad for us nonet'
	db	'heless. To be finding out for us who is planning this, if th'
	db	'ere is time, perhaps. To return to me with evidence when you'
	db	' determine course of action. To be very grateful for your as'
	db	'sistance."'
	db	00
L06BD:	db	'rumors'
	db	00
L06C4:	db	'evidence'
	db	00
L06CD:	db	'"To have brought me something, some evidence about the rumor'
	db	's?"'
	db	00
L070D:	db	'"To be wonderful! To see it, please."~~You hand him the note'
	db	' from Runeb that you found in Sarpling\'s shop.~~"Ah. Runeb.'
	db	' To have suspected as much. To be always reaching for more b'
	db	'y the most violent means."~~He sighs.~~"To ask that you conf'
	db	'ront him with this evidence. To suggest that anything less w'
	db	'ill not reveal truth. To be prepared for anything, please, h'
	db	'uman, for to know not how he will react."~~He shakes his hea'
	db	'd.~~"To be not hopeful for a peaceful solution. To thank you'
	db	' for your assistance."'
	db	00
L0903:	db	'"To have found nothing yet? Ah, well. To return, please, whe'
	db	'n anything unusual is found. To suggest that you confront th'
	db	'e suspect as soon as you have a clue. To wish to stop him be'
	db	'fore any damage is done to the altars."'
	db	00
L09DF:	db	'evidence'
	db	00
L09E8:	db	'Quan'
	db	00
L09ED:	db	'"To be sad to have lost Quan to The Fellowship, human. To ha'
	db	've been a good gargoyle when young, but to have fallen into '
	db	'bad company later. To have concentrated mostly on self-aggra'
	db	'ndizement and hedonism in the last few years. To be a shame.'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L0ADF:	db	'Quan'
	db	00
L0AE4:	db	'Runeb'
	db	00
L0AEA:	db	'"To have been a sad case. To have wished to have been able t'
	db	'o save him. To always have been uncontrollable, but to have '
	db	'gotten worse in the last few years. To have seemed to want t'
	db	'o start as many fights as possible. To have found a reason f'
	db	'or using his strength against all those weaker when to have '
	db	'joined The Fellowship."'
	db	00
L0C2E:	db	'Runeb'
	db	00
L0C34:	db	'Inamo'
	db	00
L0C3A:	db	'He smiles sadly, but with obvious pride.~'
	db	00
L0C64:	db	'"To have been a fine young gargoyle. The pride of us all. To'
	db	' wish to know who was responsible for his dishonorable end."'
	db	00
L0CDD:	db	'"To miss him greatly. To have raised him from an egg. To hav'
	db	'e been rather vocal in his disagreements with The Fellowship'
	db	'. To have felt it safer for him to leave."~~He sighs, then l'
	db	'ooks up hopefully.~~"To have news of him?"'
	db	00
L0DBC:	db	'"To be well?"'
	db	00
L0DCA:	db	'"To be good. To be hoping to hear from him soon."'
	db	00
L0DFC:	db	'"To be not well? To be terrible! To think there is anything '
	db	'to do to help?"'
	db	00
L0E48:	db	'too late'
	db	00
L0E51:	db	'"Ah. Too bad. To be waiting long for news from him."'
	db	00
L0E86:	db	'Inamo'
	db	00
L0E8C:	db	'too late'
	db	00
L0E95:	db	'"To be too late? To mean what by too late? To tell me what h'
	db	'as happened!"~~He seems very distraught.'
	db	00
L0EFA:	db	'murdered'
	db	00
L0F03:	db	'too late'
	db	00
L0F0C:	db	'murdered'
	db	00
L0F15:	db	'"To be murdered?"~~He takes a step back, stunned by the news'
	db	'.~~"To be murdered? To be unbelievable. To have no real enem'
	db	'ies!"~~He sighs heavily.~~"To tell me, please, exactly what '
	db	'happened."~~You relate to him the particulars of Inamo\'s de'
	db	'ath. He sighs again.~~"To be such a waste of gargoyle life. '
	db	'To be grateful if you would send news if you discover who wa'
	db	's responsible for wanting him dead."~~ He is quiet for a few'
	db	' moments, getting accustomed to the situation.~~"To apologiz'
	db	'e. To need some time to grieve. Please to come back later."~'
	db	'~He turns away.'
	db	00
L1140:	db	'murdered'
	db	00
L1149:	db	'altars'
	db	00
L1150:	db	'altars'
	db	00
L1157:	db	'"To be caretaker and group leader for the altars of the thre'
	db	'e principles. To wish to make a donation?"'
	db	00
L11BE:	db	'"Excellent. To which altar do you wish to donate?"'
	db	00
L11F1:	db	'Diligence'
	db	00
L11FB:	db	'Passion'
	db	00
L1203:	db	'Control'
	db	00
L120B:	db	'"Ah. To donate next time, perhaps."'
	db	00
L122F:	db	'Diligence'
	db	00
L1239:	db	'Passion'
	db	00
L1241:	db	'Control'
	db	00
L1249:	db	'"To be an excellent choice. To meditate at the shrine for yo'
	db	'u for a donation of 5 gold. To be willing to donate 5 gold?"'
	db	00
L12C2:	db	'"To meditate for you this evening, human. To wish you well i'
	db	'n your journeys."'
	db	00
L1310:	db	'"To not have 5 gold? To return\tlater when you have the gold'
	db	'. To meditate for your success on your journeys."~~He smiles'
	db	' kindly.'
	db	00
L1390:	db	'"Ah. To have misunderstood. To apologize. To let me know if '
	db	'you change your mind."~~He looks disappointed.'
	db	00
L13FB:	db	'Diligence'
	db	00
L1405:	db	'Passion'
	db	00
L140D:	db	'Control'
	db	00
L1415:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L1419:	db	'"To tell you goodbye for now, human. To return and be welcom'
	db	'e."*'
	db	00
