L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see a frowning gargoyle.'
	db	00
L002A:	db	'"To ask what you need, human," says Silamo.'
	db	00
L0056:	db	'name'
	db	00
L005B:	db	'"To be named `Silamo.\'"'
	db	00
L0073:	db	'wingless status'
	db	00
L0083:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0088:	db	'Silamo'
	db	00
L008F:	db	'Silamo'
	db	00
L0096:	db	'"To know my name if I were winged." He scowls at you.'
	db	00
L00CC:	db	'Silamo'
	db	00
L00D3:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00D7:	db	'"To be the gardener," he shrugs, "nothing more."~~ He does n'
	db	'ot seem to be interested in speaking with you.'
	db	00
L0142:	db	'wingless status'
	db	00
L0152:	db	'He stares at you for a moment.~~"To be right, human.~~ "To f'
	db	'eel I am treated less for an absence of wings. To see Quaeve'
	db	'n treated better since joining The Fellowship. To be devoted'
	db	' to the altar of singularity. But, perhaps to change if The '
	db	'Fellowship cares not about wings."'
	db	00
L0265:	db	'Quaeven'
	db	00
L026D:	db	'treated'
	db	00
L0275:	db	'wingless status'
	db	00
L0285:	db	'Quaeven'
	db	00
L028D:	db	'"To be also without wings, but to be respected as if he were'
	db	' winged."'
	db	00
L02D3:	db	'Quaeven'
	db	00
L02DB:	db	'treated'
	db	00
L02E3:	db	'"To see many others include him in many events from which I '
	db	'am excluded. To know others include him in many more decisio'
	db	'n-making councils, too."'
	db	00
L0374:	db	'treated'
	db	00
L037C:	db	'others'
	db	00
L0383:	db	'others'
	db	00
L038A:	db	'"Gargoyles in The Fellowship."'
	db	00
L03A9:	db	'others'
	db	00
L03B0:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L03B4:	db	'"To get back to work."*'
	db	00
