L0000:	db	'The gargoyle is too involved with the Fellowship meeting to '
	db	'talk to you at this moment.*'
	db	00
L0059:	db	'"To be unable to talk now. To see me after the Fellowship me'
	db	'eting." He continues on his way.*'
	db	00
L00B7:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L00BB:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L00C6:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00CA:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00CF:	db	'You see a very distraught gargoyle.'
	db	00
L00F3:	db	'"To give you greetings, human."'
	db	00
L0113:	db	'altar conflicts'
	db	00
L0123:	db	'found note'
	db	00
L012E:	db	'altar conflicts'
	db	00
L013E:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0143:	db	'"To be able to call me Sarpling."'
	db	00
L0165:	db	'name'
	db	00
L016A:	db	'altar conflicts'
	db	00
L017A:	db	'found note'
	db	00
L0185:	db	'altar conflicts'
	db	00
L0195:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0199:	db	'"To provide various magics and items in Terfin."'
	db	00
L01CA:	db	'Terfin'
	db	00
L01D1:	db	'buy'
	db	00
L01D5:	db	'Terfin'
	db	00
L01DC:	db	'"To be the city in which you are located. To be the city of '
	db	'gargoyles."'
	db	00
L0224:	db	'gargoyles'
	db	00
L022E:	db	'Terfin'
	db	00
L0235:	db	'gargoyles'
	db	00
L023F:	db	'"To know Quan is the Fellowship leader. To believe he gives '
	db	'good guidance." He appears thoughtful.~~ "To have spoken to '
	db	'Draxinusom?"'
	db	00
L02C4:	db	'"To see Forbrak or Quaeven, then. To know they see all the c'
	db	'itizens regularly."'
	db	00
L0314:	db	'"To see first, Draxinusom. To be leader of the city. To know'
	db	' many of the residents."'
	db	00
L0369:	db	'gargoyles'
	db	00
L0373:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L037E:	db	'"To be an important part of my life. To support The Fellowsh'
	db	'ip fully."'
	db	00
L03C5:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L03D0:	db	'altar conflicts'
	db	00
L03E0:	db	'"To know nothing about the altars. To wonder what you mean?"'
	db	00
L041D:	db	'altar conflicts'
	db	00
L042D:	db	'found note'
	db	00
L0438:	db	'A surprised expression, mixed with fear, covers his face.~~ '
	db	'"To be all Runeb\'s decisions! To be all Runeb\'s doing! To '
	db	'want nothing to do with the destruction of the altars, or wi'
	db	'th the assassination plot!"'
	db	00
L0506:	db	'found note'
	db	00
L0511:	db	'Assassination plot!'
	db	00
L0525:	db	'Assassination plot!'
	db	00
L0539:	db	'"To not already know about the plot?" he wails.~~ "To have c'
	db	'aused problems this time, Sarpling," he says to himself. "To'
	db	' have brought much trouble!~~ "To tell you Runeb wanted to f'
	db	'rame Quan for the altars. To kill Quan if plan failed, and t'
	db	'o be in control of The Fellowship in Terfin. To be Runeb\'s '
	db	'goal.~~ "To be in much danger you and me!"*'
	db	00
L0690:	db	'buy'
	db	00
L0694:	db	'buy'
	db	00
L0698:	db	'"To want reagents or jewelry and potions?"'
	db	00
L06C3:	db	'jewelry and potions'
	db	00
L06D7:	db	'reagents'
	db	00
L06E0:	db	'"To sell you things when my shop is open."'
	db	00
L070B:	db	'reagents'
	db	00
L0714:	db	'reagents'
	db	00
L071D:	db	'jewelry and potions'
