L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'The woman greets you with a curtsey.'
	db	00
L0032:	db	'"Good day, '
	db	00
L003E:	db	'," says Lady Jehanne.'
	db	00
L0054:	db	'commons'
	db	00
L005C:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0061:	db	'"I am the Lady Jehanne, '
	db	00
L007A:	db	'."'
	db	00
L007D:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0082:	db	'commons'
	db	00
L008A:	db	'job'
	db	00
L008E:	db	'"I am the provisioner of Serpent\'s Hold."'
	db	00
L00B8:	db	'"And," she adds, "I also have a ship for sale shouldst thou '
	db	'be interested in that."'
	db	00
L010C:	db	'ship'
	db	00
L0111:	db	'provisions'
	db	00
L011C:	db	'Serpent\'s Hold'
	db	00
L012B:	db	'ship'
	db	00
L0130:	db	'"Well, it was once the magnificent `Constellation.\' However'
	db	', \'twas destroyed by the ship\'s captain, himself, to preve'
	db	'nt it from falling into the hands of attacking pirates. What'
	db	' little remained was rebuilt into an even finer ship, `The D'
	db	'ragon\'s Breath?\' Art thou interested in purchasing it for '
	db	'600 gold?"'
	db	00
L0262:	db	'"Here is thy deed."'
	db	00
L0276:	db	'"Sadly, '
	db	00
L027F:	db	', thou hast not the room for this deed."'
	db	00
L02A8:	db	'"I understand, '
	db	00
L02B8:	db	', thou hast not the funds at this time."'
	db	00
L02E1:	db	'"Perhaps sometime in the future, '
	db	00
L0303:	db	'."'
	db	00
L0306:	db	'ship'
	db	00
L030B:	db	'Serpent\'s Hold'
	db	00
L031A:	db	'"Most of us here are knights, noble warriors sworn to protec'
	db	't Britannia and Lord British. Mine own lord," she beams with'
	db	' pride, "is such a knight -- Sir Pendaran."'
	db	00
L03BE:	db	'Serpent\'s Hold'
	db	00
L03CD:	db	'knights'
	db	00
L03D5:	db	'Sir Pendaran'
	db	00
L03E2:	db	'Sir Pendaran'
	db	00
L03EF:	db	'"We met three years ago. He\'s quite brave and strong. I jus'
	db	't love to watch him fight." She smiles.~~"I am not really su'
	db	're he will mix well with the rest of The Fellowship, though.'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L04A4:	db	'Sir Pendaran'
	db	00
L04B1:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L04BC:	db	'fight'
	db	00
L04C2:	db	'fight'
	db	00
L04C8:	db	'"He and Menion used to spar together, after their exercises.'
	db	' \'Twas a beautiful... sight, '
	db	00
L0522:	db	'," she says, blushing.'
	db	00
L0539:	db	'fight'
	db	00
L053F:	db	'used to'
	db	00
L0547:	db	'used to'
	db	00
L054F:	db	'"At the time, Pendaran was the only man who could keep up wi'
	db	'th Menion. Now that Menion has begun instructing others, he '
	db	'no longer has the time to practice with my Lord."'
	db	00
L05F9:	db	'used to'
	db	00
L0601:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L060C:	db	'"Well, er, I mean, he would not have mixed well -before- he '
	db	'joined, that is," she stammers.'
	db	00
L0668:	db	'"It\'s nothing really. He was just a little bit more... indi'
	db	'vidualistic before he joined. I do not think there\'s anythi'
	db	'ng wrong with The Fellowship, necessarily; but I did not exp'
	db	'ect it to be something that would capture Pendaran\'s intere'
	db	'st."'
	db	00
L075A:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0765:	db	'knights'
	db	00
L076D:	db	'With but a few exceptions, myself included, all of the warri'
	db	'ors here in the Hold are knights. Thou mayest wish to speak '
	db	'with Lord John-Paul. He is in charge of Serpent\'s Hold and '
	db	'might be better able to show thee around.'
	db	00
L084A:	db	'knights'
	db	00
L0852:	db	'provisions'
	db	00
L085D:	db	'"Thou wishest to buy something?"'
	db	00
L087E:	db	'"Well, perhaps next time, '
	db	00
L0899:	db	'."'
	db	00
L089C:	db	'"A better time to buy would be when my shop is open."'
	db	00
L08D2:	db	'provisions'
	db	00
L08DD:	db	'commons'
	db	00
L08E5:	db	'For an instant, you see indecisiveness in her expression, th'
	db	'en she suddenly gives in, her words coming out in a torrent '
	db	'of information.~~"I am afraid to speak, but knowing thou wou'
	db	'ldst see through any facade, I can no longer silence the tru'
	db	'th. My Lord, Sir Pendaran, has not been the same gentle soul'
	db	' since he joined the Fellowship.~~"\'Twas not too long ago t'
	db	'hat my Pendaran was a noble knight, one a lady could be prou'
	db	'd of. But now," she shakes her head, "in protest of a wrong '
	db	'he perceives in Britannia\'s government, he has defaced the '
	db	'statue of our beloved Lord British." She begins to sob.~~"An'
	db	'd, he has battled and wounded a fellow knight who chanced up'
	db	'on him during his hour of misdeed. He came to me," she tries'
	db	' to choke back her tears, "with another\'s blood on his swor'
	db	'd!"~~After a few moments of your comforting, she regains her'
	db	' composure.~~"Please do not be too harsh with him," she begs'
	db	'.'
	db	00
L0C68:	db	'commons'
	db	00
L0C70:	db	'another'
	db	00
L0C78:	db	'another'
	db	00
L0C80:	db	'"I know not who, '
	db	00
L0C92:	db	', and Pendaran would not say!"'
	db	00
L0CB1:	db	'another'
	db	00
L0CB9:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0CBD:	db	'"May fortune follow thee, '
	db	00
L0CD8:	db	'."*'
	db	00
L0CDC:	db	'@Provisions!@'
	db	00
L0CEA:	db	'@Buy in advance!@'
	db	00
L0CFC:	db	'@Best provisions in town!@'
	db	00
L0D17:	db	'@Be equipped!@'
	db	00
L0D26:	db	'@Wondrous fine food!@'
	db	00
L0D3C:	db	'@Fine drink!@'
	db	00
L0D4A:	db	'@Mmmmm...@'
	db	00
L0D55:	db	'@I am full.@'
	db	00
