L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'Elizabeth and Abraham'
	db	00
L0023:	db	'You see a young, tan, muscular, handsome man who exudes much'
	db	' verve and geniality.'
	db	00
L0075:	db	'"Yes?" Ian asks.'
	db	00
L0086:	db	'name'
	db	00
L008B:	db	'"I am Ian."'
	db	00
L0097:	db	'name'
	db	00
L009C:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00A0:	db	'"I am the director of this Meditation Retreat for Fellowship'
	db	' members."'
	db	00
L00E7:	db	'Meditation Retreat'
	db	00
L00FA:	db	'director'
	db	00
L0103:	db	'director'
	db	00
L010C:	db	'"I manage the various activities and lead the initiates in t'
	db	'heir exercises in meditation."'
	db	00
L0167:	db	'director'
	db	00
L0170:	db	'exercises'
	db	00
L017A:	db	'activities'
	db	00
L0185:	db	'activities'
	db	00
L0190:	db	'"The activities of the retreat consist of philosophical trai'
	db	'ning and studies."'
	db	00
L01DF:	db	'activities'
	db	00
L01EA:	db	'exercises'
	db	00
L01F4:	db	'"The members must all grow to hear and understand the voice '
	db	'which guides them down the path of Inner Strength. The exerc'
	db	'ises in meditation accelerate this process."'
	db	00
L0299:	db	'exercises'
	db	00
L02A3:	db	'voice'
	db	00
L02A9:	db	'voice'
	db	00
L02AF:	db	'"It is that voice which one hears inside. We all have the ca'
	db	'pability of hearing it. Some are able to hear it quite easil'
	db	'y and do not have to attend sessions here at the Meditation '
	db	'Retreat. Others, however, find it more difficult to hear the'
	db	' voice. Then they require study at the Retreat."'
	db	00
L03D0:	db	'voice'
	db	00
L03D6:	db	'Meditation Retreat'
	db	00
L03E9:	db	'"It was set up by The Fellowship so that new members can att'
	db	'end and learn more about our group, get in touch with themse'
	db	'lves, and help them to become better brothers in The Fellows'
	db	'hip. Most of the work is done inside the barrier."'
	db	00
L04D0:	db	'Meditation Retreat'
	db	00
L04E3:	db	'barrier'
	db	00
L04EB:	db	'in touch'
	db	00
L04F4:	db	'in touch'
	db	00
L04FD:	db	'"Most of the people who come to The Fellowship are wrestling'
	db	' with the failures in their lives. They are essentially\tafr'
	db	'aid of themselves. Here at the Meditation Retreat people lea'
	db	'rn to believe in themselves. And they build up that belief b'
	db	'y learning how to best apply the philosophy of The\tFellowsh'
	db	'ip to their lives."'
	db	00
L063B:	db	'in touch'
	db	00
L0644:	db	'barrier'
	db	00
L064C:	db	'"It was set up to keep out those who are not members. Inside'
	db	' the barrier, Fellowship members find it much easier to hear'
	db	' their inner voice. Each member is given a key which they ma'
	db	'y use at any time."'
	db	00
L0714:	db	'barrier'
	db	00
L071C:	db	'key'
	db	00
L0720:	db	'key'
	db	00
L0724:	db	'"Ah, but thou art not a true Fellowship member! Thou art wea'
	db	'ring a medallion falsely. I cannot let thee inside. Goodbye.'
	db	'"*'
	db	00
L079F:	db	'"Oh, wouldst thou like to meditate with us, fellow brother?"'
	db	00
L07DC:	db	'"Then here is thy key. Be happy! Oh, one more thing. There i'
	db	's a rule which must be followed."'
	db	00
L083A:	db	'rule'
	db	00
L083F:	db	'"Oh. Then I cannot give thee a key."'
	db	00
L0864:	db	'"Art thou a Fellowship member?"'
	db	00
L0884:	db	'@I do not believe thee. Thou '
	db	00
L08A2:	db	'@Then thou '
	db	00
L08AE:	db	'must go to Britain and speak with Batlin at our headquarters'
	db	' there. Only he can properly initiate thee into The Fellowsh'
	db	'ip."'
	db	00
L092B:	db	'key'
	db	00
L092F:	db	'rule'
	db	00
L0934:	db	'"Do not venture into the cave which thou wilt find inside th'
	db	'e barrier. The cave is off-limits to attendees."'
	db	00
L09A1:	db	'rule'
	db	00
L09A6:	db	'Elizabeth and Abraham'
	db	00
L09BC:	db	'"Alas, thou hast just missed them. My good friends Elizabeth'
	db	' and Abraham were here delivering funds. I believe they have'
	db	' gone from here to Buccaneer\'s Den."'
	db	00
L0A59:	db	'"I have not seen them in quite some time."'
	db	00
L0A84:	db	'Elizabeth and Abraham'
	db	00
L0A9A:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0A9E:	db	'"Goodbye."*'
	db	00
