	.dsize       0818H
L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'A very neat, well-groomed, kindly man stands before you.'
	db	00
L0046:	db	'"Greetings, '
	db	00
L0053:	db	'. How may I help thee?"'
	db	00
L006B:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0070:	db	'He smiles at you. "Ah, excellent. Thou art not afraid to ask'
	db	' question. Remember, there are no stupid questions, only dum'
	db	'b ones. My name is Eldroth, '
	db	00
L0105:	db	'."'
	db	00
L0108:	db	'name'
	db	00
L010D:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0111:	db	'"I, my friend, am the provisioner. And, if I may be immodest'
	db	', also a counselor for Vesper. Perhaps I can someday give th'
	db	'ee advice, '
	db	00
L0195:	db	'. For remember, that which does not kill us, makes us wounde'
	db	'd."'
	db	00
L01D5:	db	'buy'
	db	00
L01D9:	db	'Vesper'
	db	00
L01E0:	db	'Vesper'
	db	00
L01E7:	db	'"Yes, '
	db	00
L01EE:	db	', this town is full of wonderful people to whom I have given'
	db	' advice."'
	db	00
L0234:	db	'advice'
	db	00
L023B:	db	'people'
	db	00
L0242:	db	'Vesper'
	db	00
L0249:	db	'advice'
	db	00
L0250:	db	'"Early to bed, early to rise, makes Jack a dull boy."'
	db	00
L0286:	db	'advice'
	db	00
L028D:	db	'buy'
	db	00
L0291:	db	'buy'
	db	00
L0295:	db	'"Thou wishest to make a purchase. Excellent. But remember, a'
	db	' gold piece saved is a gold piece not spent."'
	db	00
L02FF:	db	'"Perhaps thou couldst wait until my shop is open, '
	db	00
L0332:	db	'."'
	db	00
L0335:	db	'people'
	db	00
L033C:	db	'"About whom doth thou wish to know? Auston? The gargoyles? L'
	db	'iana? Cador? Perhaps Yongi?"'
	db	00
L0395:	db	'no one'
	db	00
L039C:	db	'Cador'
	db	00
L03A2:	db	'Yongi'
	db	00
L03A8:	db	'Liana'
	db	00
L03AE:	db	'gargoyles'
	db	00
L03B8:	db	'Auston'
	db	00
L03BF:	db	'people'
	db	00
L03C6:	db	'Liana'
	db	00
L03CC:	db	'"Liana is a very fine young woman who clerks at the townhall'
	db	'."'
	db	00
L040B:	db	'Liana'
	db	00
L0411:	db	'Yongi'
	db	00
L0417:	db	'"He is the bartender at the Glided Gizzard." He stops, shake'
	db	's his head, and then corrects himself. "I mean the Lilded Li'
	db	'zard," he frowns. "No, that\'s the Gilded Lizard. Yes that'
	db	'\'s it!"'
	db	00
L04D0:	db	'Yongi'
	db	00
L04D6:	db	'Cador'
	db	00
L04DC:	db	'"Cador oversees the mines. He and his wife, Yvella, have a l'
	db	'ovely daughter named Catherine."'
	db	00
L0539:	db	'Cador'
	db	00
L053F:	db	'Auston'
	db	00
L0546:	db	'"The mayor? I would have thought thou wouldst have met him b'
	db	'y now, '
	db	00
L058A:	db	'. He is performing an excellent job. Thou mayest not realize'
	db	' this," he blushes, "but \'tis I who suggested he run for th'
	db	'e office."'
	db	00
L060C:	db	'Auston'
	db	00
L0613:	db	'gargoyles'
	db	00
L061D:	db	'"I fear they will stage an uprising. I know Auston holds the'
	db	' same thoughts, for very recently he approached me and asked'
	db	' for my guidance to prepare for just such an incident. I wil'
	db	'l warn thee just as I warned him. Always remember, '
	db	00
L0705:	db	', the best defense is a good defense!"'
	db	00
L072C:	db	'gargoyles'
	db	00
L0736:	db	'no one'
	db	00
L073D:	db	'people'
	db	00
L0744:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0748:	db	'"Farewell, '
	db	00
L0754:	db	'. Never forget, the grass is always greener when it rains."'
	db	00
L0790:	db	'@A stitch in time uses more thread.@'
	db	00
L07B5:	db	'@Never hit a man when thou cannot.@'
	db	00
L07D9:	db	'@The early bird wakes up first.@'
	db	00
L07FA:	db	'@A bird in the hand squirms.@'
	db	00
