L0000:	db	'the Avatar'
	db	00
L000B:	db	'The gargoyle\'s hatred is so bitter that he resists the spel'
	db	'l.*'
	db	00
L004A:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L004E:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0052:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0057:	db	'The gargoyle stares at you, displeased at the interruption.'
	db	00
L0093:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0098:	db	'"To have no desire to tell you. To demand to know who you ar'
	db	'e!"'
	db	00
L00D8:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00DD:	db	'As the gargoyle looks up at you, anger crosses his face. He '
	db	'stands quickly, overturning his drink.'
	db	00
L0140:	db	'human'
	db	00
L0146:	db	' he says, pointing at you.'
	db	00
L0161:	db	'humans'
	db	00
L0168:	db	' he says, pointing at you and your companions.'
	db	00
L0197:	db	'"^'
	db	00
L019A:	db	'!"'
	db	00
L019D:	db	' "To be the cause for our unhappiness."'
	db	00
L01C5:	db	'The gargoyle by his side also rises.~~"To be the reason for '
	db	'our poverty. To die, '
	db	00
L0217:	db	', to die!"*'
	db	00
L0223:	db	'The two gargoyles force the table from their path with ease '
	db	'as they charge to attack you.*'
	db	00
L027E:	db	'He forces the table from his path with ease as he charges to'
	db	' attack you.*'
	db	00
L02C8:	db	'"To tell you to go away!"*'
	db	00
L02E3:	db	'job'
	db	00
L02E7:	db	'"To have none!" He glares fiercly at you."'
	db	00
L0312:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0316:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L031A:	db	'He grunts his dismissal.*'
	db	00
L0334:	db	'Though he glares as he passes, the gargoyle seems much too i'
	db	'ntent on reaching his destination to bother with you.*'
	db	00
