L0000:	db	'Avatar'
	db	00
L0007:	db	'The woman looks up in surprise and says, "I am not working a'
	db	't the moment and I ask thee to respect my privacy. If thou d'
	db	'ost wish to speak with me, come to The Baths in the late eve'
	db	'ning hours."*'
	db	00
L00C9:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L00CD:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00D1:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00D6:	db	'This attractive woman looks at you with surprise and says, "'
	db	'A moment! Thou didst just enjoy thyself, didst thou not? Ple'
	db	'ase come back when thou art rested."*'
	db	00
L0174:	db	'You see a gorgeous young woman with seductive eyes.'
	db	00
L01A8:	db	'"Hello, handsome!'
	db	00
L01BA:	db	'"Hello. Art thou sure thou dost not really want to speak wit'
	db	'h Roberto?"'
	db	00
L0202:	db	'"Fine, sweetheart. Whatever makes thy blood boil... '
	db	00
L0237:	db	'"Then thou hadst best speak with Roberto! He is probably mor'
	db	'e thy type."*'
	db	00
L0281:	db	'Who art thou?"'
	db	00
L0290:	db	'"Well, I am very pleased to meet thee, '
	db	00
L02B8:	db	'."'
	db	00
L02BB:	db	'"Hello, '
	db	00
L02C4:	db	'."'
	db	00
L02C7:	db	'"Oh ho! A real live Avatar?'
	db	00
L02E3:	db	'"Say, we should get to know one another better!"'
	db	00
L0314:	db	'"And female, as well! And I thought I had seen it all..."'
	db	00
L034E:	db	'"Hello again, '
	db	00
L035D:	db	'," Wench says.'
	db	00
L036C:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0371:	db	'"Thou canst just call me... Wench."'
	db	00
L0395:	db	'She blows you a kiss.'
	db	00
L03AB:	db	'name'
	db	00
L03B0:	db	'job'
	db	00
L03B4:	db	'She laughs aloud. "Thou must be kidding!" She composes herse'
	db	'lf and says, "It is my duty to see that thou art comfortable'
	db	' whilst at The Baths."'
	db	00
L0443:	db	'comfortable'
	db	00
L044F:	db	'The Baths'
	db	00
L0459:	db	'The Baths'
	db	00
L0463:	db	'"I have been working here since it opened. I love it. I am n'
	db	'ot exploited in the least. I make piles of gold and live a g'
	db	'reat life." '
	db	00
L04E8:	db	'She winks at you. "I meet many nice men, too!"'
	db	00
L0517:	db	'The Baths'
	db	00
L0521:	db	'comfortable'
	db	00
L052D:	db	'"Well, we could have a swim in the spring pools, or thou cou'
	db	'ldst have a massage. Or we could just talk.~~"Or... thou cou'
	db	'ldst come with me into the Community Room and I\'ll \'show'
	db	'\' thee my \'job\'!"'
	db	00
L05EF:	db	'comfortable'
	db	00
L05FB:	db	'Community Room'
	db	00
L060A:	db	'talk'
	db	00
L060F:	db	'massage'
	db	00
L0617:	db	'swim'
	db	00
L061C:	db	'Community Room'
	db	00
L062B:	db	'"Thou dost want to join me in the Community Room?"'
	db	00
L065E:	db	'Wench leads you into a private room.~~"It really isn\'t a Co'
	db	'mmunity Room at all. We shall be all alone," she giggles. ~~'
	db	'"By the way, it is a good thing thou didst choose me. Robert'
	db	'o and Martine enjoy stealing gold from their customers. I ma'
	db	'y have questionable morals, but I am not a thief! Now, let u'
	db	's get down to business, shall we?"'
	db	00
L07AC:	db	'A while later, after the woman has shown you more tricks tha'
	db	'n a mage on stage, you emerge from the Community Room a much'
	db	' happier Avatar.'
	db	00
L0835:	db	'"\'Tis not a problem, '
	db	00
L084B:	db	'."'
	db	00
L084E:	db	'Community Room'
	db	00
L085D:	db	'swim'
	db	00
L0862:	db	'Wench helps you with your clothing and leads you into the wa'
	db	'rm spring water. It feels terrific, and you would prefer to '
	db	'go to sleep, but you know you have a quest to fulfill. After'
	db	' a while, Wench helps you out of the water and you dress.'
	db	00
L0950:	db	'swim'
	db	00
L0955:	db	'massage'
	db	00
L095D:	db	'Wench helps you with your clothing and leads you to a comfor'
	db	'table table. You lie on your stomach and the woman expertly '
	db	'kneads and rubs your aching muscles, slowly sending you into'
	db	' a state of total relaxation. After a while, Wench helps you'
	db	' up and you dress.'
	db	00
L0A60:	db	'massage'
	db	00
L0A68:	db	'talk'
	db	00
L0A6D:	db	'Wench shrugs. "Fine with me! What shall we talk about? I kno'
	db	'w! Want to know a secret?"'
	db	00
L0AC4:	db	'"Didst thou know that there are secret passages in the mount'
	db	'ains connecting the buildings on Buccaneer\'s Den? \'Tis tru'
	db	'e! I am fairly sure the entrance is through the House of Gam'
	db	'es,\tand I do know that there is a way into The Baths from t'
	db	'he passages!"'
	db	00
L0BBF:	db	'Wench pouts. "Well never mind, then!"'
	db	00
L0BE5:	db	'You and Wench speak of a number of other subjects when you r'
	db	'ealize that you are spending too much time in the spa. There'
	db	' is a quest to fulfill!'
	db	00
L0C75:	db	'talk'
	db	00
L0C7A:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0C7E:	db	'"Oh, please come again soon, '
	db	00
L0C9C:	db	'!"'
	db	00
L0C9F:	db	'Wench blows you a kiss.*'
	db	00
L0CB8:	db	'Wench waves goodbye.*'
	db	00
