L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see a handsome, muscular man with an air of mischief abo'
	db	'ut him.'
	db	00
L0051:	db	'"Yes, may I help thee?" Glenno asks.'
	db	00
L0076:	db	'name'
	db	00
L007B:	db	'"Glenno at thy service!"'
	db	00
L0094:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0099:	db	'job'
	db	00
L009D:	db	'"I am the manager of The Baths.'
	db	00
L00BD:	db	'"The entrance fee is 300 gold. Everything is included in thi'
	db	's fixed price. No tips are necessary. Dost thou want to ente'
	db	'r?"'
	db	00
L0139:	db	'"Excellent! Here is thy key!'
	db	00
L0156:	db	'"Thine hands are too full to carry the key!"*'
	db	00
L0184:	db	'"What art thou trying to pull? Thou hast not 300 gold!"*'
	db	00
L01BD:	db	'"Well, some other time, then! Thou wilt not be sorry if thou'
	db	' dost! It is well worth the price."*'
	db	00
L021E:	db	'"Enter! Please relax! Enjoy thyself! Allow one of our hosts '
	db	'or hostesses to make thy stay more comfortable. '
	db	00
L028B:	db	'He notices your medallion. "Fellowship members are especiall'
	db	'y welcome!"'
	db	00
L02D3:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L02DE:	db	'"Please! Make thyself at home. If thou dost want a drink, le'
	db	't me know."'
	db	00
L0326:	db	'"Uhm, wait a minute. How old art thou, boy?"*'
	db	00
L0354:	db	'"Uhm, eighteen."*'
	db	00
L0366:	db	'"Thou dost not look eighteen."*'
	db	00
L0386:	db	'"All right, I am sixteen."*'
	db	00
L03A2:	db	'"Thou dost not look sixteen either. Well, never mind. Thou c'
	db	'anst enter. But make sure the management doth not see thee."'
	db	' Glenno scratches his head. "Yes, but... no! I am the manage'
	db	'ment! All right, come on. Just don\'t cause any trouble."*'
	db	00
L0490:	db	'"All right! Wenches!"*'
	db	00
L04A7:	db	'Iolo whispers to you, "Methinks young Spark hath learned a l'
	db	'ot whilst adventuring with thee!"*'
	db	00
L0506:	db	'drink'
	db	00
L050C:	db	'The Baths'
	db	00
L0516:	db	'"Please come visit in the late evening hours when our hosts '
	db	'and hostesses are here!"'
	db	00
L056B:	db	'The Baths'
	db	00
L0575:	db	'"The Baths exist for the pleasure of visitors to Buccaneer'
	db	'\'s Den. Thou canst bathe in our spring pools. Thou canst lo'
	db	'unge in our Community Room and socialize with our attractive'
	db	' hosts or hostesses. Thou canst drink fine wine and ale. Tho'
	db	'u canst view our collection of fine artwork. Thou canst... e'
	db	'scape into a dream-world!"'
	db	00
L06B9:	db	'The Baths'
	db	00
L06C3:	db	'fine artwork'
	db	00
L06D0:	db	'Community Room'
	db	00
L06DF:	db	'hosts or hostesses'
	db	00
L06F2:	db	'spring pools'
	db	00
L06FF:	db	'drink'
	db	00
L0705:	db	'hosts or hostesses'
	db	00
L0718:	db	'"They have come from all over Britannia to serve thine every'
	db	' wish! I, Glenno, have assured them that The Baths is the mo'
	db	'st prestigious establishment of its kind anywhere in the kno'
	db	'wn world. It is probably the only establishment of its kind '
	db	'in the known world!"'
	db	00
L081D:	db	'hosts or hostesses'
	db	00
L0830:	db	'spring pools'
	db	00
L083D:	db	'"The water is guaranteed to be pure, warm and cleansing."'
	db	00
L0877:	db	'spring pools'
	db	00
L0884:	db	'Community Room'
	db	00
L0893:	db	'"Thou canst lie in comfort among the many soft cushions and '
	db	'pillows. Get to know thy neighbor. Get to know thy neighbor '
	db	'\'very well\'!"'
	db	00
L0919:	db	'Community Room'
	db	00
L0928:	db	'fine artwork'
	db	00
L0935:	db	'"Ah, yes, those are erotic masterpieces from the brush of Br'
	db	'itannian artist Glen Johnson. Notice how the curves on that '
	db	'one are extremely naturalistic, dost thou not agree?"'
	db	00
L09E3:	db	'fine artwork'
	db	00
L09F0:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L09FB:	db	'"Yes, I am a member. If it were not for The Fellowship, I wo'
	db	'uld not be manager of The Baths! I served the group well, tr'
	db	'usted my many brothers, strived for unity, and... well, my w'
	db	'orthiness preceded my reward! And all of this... was my rewa'
	db	'rd!" Glenno smiles as if he were a tomcat who had just swall'
	db	'owed a mouse.'
	db	00
L0B35:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0B40:	db	'reward'
	db	00
L0B47:	db	'reward'
	db	00
L0B4E:	db	'"Yes, The Fellowship gave me this place. They own it, thou k'
	db	'nowest." Suddenly Glenno holds his hand to his mouth, as if '
	db	'he has said something he shouldn\'t have. "I mean, The Fello'
	db	'wship only owns the -land- on which it was built. I -built- '
	db	'The Baths with money with which I was rewarded by The Fellow'
	db	'ship. So, enough of that -- enjoy thyself. I must tend to bu'
	db	'siness!" With that, Glenno turns away from you.*'
	db	00
L0CE6:	db	'reward'
	db	00
L0CED:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0CF1:	db	'"Leaving so soon?"*'
	db	00
L0D05:	db	'@Wine and women!@'
	db	00
L0D17:	db	'@Need a girl, sailor?@'
	db	00
L0D2E:	db	'@How about a stud, lady?@'
	db	00
L0D48:	db	'@Relax here in The Baths!@'
	db	00
