L0000:	db	'Avatar'
	db	00
L0007:	db	'The woman looks up in surprise and says, "I am not working a'
	db	't the moment and I ask thee to respect my privacy. If thou d'
	db	'ost wish to speak with me, come to The Baths in the late eve'
	db	'ning hours."*'
	db	00
L00C9:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L00CD:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00D1:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00D6:	db	'This attractive woman looks at you with surprise and says, "'
	db	'Honey, thou just enjoyed thyself, didst thou not? Please com'
	db	'e back when thou art rested."*'
	db	00
L016D:	db	'You see a beautiful young woman with a tropical air.'
	db	00
L01A2:	db	'"Hello, handsome!'
	db	00
L01B4:	db	'"Hello, dear. Art thou sure thou dost not want to speak with'
	db	' Roberto?"'
	db	00
L01FB:	db	'"All right, honey. Whatever heats thy blood..."'
	db	00
L022B:	db	'"Then thou had best speak with him! He is probably more to t'
	db	'hy liking."*'
	db	00
L0274:	db	'"What is thy name?"'
	db	00
L0288:	db	'"How art thou, '
	db	00
L0298:	db	'? I am so happy to meet thee!"'
	db	00
L02B7:	db	'"Hello, '
	db	00
L02C0:	db	'."'
	db	00
L02C3:	db	'"Oh please! Not another Avatar!"'
	db	00
L02E4:	db	'Martine takes a deep breath, then smiles.'
	db	00
L030E:	db	'"Well, honey, it does not matter who thou art. We shalt have'
	db	' a good time anyway."'
	db	00
L0360:	db	'"Hello again, '
	db	00
L036F:	db	'," Martine says.'
	db	00
L0380:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0385:	db	'"The name I use here is Martine. Thou dost understand..." Sh'
	db	'e winks at you.'
	db	00
L03D1:	db	'name'
	db	00
L03D6:	db	'job'
	db	00
L03DA:	db	'"Honey, my job is to make thee happy.'
	db	00
L0400:	db	'"My dear, my job is to serve thee.'
	db	00
L0423:	db	'"\'Tis important that thou art comfortable whilst visiting T'
	db	'he Baths."'
	db	00
L0469:	db	'comfortable'
	db	00
L0475:	db	'The Baths'
	db	00
L047F:	db	'The Baths'
	db	00
L0489:	db	'"\'Tis a fabulous place to work. I absolutely love it. I wou'
	db	'ld not work anywhere else. I have more gold than I could pos'
	db	'sibly spend."'
	db	00
L050E:	db	'Martine blows a kiss at you. "I meet many kinds of interesti'
	db	'ng people, too!"'
	db	00
L055B:	db	'The Baths'
	db	00
L0565:	db	'comfortable'
	db	00
L0571:	db	'"Thou dost have many choices. We could take a swim in our sp'
	db	'ring pools. Or I could perform a massage on thee. Or we coul'
	db	'd simply talk.~~"But if thou dost want to really get to know'
	db	' me better, we should visit the Community Room..."'
	db	00
L0658:	db	'comfortable'
	db	00
L0664:	db	'Community Room'
	db	00
L0673:	db	'talk'
	db	00
L0678:	db	'massage'
	db	00
L0680:	db	'swim'
	db	00
L0685:	db	'Community Room'
	db	00
L0694:	db	'"Thou dost want to join me in the Community Room?"'
	db	00
L06C7:	db	'Martine leads you into a private room.~~"It really is not a '
	db	'Community Room at all. We shall be all alone!"~~ A while lat'
	db	'er, after the woman has shown you more tricks than a crooked'
	db	' street mage, you emerge from the Community Room a much happ'
	db	'ier Avatar.'
	db	00
L07C3:	db	'"That\'s all right, honey."'
	db	00
L07DE:	db	'Community Room'
	db	00
L07ED:	db	'swim'
	db	00
L07F2:	db	'Martine helps you with your clothing and leads you into the '
	db	'warm spring water. It feels fabulous, and you would love to '
	db	'go to sleep; but you know you have a quest to finish. After '
	db	'a while, Martine helps you out of the water and you dress.'
	db	00
L08E1:	db	'swim'
	db	00
L08E6:	db	'massage'
	db	00
L08EE:	db	'Martine helps you with your clothing and leads you to a comf'
	db	'ortable table. You lie on your stomach and the woman expertl'
	db	'y kneads and rubs your aching muscles, slowly sending you in'
	db	'to a state of oblivion. After a while, Martine helps you up '
	db	'and you dress.'
	db	00
L09ED:	db	'massage'
	db	00
L09F5:	db	'talk'
	db	00
L09FA:	db	'Martine smiles. "That is just fine with me, honey. I would w'
	db	'ager thou hast many stories to tell about adventuring, yes? '
	db	'Say! Hast thou been in the secret passages in the mountains?'
	db	' Didst thou know they are all connected? I know that there i'
	db	's a secret door that leads right into the back of this build'
	db	'ing!" She whispers, "I believe the entrance is through the H'
	db	'ouse of Games."~~You and Martine speak of a number of other '
	db	'subjects until you realize you have spent too much time in t'
	db	'he spa. There is a quest to finish!'
	db	00
L0BFE:	db	'talk'
	db	00
L0C03:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0C07:	db	'"I hope to see thee again soon, honey!"'
	db	00
L0C2F:	db	'Martine blows you a kiss.*'
	db	00
L0C4A:	db	'Martine waves goodbye.*'
	db	00
