L00D4:	db	'The man looks at you with surprise and says, "Hold, '
	db	00
L0109:	db	'! Thou didst just enjoy thyself, didst thou not? Please come'
	db	' back when thou art rested!"*'
	db	00
L0163:	db	'You see a strikingly handsome man with eyes that pierce your'
	db	' soul.'
	db	00
L01A6:	db	'"Hello, gorgeous!'
	db	00
L01B8:	db	'"Hello. Uhm, art thou sure thou dost not really want to spea'
	db	'k with Wench or Martine?"'
	db	00
L020E:	db	'"Fine, sailor, whatever makes thy blood boil...'
	db	00
L023E:	db	'"Then thou hadst best speak with one of them. They are proba'
	db	'bly more to thy liking!"*'
	db	00
L0294:	db	'"What is thy name?"'
	db	00
L02A8:	db	'"Well, I am very pleased to meet thee, '
	db	00
L02D0:	db	'."'
	db	00
L02D3:	db	'"Hello, '
	db	00
L02DC:	db	'."'
	db	00
L02DF:	db	'Roberto does a double-take. "The Avatar, eh? And I thought I'
	db	' had heard it all..."'
	db	00
L0331:	db	'"Hello again, '
	db	00
L0340:	db	'," Roberto says.'
	db	00
L0351:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0356:	db	'"I am known in these parts as Roberto."'
	db	00
L037E:	db	'Roberto takes your hand and says, "And thou art the most bea'
	db	'utiful woman I have ever laid eyes upon!"'
	db	00
L03E4:	db	'name'
	db	00
L03E9:	db	'job'
	db	00
L03ED:	db	'Roberto smiles broadly. "Thou dost not really want to know t'
	db	'hat, dost thou?" He shakes his head, suppressing a laugh. "V'
	db	'ery well -- it is my task to see that thou art truly comfort'
	db	'able whilst at The Baths."'
	db	00
L04BC:	db	'comfortable'
	db	00
L04C8:	db	'The Baths'
	db	00
L04D2:	db	'The Baths'
	db	00
L04DC:	db	'beautiful women '
	db	00
L04ED:	db	'handsome men '
	db	00
L04FB:	db	'"Nice place, is it not? I certainly enjoy working here! It b'
	db	'rings me much wealth, and I have many opportunities to meet '
	db	00
L0574:	db	'such as thyself!"'
	db	00
L0586:	db	'The Baths'
	db	00
L0590:	db	'comfortable'
	db	00
L059C:	db	'"What would suit thee? We could swim in the spring pools, or'
	db	' I could give thee a massage. If thou dost prefer to convers'
	db	'e, we could simply talk. Or if thou wouldst like, we could w'
	db	'ander into the Community Room and... communicate!"'
	db	00
L0683:	db	'comfortable'
	db	00
L068F:	db	'Community Room'
	db	00
L069E:	db	'talk'
	db	00
L06A3:	db	'massage'
	db	00
L06AB:	db	'swim'
	db	00
L06B0:	db	'Community Room'
	db	00
L06BF:	db	'"Thou dost want to join me in the Community Room?"'
	db	00
L06F2:	db	'Roberto leads you into a private room.~~"It really isn\'t a '
	db	'Community Room at all. We shall be all alone!" ~~A while lat'
	db	'er, after you have received the man\'s full attention, you e'
	db	'merge from the Community Room a much happier Avatar.'
	db	00
L07D9:	db	'"Do not worry about it, '
	db	00
L07F2:	db	'. We can do something else."'
	db	00
L080F:	db	'Community Room'
	db	00
L081E:	db	'swim'
	db	00
L0823:	db	'Roberto helps you with your clothing and leads you into the '
	db	'warm spring water. It feels terrific, and you feel like goin'
	db	'g to sleep, but you know you have a quest to complete. After'
	db	' a while, Roberto helps you out of the water and you dress.'
	db	00
L0913:	db	'swim'
	db	00
L0918:	db	'massage'
	db	00
L0920:	db	'Roberto helps you with your clothing and leads you to a comf'
	db	'ortable table. You lie face down and the man expertly kneads'
	db	' and rubs your aching muscles, slowly sending you over the e'
	db	'dge into a state of total relaxation. After a while, Roberto'
	db	' helps you up and you dress.'
	db	00
L0A2D:	db	'massage'
	db	00
L0A35:	db	'talk'
	db	00
L0A3A:	db	'Roberto smiles. "That is all right. What shall we talk about'
	db	'? Adventuring? Secret passages and dungeons?"~~ Roberto lean'
	db	's closer and whispers, "Didst thou know that there are secre'
	db	't passages connecting the buildings on Buccaneer\'s Den? \'T'
	db	'is true! I am fairly sure the entrance is through the House '
	db	'of Games, and I am quite sure there is a way into The Baths.'
	db	'"~~You and Roberto speak of a number of other subjects until'
	db	' you realize that you are spending far too much time in the '
	db	'spa. There is a quest to fulfill!'
	db	00
L0C3A:	db	'talk'
	db	00
L0C3F:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0C43:	db	'"I hope to see thee again, '
	db	00
L0C5F:	db	'."*'
	db	00
