L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see a man whose sinewy body is like steel. The glint in '
	db	'his eye tells you that he is no fool.'
	db	00
L006F:	db	'"What dost thou want with Lucky?" the pirate asks.'
	db	00
L00A2:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00A7:	db	'"I am Lucky... in all things."'
	db	00
L00C6:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00CB:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00CF:	db	'"I make my living off the world! It gives... and I take!" Th'
	db	'e pirate laughs boisterously. "I am a worldly gentleman, fri'
	db	'ends -- that is my \'job\'! Oh, and I train initiates for a '
	db	'bit of pocket change."'
	db	00
L0198:	db	'train'
	db	00
L019E:	db	'world'
	db	00
L01A4:	db	'world'
	db	00
L01AA:	db	'"The ways of the world, is what I mean. I am a man of the ro'
	db	'ad; I am a seasoned traveller. I travel through the world as'
	db	' a hundred different men."'
	db	00
L023D:	db	'different'
	db	00
L0247:	db	'traveller'
	db	00
L0251:	db	'world'
	db	00
L0257:	db	'traveller'
	db	00
L0261:	db	'"In truth there are few places where I have not been and lit'
	db	'tle that I have not done."'
	db	00
L02B8:	db	'traveller'
	db	00
L02C2:	db	'different'
	db	00
L02CC:	db	'"Thou canst be a different person just by assumption. \'Tis '
	db	'an attitude. I am an expert in the art of charismatic commun'
	db	'ication for the purposes of deception. It gives one many ski'
	db	'lls. For example, I can walk into any shop and make a purcha'
	db	'se. But I will walk away with much more than I bought, for I'
	db	' know how to fool the shopkeeper. Little things like that."'
	db	00
L0433:	db	'different'
	db	00
L043D:	db	'train'
	db	00
L0443:	db	'"I charge 35 gold for a training session. Doth this meet wit'
	db	'h thine approval?"'
	db	00
L0492:	db	'Lucky shrugs. "Thou wilt not find another trainer on the isl'
	db	'and!"'
	db	00
L04D4:	db	'train'
	db	00
L04DA:	db	'"I shall be happy to show thee my ways of the world during n'
	db	'ormal business hours at my residence -- afternoons and eveni'
	db	'ngs."'
	db	00
L0558:	db	'train'
	db	00
L055E:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0562:	db	'"Be careful, my friend."*'
	db	00
L057C:	db	'@Har!@'
	db	00
L0583:	db	'@Avast!@'
	db	00
L058C:	db	'@Blast!@'
	db	00
L0595:	db	'@Damn parrot droppings...@'
	db	00
