	.dsize       03E2H
L0000:	db	'Ellen puts her finger to her lips. There is a Fellowship mee'
	db	'ting going on.*'
	db	00
L004C:	db	'"Hello. I am sorry to be rude, but I am late to the Fellowsh'
	db	'ip meeting. May we speak another time?"*'
	db	00
L00B1:	db	'This is a woman who seems pleasant and welcoming. "I am prou'
	db	'd to meet the Avatar," she says, beaming.'
	db	00
L0117:	db	'"Yes, Avatar?" Ellen asks.'
	db	00
L0132:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0136:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L013D:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0141:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0146:	db	'name'
	db	00
L014B:	db	'"My name is Ellen."'
	db	00
L015F:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0164:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0168:	db	'"I do the bookkeeping at the Fellowship Branch. I work with '
	db	'mine husband, Klog."'
	db	00
L01B9:	db	'Klog'
	db	00
L01BE:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L01C9:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L01D0:	db	'"\'Tis awful, is it not? Of course, I was home with Klog all'
	db	' night."'
	db	00
L0214:	db	'murder'
	db	00
L021B:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0226:	db	'"Perhaps thou couldst call it a \'confident philosophy\'. We'
	db	' meet here at the branch office every night."'
	db	00
L028E:	db	'branch office'
	db	00
L029C:	db	'philosophy'
	db	00
L02A7:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L02B2:	db	'branch office'
	db	00
L02C0:	db	'"The Fellowship has branches all over Britannia. It is a mos'
	db	't popular philosophical society."'
	db	00
L031E:	db	'branch office'
	db	00
L032C:	db	'Klog'
	db	00
L0331:	db	'"Mine husband Klog is a wonderful branch leader. He is an in'
	db	'spiration to all of the Trinsic members."'
	db	00
L0397:	db	'Klog'
	db	00
L039C:	db	'philosophy'
	db	00
L03A7:	db	'philosophy'
	db	00
L03B2:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L03B6:	db	'"Goodbye. I hope to see thee again, soon."*'
	db	00
