	.dsize       06E6H
L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'The man before you stretches and inhales deeply.'
	db	00
L003E:	db	'"Glorious day, '
	db	00
L004E:	db	'." Perrin grins.'
	db	00
L005F:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0064:	db	'"Please, '
	db	00
L006E:	db	', call me Perrin. I reside here in Empath Abbey."'
	db	00
L00A0:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00A5:	db	'Empath Abbey'
	db	00
L00B2:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00B6:	db	'"I am a scholar, '
	db	00
L00C8:	db	'. Dost thou want training in the realm of books?"'
	db	00
L00FA:	db	'"My price is 45 gold for each training session, but I will a'
	db	'lso teach thee what little I know about magic. Is this accep'
	db	'table?"'
	db	00
L017A:	db	'"Very well, '
	db	00
L0187:	db	'."'
	db	00
L018A:	db	'"Forgive me, I am a bit overzealous in my search for student'
	db	's. I hope thou wilt return in the future."'
	db	00
L01F1:	db	'Empath Abbey'
	db	00
L01FE:	db	'"This is a pleasant location. I like the privacy, which give'
	db	's me a chance to study when I need to. The Brotherhood is ac'
	db	'ross the road, and I am near a healer. Also, I have begun a '
	db	'study on the effects of dealing with death for undertakers. '
	db	'I am using Tiery as a case study."'
	db	00
L0311:	db	'Tiery'
	db	00
L0317:	db	'healer'
	db	00
L031E:	db	'Brotherhood'
	db	00
L032A:	db	'Empath Abbey'
	db	00
L0337:	db	'Brotherhood'
	db	00
L0343:	db	'"That is the abbey. The monks who reside there are famous fo'
	db	'r their ability to produce exquisite wine. Nearby is the Hig'
	db	'hcourt and a prison."'
	db	00
L03D1:	db	'Brotherhood'
	db	00
L03DD:	db	'prison'
	db	00
L03E4:	db	'highcourt'
	db	00
L03EE:	db	'wine'
	db	00
L03F3:	db	'wine'
	db	00
L03F8:	db	'"Thou shouldst try some. The monks have been making it for m'
	db	'ore than three hundred years!"'
	db	00
L0453:	db	'wine'
	db	00
L0458:	db	'highcourt'
	db	00
L0462:	db	'"The official there is named Sir Jeff. From what I hear, he '
	db	'runs his ship very tight. I do not envy the jailer that work'
	db	's with him. It must be extremely difficult to be near such a'
	db	' strict disciplinarian all day long."'
	db	00
L053C:	db	'highcourt'
	db	00
L0546:	db	'prison'
	db	00
L054D:	db	'"It is located just behind the court. And," he grins, "I am '
	db	'proud to say that is at least one thing about which I know n'
	db	'othing."'
	db	00
L05CE:	db	'prison'
	db	00
L05D5:	db	'Tiery'
	db	00
L05DB:	db	'"He is the undertaker who lives just north of the Brotherhoo'
	db	'd."'
	db	00
L061B:	db	'Tiery'
	db	00
L0621:	db	'healer'
	db	00
L0628:	db	'"I have yet to meet her, but I know she loves animals. I hav'
	db	'e seen her playing with the deer and squirrels that inhabit '
	db	'this region."'
	db	00
L06AE:	db	'healer'
	db	00
L06B5:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L06B9:	db	'"Goodbye, '
	db	00
L06C4:	db	'. Best of luck in thy journeys."*'
	db	00
