L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'"I thank thee,'
	db	00
L001C:	db	'. Truly thou possesseth great honor! I hope one day to be ab'
	db	'le to repay thee for thy kindness!"*'
	db	00
L007D:	db	'You are greeted by a man with a sour expression.'
	db	00
L00AE:	db	'"Harrumph," says Anton.'
	db	00
L00C6:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00CB:	db	'"I," he says scratching his nose, "am Anton, not that thou w'
	db	'ouldst be concerned with me. Unless, of course, thou art abo'
	db	'ut to put me in the stocks."'
	db	00
L0160:	db	'*'
	db	00
L0162:	db	'"Be polite, Anton. I am sure '
	db	00
L0180:	db	' is truly interested in thy name."'
	db	00
L01A3:	db	'name'
	db	00
L01A8:	db	'stocks'
	db	00
L01AF:	db	'concerned'
	db	00
L01B9:	db	'job'
	db	00
L01BD:	db	'"What kind of bloody stupid question is that? I am in the pr'
	db	'ison! What kind of job could I possibly have?"'
	db	00
L0228:	db	'*'
	db	00
L022A:	db	'"Yeah, stupid question."'
	db	00
L0243:	db	'*'
	db	00
L0245:	db	'"Relax, Anton. I am sure that thou wilt have a job again soo'
	db	'n enough." He turns to you.~~"He was apprenticed to the sage'
	db	' Alagner who bade him find out information about The Fellows'
	db	'hip..."'
	db	00
L0301:	db	'"Silence, fool! They will slay me for sure, now!" He looks a'
	db	't you with despair.*'
	db	00
L0352:	db	'"Hast thou already forgotten, dear Anton? Thou didst divulge'
	db	' that information to them some time ago."*'
	db	00
L03B9:	db	'"I did?"*'
	db	00
L03C3:	db	'He nods.*'
	db	00
L03CD:	db	'Anton turns to the troll.~~"I did?"*'
	db	00
L03F2:	db	'The troll nods.*'
	db	00
L0403:	db	'"Oh, well, then. Carry on!"*'
	db	00
L0420:	db	'"As I was saying, his instructor sent him to observe the Fel'
	db	'lowship. Of course, he was discovered and brought here for t'
	db	'orturing." He turns back to Anton.~~"Never fear, however, An'
	db	'ton. \'Twill be no time before thou art free again, able to '
	db	'return to thy tutor, Alagner, and resume thy studies," he sa'
	db	'ys, smiling.*'
	db	00
L0559:	db	'Alagner'
	db	00
L0561:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L056C:	db	'stocks'
	db	00
L0573:	db	'"Yes, they are likely to keep me in them the next time until'
	db	' I rot. Or, at the very least, until I die from the troll\'s'
	db	' lashings."'
	db	00
L05F6:	db	'lashings'
	db	00
L05FF:	db	'they'
	db	00
L0604:	db	'"I am being held here for spying, '
	db	00
L0627:	db	'. \'Tis a false accusation, but they will likely kill me any'
	db	'way...."'
	db	00
L066B:	db	'they'
	db	00
L0670:	db	'false'
	db	00
L0676:	db	'spying'
	db	00
L067D:	db	'stocks'
	db	00
L0684:	db	'concerned'
	db	00
L068E:	db	'"Well, so few people are, really."'
	db	00
L06B1:	db	'concerned'
	db	00
L06BB:	db	'false'
	db	00
L06C1:	db	'"Well, I am certainly not guilty of such an act!"'
	db	00
L06F3:	db	'false'
	db	00
L06F9:	db	'spying'
	db	00
L0700:	db	'"To think I would seek information for any reason other than'
	db	' to enhance myself with knowledge is more than preposterous!'
	db	' It is... it is... ludicrous is what it is!"'
	db	00
L07A5:	db	'spying'
	db	00
L07AC:	db	'they'
	db	00
L07B1:	db	'"Why, The Fellowship, '
	db	00
L07C8:	db	'."'
	db	00
L07CB:	db	'they'
	db	00
L07D0:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L07DB:	db	'lashings'
	db	00
L07E4:	db	'"The troll beats me many times during the day. I will not be'
	db	' able to survive for much longer."'
	db	00
L0843:	db	'*'
	db	00
L0845:	db	'"Come, come, Anton, surely it cannot be that terrible. After'
	db	' all, The Fellowship is providing us with a place to stay an'
	db	'd more food than we could... more food... Well, they are als'
	db	'o giving us food!"*'
	db	00
L090D:	db	'lashings'
	db	00
L0916:	db	'Alagner'
	db	00
L091E:	db	'"He is a sage who resides in New Magincia. Perhaps the most '
	db	'learned man in all Britannia! And now," he sighs, "I will no'
	db	' longer have the opportunity to glean knowledge from his vol'
	db	'uminous body of wisdom."'
	db	00
L09EB:	db	'Alagner'
	db	00
L09F3:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L09FE:	db	'"Why, they are a wonderful group of people who are constantl'
	db	'y seeking to bring health, happiness, and spirituality to th'
	db	'e people of Britannia."'
	db	00
L0A8E:	db	'With his index finger, he motions you closer to him and lowe'
	db	'rs his voice.~~"In a pig\'s eye, that is! I am departing thi'
	db	's den of evil as soon as I get the chance. And I advise thee'
	db	' to do the same!"'
	db	00
L0B53:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0B5E:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0B62:	db	'"Do not hurry too much, '
	db	00
L0B7B:	db	', for the world as we know it will soon be no more."*'
	db	00
