	db	00
L0813:	db	'merchant'
	db	00
L081C:	db	'"Dost thou have any news of the travelling merchant who kill'
	db	'ed Balayna?'
	db	00
L0864:	db	'"Very good, '
	db	00
L0871:	db	'. What is thy news?"'
	db	00
L0886:	db	'dead'
	db	00
L088B:	db	'not ready'
	db	00
L0895:	db	'"Ah, well. Keep searching. I am positive thou wilt come acro'
	db	'ss some information soon!"'
	db	00
L08EC:	db	'merchant'
	db	00
L08F5:	db	'not ready'
	db	00
L08FF:	db	'"Very well, '
	db	00
L090C:	db	', I can wait until thou hast learned more."'
	db	00
L0938:	db	'not ready'
	db	00
L0942:	db	'dead'
	db	00
L0947:	db	'"Really!" he seems genuinely surprised. "How, ah, wonderful.'
	db	'" Then I guess the murder has been avenged."'
	db	00
L09B0:	db	'dead'
	db	00
L09B5:	db	'new'
	db	00
L09B9:	db	'"He grins, obviously embarrassed. "I am sorry. Though the br'
	db	'anch opened here several years ago, it is the newest branch '
	db	'on Britannia. I still consider myself a new branch head here'
	db	'."'
	db	00
L0A70:	db	'new'
	db	00
L0A74:	db	'Moonglow'
	db	00
L0A7D:	db	'"Ah, yes, Moonglow. It is a pleasant town. It is possible to'
	db	' find all sorts of people here."'
	db	00
L0ADA:	db	'people'
	db	00
L0AE1:	db	'Moonglow'
	db	00
L0AEA:	db	'people'
	db	00
L0AF1:	db	'"I am sorry, but I prefer not to gossip."'
	db	00
L0B1B:	db	'people'
	db	00
L0B22:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0B2D:	db	'"As is customary, our meetings are at 9 p.m. Please feel fre'
	db	'e to join us."'
	db	00
L0B78:	db	'"Thou shouldst really return thy medallion to the person fro'
	db	'm whom it came. Only Fellowship members are permitted to wea'
	db	'r them."'
	db	00
L0BF9:	db	'"If thou hast a free moment, I would be quite happy to discu'
	db	'ss our philosophy with thee."'
	db	00
L0C53:	db	'philosophy'
	db	00
L0C5E:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0C69:	db	'philosophy'
	db	00
L0C74:	db	'philosophy'
	db	00
L0C7F:	db	'voice'
	db	00
L0C85:	db	'"Relax, friend, thou wilt hear when the time is right."'
	db	00
L0CBD:	db	'"There is an inner voice that exists within each and every o'
	db	'ne of us. This voice is our companion and guide.~~"The deepe'
	db	'r one\'s involvement with The Fellowship, the more often one'
	db	' is able to hear one\'s inner voice."'
	db	00
L0D95:	db	'voice'
	db	00
L0D9B:	db	'Elizabeth and Abraham'
	db	00
L0DB1:	db	'"What dear people! They were just here in order to give me m'
	db	'y training session. I was just appointed branch leader. This'
	db	' is a new branch, thou knowest. Anyway, Elizabeth and Abraha'
	db	'm left to travel all the way to the gargoyle island, Terfin.'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L0EA3:	db	'"I have not seen them since they gave me my training session'
	db	', many days ago."'
	db	00
L0EF1:	db	'Elizabeth and Abraham'
	db	00
L0F07:	db	'Balayna\'s accusation'
	db	00
L0F1C:	db	'"Shhh! Talk to me about it later," he whispers, gesturing su'
	db	'btly towards Balayna, "when she is not around."'
	db	00
L0F88:	db	'He begins to look amused.~~"I would not let it worry thee to'
	db	'o much, '
	db	00
L0FCD:	db	'. I am afraid Balayna is a bit too ambitious. I would expect'
	db	' she overheard one of my conversion speeches and misundersto'
	db	'od my words. I will have to discuss this with her when I hav'
	db	'e more time so I may allay her fears." His eyes widen, as if'
	db	' he is remembering something.~~"I had forgotten, she request'
	db	'ed a small vial of liqueur from an itinerant merchant who wo'
	db	'uld be passing through Britain. He brought it here a few day'
	db	's ago and I have not had a chance to give it to her. Wouldst'
	db	' thou be willing to deliver it to her for me, '
	db	00
L11DC:	db	'?"'
	db	00
L11DF:	db	'"Excellent, my friend."'
	db	00
L11F7:	db	'"I thank thee." He gives you the vial of liquor.'
	db	00
L1228:	db	'"Ah, well, thou art carrying too much. I will simply have to'
	db	' save it for when I have time to talk with her. Thank thee a'
	db	'nyway."'
	db	00
L12A8:	db	'"Very well. I will have to save it for when I have time to t'
	db	'alk with her. Thank thee anyway."'
	db	00
L1306:	db	'Balayna\'s accusation'
	db	00
L131B:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L131F:	db	'"May the triad guide thy life."*'
	db	00
L1340:	db	'"Shouldst thou find an interest in The Fellowship, '
	db	00
L1374:	db	', seek Batlin in Britain. Farewell, '
	db	00
L1399:	db	'."*'
	db	00
