L0000:	db	'Danag nods his head at you. "I do not mean to be impolite, b'
	db	'ut I am concentrating on the games. I wish to win a bundle t'
	db	'onight!"'
	db	00
L0081:	db	'He rubs his hand with glee.*'
	db	00
L009E:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L00A2:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00A6:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00AB:	db	'Hook'
	db	00
L00B0:	db	'Elizabeth and Abraham'
	db	00
L00C6:	db	'You see a jovial man with a wide smile. It is obvious he is '
	db	'enjoying his life.'
	db	00
L0115:	db	'He notices your medallion.'
	db	00
L0130:	db	'"Fellow member! How art thee! I hope thy journey to Buccanee'
	db	'r\'s Den was not too troublesome! Welcome to our island!"'
	db	00
L01A5:	db	'The Cube vibrates.'
	db	00
L01B8:	db	'"And I recognize thee as the Avatar! I know that thou art co'
	db	'ndemned to die!"'
	db	00
L0205:	db	'Danag smiles as if he had just said that you had been invite'
	db	'd to dine with the king.'
	db	00
L025A:	db	'"Hello, there!" Danag says.'
	db	00
L0276:	db	'name'
	db	00
L027B:	db	'"I am Danag, my friend." The man overdoes a majestic bow.'
	db	00
L02B5:	db	'name'
	db	00
L02BA:	db	'job'
	db	00
L02BE:	db	'"I am interim Fellowship Branch leader here on Buccaneer\'s '
	db	'Den. Our regular leader, Abraham, is away on Fellowship busi'
	db	'ness at the moment."'
	db	00
L034A:	db	'Abraham'
	db	00
L0352:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L035D:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0368:	db	'"The Fellowship has been present on Buccaneer\'s Den for a l'
	db	'ong time. This is one of the oldest branches in Britannia, s'
	db	'econd only to the headquarters in Britain. Thou mayest wonde'
	db	'r why an island of such ill-repute would attract The Fellows'
	db	'hip."'
	db	00
L045D:	db	'Fellowship'
	db	00
L0468:	db	'wonder'
	db	00
L046F:	db	'wonder'
	db	00
L0476:	db	'"The founders of The Fellowship felt that the people who inh'
	db	'abit this island would benefit the most from our organizatio'
	db	'n.'
	db	00
L04F1:	db	'"Especially since we would help them build an empire of sin '
	db	'and gluttony out of Buccaneer\'s Den."'
	db	00
L0553:	db	'You notice the Cube has been vibrating while Danag was speak'
	db	'ing.'
	db	00
L0594:	db	'"Amidst all of the sin, the debauchery, the piracy, the gamb'
	db	'ling, the drunkenness -- The Fellowship has made its stand a'
	db	'nd recruited members to follow our principles. Buccaneer\'s '
	db	'Den has changed as a result."'
	db	00
L0665:	db	'wonder'
	db	00
L066C:	db	'Buccaneer\'s Den'
	db	00
L067C:	db	'Buccaneer\'s Den'
	db	00
L068C:	db	'"Long ago it was merely a hideout for pirates, scavengers, a'
	db	'nd rogues. Look around.'
	db	00
L06E0:	db	'"Now it is the center of corruption in all of Britannia. The'
	db	' pirates are all controlled by The Fellowship."'
	db	00
L074C:	db	'The Cube continues to vibrate.'
	db	00
L076B:	db	'"Now Buccaneer\'s Den is an island paradise. It has its own '
	db	'commerce. It pays taxes to Lord British. The pirates here ar'
	db	'e now businessmen. They have made something of their lives.'
	db	00
L081E:	db	'"As a result, The Baths and The House of Games are two of th'
	db	'e most profitable establishments in the country."'
	db	00
L088C:	db	'Buccaneer\'s Den'
	db	00
L089C:	db	'House of Games'
	db	00
L08AB:	db	'The Baths'
	db	00
L08B5:	db	'The Baths'
	db	00
L08BF:	db	'"It is, of course, a place where one may experience the plea'
	db	'sures of the flesh. All of the profits go to The Fellowship.'
	db	00
L0938:	db	'"It is a purely innocent business which caters to the weary '
	db	'who are in need of relaxation. One may receive physical and '
	db	'mental cleansing there.'
	db	00
L09C8:	db	'"It is truly a jewel in the crown that is Britannia."'
	db	00
L09FE:	db	'The Baths'
	db	00
L0A08:	db	'House of Games'
	db	00
L0A17:	db	'"Why, it is a gambling parlor! The Fellowship certainly take'
	db	's in a bundle from that place!"'
	db	00
L0A73:	db	'"It is an outfit which challenges the mind and its ability f'
	db	'or assessing strategy in life. Exercising this aspect of one'
	db	'\'s brain is important for one\'s self-esteem and well-being'
	db	'."'
	db	00
L0B28:	db	'House of Games'
	db	00
L0B37:	db	'Abraham'
	db	00
L0B3F:	db	'"Abraham is one of the members of the inner circle of The Fe'
	db	'llowship. He and his colleague Elizabeth travel the country '
	db	'periodically, usually distributing or collecting the organiz'
	db	'ation\'s funds and doing business at the other branches."'
	db	00
L0C2C:	db	'The Cube vibrates.'
	db	00
L0C3F:	db	'"Uhm... er... he is also a coordinator for executions and he'
	db	' cheats at cards."'
	db	00
L0C8E:	db	'Abraham'
	db	00
L0C96:	db	'Elizabeth'
	db	00
L0CA0:	db	'Elizabeth'
	db	00
L0CAA:	db	'"Elizabeth is an extremely intelligent woman who acts as Dir'
	db	'ector of Special Projects. She usually works with Batlin in '
	db	'Britain, but she spends most of her time travelling from bra'
	db	'nch to branch."'
	db	00
L0D6E:	db	'As the Cube vibrates, Danag adds, "She is, uhm... also a roy'
	db	'al she-bitch and will murder thee at a moment\'s notice."'
	db	00
L0DE3:	db	'Elizabeth'
	db	00
L0DED:	db	'Special Projects'
	db	00
L0DFE:	db	'Special Projects'
	db	00
L0E0F:	db	'"They might be anything from building a shelter for poor pea'
	db	'sants to creating a new branch in a town without the benefit'
	db	' of a Fellowship Hall."'
	db	00
L0E9F:	db	'As the Cube vibrates, Danag proudly adds, "Our current Speci'
	db	'al Project is building the Black Gate for The Guardian. It i'
	db	's located at the Isle of the Avatar in our secret undergroun'
	db	'd complex!"'
	db	00
L0F5F:	db	'complex'
	db	00
L0F67:	db	'Black Gate'
	db	00
L0F72:	db	'Special Projects'
	db	00
L0F83:	db	'Black Gate'
	db	00
L0F8E:	db	'Danag\'s eyes widen with excitement. "It is the gateway for '
	db	'our coming Lord and Master! He will be coming through in vir'
	db	'tually a few hours!"'
	db	00
L101A:	db	'Black Gate'
	db	00
L1025:	db	'complex'
	db	00
L102D:	db	'"It is inside a dungeon within the Shrine of the Codex. A ba'
	db	'rrier keeps out unwanted visitors. A special key opens the b'
	db	'arrier, and only a few select people have one."'
	db	00
L10D5:	db	'complex'
	db	00
L10DD:	db	'key'
	db	00
L10E1:	db	'key'
	db	00
L10E5:	db	'"I do not own one. The only people that do are Elizabeth and'
	db	' Abraham, Batlin, and Hook himself. Hook probably keeps his '
	db	'key in his abode."'
	db	00
L1170:	db	'key'
	db	00
L1174:	db	'Hook'
	db	00
L1179:	db	'The Cube vibrates.'
	db	00
L118C:	db	'"Man with a Hook? That\'s his name! \'Hook\'! He lives here '
	db	'on the island! In fact, his quarters are in the secret catac'
	db	'ombs behind the House of Games! Thou canst reach it by askin'
	db	'g Sintag the guard about Hook. Of course, thou dost know tha'
	db	't Hook is The Fellowship\'s chief executioner... along with '
	db	'his assistant, the gargoyle Forskis."'
	db	00
L12DA:	db	'Forskis'
	db	00
L12E2:	db	'executioner'
	db	00
L12EE:	db	'"A pirate with a hook for a hand? No... I do not believe I k'
	db	'now him. There are many pirates on this island. Many of them'
	db	' are missing appendages, too!"'
	db	00
L1385:	db	'Hook'
	db	00
L138A:	db	'Elizabeth and Abraham'
	db	00
L13A0:	db	'"They usually travel together. They just arrived from our Me'
	db	'ditation Retreat near Serpent\'s Hold and I believe they are'
	db	' somewhere on the island. Abraham told me I must keep workin'
	db	'g as interim branch leader until his return."'
	db	00
L1481:	db	'The Cube vibrates.'
	db	00
L1494:	db	'"Actually, I believe they are on their way to the Isle of th'
	db	'e Avatar to take care of our new Special Project."'
	db	00
L1503:	db	'Elizabeth and Abraham'
	db	00
L1519:	db	'executioner'
	db	00
L1525:	db	'"That\'s right. Hook does all the dirty work for The Fellows'
	db	'hip. He was trained by Master De Snel in Jhelom. De Snel tra'
	db	'ined all the previous executioners as well. In fact, De Snel'
	db	' himself was The Fellowship\'s first executioner!"'
	db	00
L160A:	db	'executioner'
	db	00
L1616:	db	'Forskis'
	db	00
L161E:	db	'"I understand the gargoyle\'s name means \'henchman\' in Gar'
	db	'gish. He\'s a tough wingless gargoyle who helps Hook out. I '
	db	'believe he resides in the catacombs with Hook."'
	db	00
L16C2:	db	'Forskis'
	db	00
L16CA:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L16CE:	db	'"Farewell!"*'
	db	00
