L0000:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0008:	db	'name'
	db	00
L000D:	db	'You see a lovely naked woman. She is not in the least concer'
	db	'ned that she is wearing no clothes.*'
	db	00
L006E:	db	'Spark\'s eyes widen and his jaw drops.*'
	db	00
L0095:	db	'"Close thy mouth, boy. An insect may fly in. And put thine e'
	db	'yes back in thine head. They shall look strange dangling out'
	db	' of their sockets."*'
	db	00
L0122:	db	'"Me Mama!" the woman exclaims proudly.'
	db	00
L0149:	db	'"Forget it, Myrtle. The jig is up. They know all about us."*'
	db	00
L0186:	db	'"Murray! Didst thou give us away? How couldst thou do it? Th'
	db	'is just isn\'t going to be much fun anymore knowing that som'
	db	'eone is aware of the truth!"*'
	db	00
L021B:	db	'"Sorry, dear."*'
	db	00
L022B:	db	'You tell the woman what Papa said about their past lives.~~"'
	db	'Well, blast it! Why did he tell our secret? I will never for'
	db	'give him! What a knave!"'
	db	00
L02BC:	db	'"Hmm?" asks Mama.'
	db	00
L02CE:	db	'name'
	db	00
L02D3:	db	'"Me Mama!" the woman exclaims again.'
	db	00
L02F8:	db	'"All right. My name is Myrtle. But I like to be called Mama.'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L0336:	db	'name'
	db	00
L033B:	db	'job'
	db	00
L033F:	db	'"Me live with Papa here in cave!"'
	db	00
L0361:	db	'"Well, I would not call it a job, but I just live here in Be'
	db	'e Cave with Papa."'
	db	00
L03B0:	db	'cave'
	db	00
L03B5:	db	'Papa'
	db	00
L03BA:	db	'live'
	db	00
L03BF:	db	'live'
	db	00
L03C4:	db	'Mama explains. "Eat. Sleep. Love."*'
	db	00
L03E8:	db	'"What else is there?"*'
	db	00
L03FF:	db	'"We do our best to eat, sleep, and love each other down here'
	db	' isolated from the rest of society."'
	db	00
L0460:	db	'live'
	db	00
L0465:	db	'Papa'
	db	00
L046A:	db	'"Mmmmmmm. Papa! Mama love Papa!"'
	db	00
L048B:	db	'"He\'s mostly a lazy beggar, but I still love him."'
	db	00
L04BE:	db	'Papa'
	db	00
L04C3:	db	'cave'
	db	00
L04C8:	db	'"Cave good. Warm. Safe."'
	db	00
L04E1:	db	'"It\'s been good to us. It keeps us warm. We are able to fin'
	db	'd food. I do not miss the old life."'
	db	00
L0541:	db	'cave'
	db	00
L0546:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L054A:	db	'"\'Bye!"*'
	db	00
