	; Function at file offset 00117832H
	.funcnumber  0500H
	.data
	.msize       175AH
	.dsize       1512H
L0000:	db	'The wisp does not respond.*'
	db	00
L001C:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L0020:	db	'job'
	db	00
L0024:	db	'name'
	db	00
L0029:	db	'notebook'
	db	00
L0032:	db	'Time Lord'
	db	00
L003C:	db	'A ball of light approaches you.~~"\'You\' are not the entity'
	db	' known as \'Trellek\'. \'You\' call out in the manner of the'
	db	' species called \'emps\'. \'Xorinia\' was expecting the enti'
	db	'ty \'Trellek\'.'
	db	00
L00F4:	db	'"But that is not of importance. From the information \'I\' h'
	db	'ave, the local manifestation before \'me\' is the entity kno'
	db	'wn as \'Avatar\'.'
	db	00
L0178:	db	'The Wisp glows brightly a second or two.~~"\'Xorinia\' wishe'
	db	's to exchange information with the human entity."'
	db	00
L01E4:	db	'"Once again a local manifestation addresses the Xorinite dim'
	db	'ension."'
	db	00
L0229:	db	'name'
	db	00
L022E:	db	'"Highest probabilities indicate that a manifestation from th'
	db	'e Xorinite dimension will be called \'Wisp\' by the entities'
	db	' known as \'humans\'. I am also called \'Xorinia\' by other '
	db	'manifestations of the Xorinite dimension."'
	db	00
L0307:	db	'name'
	db	00
L030C:	db	'Wisp'
	db	00
L0311:	db	'Wisp'
	db	00
L0316:	db	'"This label has been implemented by human entities to name m'
	db	'anifestations from the Xorinite dimension since the time whe'
	db	'n this dimension was discovered by Xorinite manifestations. '
	db	'Another common name is \'Will-o-the-wisp\'.~~ "The preceding'
	db	' sample of information was provided without charge. Usually '
	db	'there is a fee for information."'
	db	00
L0461:	db	'Wisp'
	db	00
L0466:	db	'information'
	db	00
L0472:	db	'"The Undrian Council seeks information regarding a certain e'
	db	'ntity by the name of \'Alagner\'. \'You\' have access to thi'
	db	's information. \'I\' have information regarding a certain en'
	db	'tity which \'you\' are seeking. The Undrian Council proposes'
	db	' a trade."'
	db	00
L0565:	db	'information'
	db	00
L0571:	db	'trade'
	db	00
L0577:	db	'Alagner'
	db	00
L057F:	db	'Undrian Council'
	db	00
L058F:	db	'Undrian Council'
	db	00
L059F:	db	'"The Council represents what \'your\' language defines as '
	db	'\'government\'."'
	db	00
L05E6:	db	'Undrian Council'
	db	00
L05F6:	db	'job'
	db	00
L05FA:	db	'"\'Xorinia\' is a conduit for information between different '
	db	'planes and dimensions. \'Xorinia\' also catalogs information'
	db	' which is necessary for growth of the Xorinite community. '
	db	'\'You\' have information which may be valuable to \'me\'. '
	db	'\'I\' also have information that \'you\' want."'
	db	00
L070A:	db	'information'
	db	00
L0716:	db	'Alagner'
	db	00
L071E:	db	'"The Undrian Council has information that there is a human e'
	db	'ntity in \'your\' dimension that has been called \'the wises'
	db	't man in Britannia.\' This entity is known as \'Alagner\' an'
	db	'd lives in \'your\' colony of \'New Magincia\'. \'Alagner\' '
	db	'has what the entity calls a \'notebook\'. The \'notebook\' i'
	db	's a collection of information."'
	db	00
L085A:	db	'Alagner'
	db	00
L0862:	db	'trade'
	db	00
L0868:	db	'"\'I\' want to absorb the information in Alagner\'s \'notebo'
	db	'ok\'. If \'you\' bring the \'notebook\' here, the Undrian Co'
	db	'uncil will release information useful to \'you\'. Do \'you'
	db	'\' agree to the trade?"'
	db	00
L0925:	db	'"\'Xorinia\' recognizes \'your\' usefulness. \'I\' shall be '
	db	'here. Human entities will call \'my\' activity \'waiting\'."'
	db	00
L0994:	db	'"\'Xorinia\' recognizes \'your\' hostility. \'I\' shall be h'
	db	'ere should \'you\' reflect upon \'your\' decision and decide'
	db	' to change it."*'
	db	00
L0A13:	db	'trade'
	db	00
L0A19:	db	'Time Lord'
	db	00
L0A23:	db	'"The entity known as \'Time Lord\' requests an audience with'
	db	' \'you\'. Before \'I\' can give \'you\' more information abo'
	db	'ut this, \'I\' must propose a trade."'
	db	00
L0AB7:	db	'information'
	db	00
L0AC3:	db	'"The entity known as \'Time Lord\' is a being from the space'
	db	'/time dimension. The Xorinite Dimension has been communicati'
	db	'ng with \'Time Lord\' for what \'humans\' call \'centuries'
	db	'\'."'
	db	00
L0B72:	db	'Time Lord'
	db	00
L0B7C:	db	'notebook'
	db	00
L0B85:	db	'"The human entity is welcomed by \'Xorinia\'. \'You\' have b'
	db	'rought the item \'notebook\'. \'I\' shall now absorb the inf'
	db	'ormation contained therein."~~The Wisp glows brightly for a '
	db	'few seconds. The notebook remains in your possession.~~"\'I'
	db	'\' have completed my absorption of the information. \'You\' '
	db	'may now return the item \'notebook\' to the entity \'Alagner'
	db	'\'.~~"And now for the exchange of information and delivery o'
	db	'f a message."'
	db	00
L0D26:	db	'notebook'
	db	00
L0D2F:	db	'message'
	db	00
L0D37:	db	'exchange'
	db	00
L0D40:	db	'message'
	db	00
L0D48:	db	'"\'Xorinia\' must deliver a message to \'you\'. The entity k'
	db	'nown as \'Time Lord\' requests \'your\' audience. \'Time Lor'
	db	'd\' is trapped at the plane known as the Shrine of Spiritual'
	db	'ity. \'You\' can reach \'him\' by using \'your\' object \'Or'
	db	'b of the Moons\' in the location directly to \'your\' \'nort'
	db	'hwest\'.'
	db	00
L0E67:	db	'message'
	db	00
L0E6F:	db	'Time Lord'
	db	00
L0E79:	db	'exchange'
	db	00
L0E82:	db	'"Now for the information \'you\' seek. \'This\' dimension kn'
	db	'own as \'Britannia\' is under attack by an entity called \'T'
	db	'he Guardian\'.~~"\'The Guardian\' lives in another dimension'
	db	'. \'Xorinia\' sometimes trades information with this entity.'
	db	' Do \'you\' want to know more about \'The Guardian\'?"'
	db	00
L0F99:	db	'"\'Xorinia\' has digested information about \'The Guardian'
	db	'\' and can state the following facts:~~"\'The Guardian\' pos'
	db	'sesses qualities which human entities label \'vain\', \'gree'
	db	'dy\', \'egocentric\', and \'malevolent\'. \'The Guardian\' t'
	db	'hrives on power and domination. \'The Guardian\' takes \'ple'
	db	'asure\' from conquering other worlds. His sensory organs are'
	db	' now focused on \'this\' dimension known as \'Britannia\'.~~'
	db	'"\'The Guardian\' is attempting to enter \'this\' dimension '
	db	'by means of an item human entities call a \'Moongate\'. This'
	db	' \'Moongate\' is not a \'red\' color or \'blue\' color \'Moo'
	db	'ngate\', which \'Xorinia\' knows is the standard form of thi'
	db	's item. \'The Guardian\' is building a \'Moongate\' of the c'
	db	'olor \'black\'."'
	db	00
L124A:	db	'exchange'
	db	00
L1253:	db	'Black Gate'
	db	00
L125E:	db	'"\'Xorinia\' always responds to free information. Transactio'
	db	'n complete."*'
	db	00
L12A6:	db	'exchange'
	db	00
L12AF:	db	'Black Gate'
	db	00
L12BA:	db	'"The \'Black Gate\' will be fully functional when the phenom'
	db	'enon known as \'Astronomical Alignment\' next occurs.~~ "Alt'
	db	'hough \'Xorinia\' does not normally seek to influence action'
	db	's of other manifestations, \'Xorinia\' warns \'you\' that if'
	db	' \'The Guardian\' enters \'this\' dimension, it will be the '
	db	'end of the dimension known as \'Britannia\'. \'The Guardian'
	db	'\' is powerful in \'his\' own dimension. In \'your\' dimensi'
	db	'on, \'he\' will be unstoppable.~~"The Undrian Council sincer'
	db	'ely hopes this information is useful. Transaction complete."'
	db	'*'
	db	00
L14BF:	db	'Black Gate'
	db	00
L14CA:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L14CE:	db	'"\'Xorinia\' always welcomes the exchange of information. Fa'
	db	'rewell."*'
	db	00
