L0000:	db	'"Avatar! Stop where thou art! Thou shalt not succeed in thy '
	db	'quest to destroy the Black Gate! Art thou mad??! The Guardia'
	db	'n is much too powerful for thee! He shall crush thee like an'
	db	' insect! The fate of Britannia now belongs to him and to The'
	db	' Fellowship! The Guardian is the land\'s true ruler! Bow dow'
	db	'n to him, Avatar, and perhaps he shall give thee a place at '
	db	'his side. Bow down to him -now-!"*'
	db	00
L018A:	db	'She'
	db	00
L018E:	db	'her'
	db	00
L0192:	db	'her'
	db	00
L0196:	db	'He'
	db	00
L0199:	db	'his'
	db	00
L019D:	db	'him'
	db	00
L01A1:	db	'Hook points to you.'
	db	00
L01B5:	db	'"I say -kill- the Avatar! '
	db	00
L01D0:	db	' is dangerous! Cut '
	db	00
L01E4:	db	' throat! I say we attack -now-!"*'
	db	00
L0206:	db	'Forskis shouts, "To kill! To kill!"*'
	db	00
L022B:	db	'Abraham yells, "Let us make fish bait out of '
	db	00
L0259:	db	'!"*'
	db	00
L025D:	db	'"Death to the Avatar! Long live The Guardian!" screams Eliza'
	db	'beth.*'
	db	00
L02A0:	db	'"So be it! The Fellowship hereby sentences the Avatar to imm'
	db	'ediate death! Kill '
	db	00
L02F0:	db	' now!"*'
	db	00
