L0000:	db	'You see an irate guard.~~Years of indoctrination have instil'
	db	'led in him an overly developed sense of discipline~~and a ze'
	db	'alous devotion to the maintainance of order. All of this zea'
	db	'l is now directed against you.~~ "Such behavior will never b'
	db	'e tolerated inside the sanctuary of Trinsic\'s walls.~~Thy r'
	db	'ed cloak and blonde curls show only that thou art a vile imp'
	db	'oster and not a true Avatar.~~To the Death!"'
	db	00
L0194:	db	'The guard glares at you. "Unrepentant scoundrel!"'
	db	00
L01C6:	db	'You see an angry guard. "Cease and desist immediately!.~~Dos'
	db	't thou wish to avoid the unpleasantries of a lengthy trial?"'
	db	00
L023F:	db	'"What is your liberty worth?"'
	db	00
L025D:	db	'The guard looks unimpressed by your paltry offer. "How about'
	db	' a bit more? Our jail is populated by some unsavory characte'
	db	'rs."'
	db	00
L02DA:	db	'woman'
	db	00
L02E0:	db	'man'
	db	00
L02E4:	db	'The guard winks. "I am pleased to see that thou art a thinki'
	db	'ng '
	db	00
L0324:	db	'. I will take care of this disturbance."'
	db	00
L034D:	db	'You see an angry guard. "Cease and desist immediately!.~~Wil'
	db	't thou come quietly?"'
	db	00
L039F:	db	'"Very well. Thou shalt remain in prison until we see fit to '
	db	'release thee."'
	db	00
L03EA:	db	'"An unfortunate decision, my friend."'
	db	00
