L0000:	db	'After a short while you notice that the edge has definitely '
	db	'improved.'
	db	00
L0046:	db	'You feel that you\'ve done the best job that you can, but th'
	db	'e sword doesn\'t feel quite right. It\'s much too heavy and '
	db	'cumbersome to wield as a weapon.'
	db	00
L00DC:	db	'That last blow was perhaps a bit too hard, It\'ll take a whi'
	db	'le to hammer out the flaws.'
	db	00
L0133:	db	'The blade has been worked as well as it can be. It will take'
	db	' some form of magic to make this sword blank into a usable w'
	db	'eapon.'
	db	00
