L0000:	db	'A look of grim determination comes to Erethian\'s lined feat'
	db	'ures. He pushes up his sleeves like a blacksmith about to sh'
	db	'oe a high strung horse,'
	db	00
L008F:	db	'"Careful, now." The old mage says solicitously, "The powers '
	db	'I am about to release are capricious and fickle. I wouldst n'
	db	'ot like to see something untoward happen to thee."'
	db	00
L013A:	db	'You feel a great surge in the ether as the mage draws power '
	db	'from his surroundings.*'
	db	00
L018E:	db	'You feel a great surge in the ether, which seems to temporar'
	db	'ily stabilize it in this area.*'
	db	00
