L0000:	db	'Amidst muttered curses detailing the uselessness of ether an'
	db	'd bothersome inter-dimensional beings, Erethian intones the '
	db	'magical words,'
	db	00
L0087:	db	'"An Vas Ailem!   Kal Bet Ailem!"*'
	db	00
L00A9:	db	'Little beads of sweat appear on the elderly mage\'s furrowed'
	db	' brow. "That was a bit harder than I\'d expected." He pauses'
	db	' to mop his forehead with the tip of his sleeve, "I had to r'
	db	'edirect a small underground river for the well to tap. Now, '
	db	'then. Thou shalt have need of some few tools to make use of '
	db	'this equipment, shan\'t thee?" His rhetorical question goes '
	db	'unanswered\tas he once again prepares to unleash his will up'
	db	'on the world.'
	db	00
L0257:	db	'He stops himself for a moment and says, "If perchance thou h'
	db	'adst some item or other laying upon the floor here, thou\'lt'
	db	' find it within yonder chest." He motions to the chest sitti'
	db	'ng on the floor, then continues with his spell.*'
	db	00
