L0000:	db	'Erethian\'s face begins to take on an ashen palor, but he lo'
	db	'oks contented with a job well done. "As I have said, I mysel'
	db	'f once attempted to create an artifact of great power. I cra'
	db	'fted the hilt from a dark substance that is immutable, save '
	db	'by magical means. The blade, however, is cast of an alloy of'
	db	' this substance and the purest metals known to Britannia. My'
	db	' artistic skills served me well enough to fashion the hilt b'
	db	'ut, alas, the strength was not in my arm to beat a good temp'
	db	'er into the blade. Perhaps, thou canst finish this great art'
	db	'ifact for me..." He pulls a poorly worked blade with a fine '
	db	'hilt out of thin air. "Fear not to touch the hilt when the b'
	db	'lade is hot, for heat apparently does not travel well across'
	db	' the medium of the pure, black substance. I wish thee good l'
	db	'uck."'
	db	00
L0311:	db	'He hands the sword to you and wearily turns away.*'
	db	00
L0344:	db	'He places the sword upon the firepit and wearily turns away.'
	db	'"*'
	db	00
