	db	'ars!" Arcadion pauses, regaining his composure. A thought vi'
	db	'sibly crosses his\tdarkened face, "Perhaps thou mightest ass'
	db	'ist me to free myself of this unwanted bondage. I could prov'
	db	'e an invaluable\tally." The daemon pauses to let his offer s'
	db	'ink in, then, "Well, mortal. Wilt thou help me?"'
