	db	00
L207A:	db	'master'
	db	00
L2081:	db	'bound'
	db	00
L2087:	db	'"Long ago, even by my accounting of time, my people were def'
	db	'eated by a powerful race of beings in an attempt to conquer '
	db	'this realm. This race lived here long before the coming of t'
	db	'hy sovereign, Lord British. My poeple were defeated and they'
	db	' expected death, but these great and powerful beings were no'
	db	't destroyers. However, they also did not wish futher disrupt'
	db	'ion by my kind. So they weaved enchantments beyond the ken o'
	db	'f my race, binding us to the inhabitants of this realm. Thin'
	db	'e own people merely use the existing enchantments to keep us'
	db	' enslaved, sometimes without an incling of how this was achi'
	db	'eved."'
	db	00
