	; Function at file offset 001436F9H
	.funcnumber  0851H
	.data
	.msize       03A2H
	.dsize       031CH
L0000:	db	'"I need thee to deliver this sealed package unopened to Elyn'
	db	'or, the leader of our Fellowship branch in Minoc. Elynor wil'
	db	'l reward thee upon receiving it, thou dost have my word. May'
	db	' I trust thee to do it?"'
	db	00
L00CD:	db	'"Hast thou reconsidered thy task? Wilt thou deliver the pack'
	db	'age to Elynor in Minoc?"'
	db	00
L0122:	db	'"Excellent! Here it is. Thou must now be on thy way!"*'
	db	00
L0159:	db	'"Zounds! Thine hands are too full to take the box. Please di'
	db	'vest thyself of some of thy belongings."*'
	db	00
L01BF:	db	'"Avatar, I know that thou hast gone on many quests. The ques'
	db	't for the spiritual is often the most fearsome and elusive o'
	db	'ne of all, as we both know. Do not be afraid of thyself, Ava'
	db	'tar, for that is what prevents us from doing that which we m'
	db	'ust do. We shall speak of this again once thou hast reconsid'
	db	'ered. Ask me about the package again tomorrow."*'
	db	00
