L0000:	db	'According to the Book of Archaic Knowledge, fewer than how m'
	db	'any pearls in 10,000 are black?'
	db	00
L005C:	db	'According to the Traveller\'s Companion, how many parts of t'
	db	'he body should one wish to protect with armour?'
	db	00
L00C7:	db	'In the Book of Fellowship, how many bandits can be seen surr'
	db	'ounding on the old man in the illustration on page three?'
	db	00
L013D:	db	'According to the Book of Archaic Knowledge, how many places '
	db	'may the Mandrake Root naturally be found?'
	db	00
L01A3:	db	'How many runes are in the archaic script of the outdated Bri'
	db	'tannian language?'
	db	00
L01F1:	db	'According to the Book of Archaic Knowledge, how many times m'
	db	'ust ginseng be reboiled in order for it to be properly used '
	db	'as a magical reagent?'
	db	00
L027F:	db	'"'
	db	00
L0281:	db	'"'
	db	00
