L0000:	db	'you'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'"I cannot charge a master such as thyself full price."'
	db	00
L003B:	db	'After a bit of target practice, he says, "I am sorry to say '
	db	'this, but thou dost need more practice before I will be able'
	db	' to train thee. Perhaps at a later time thou wilt be in a be'
	db	'tter position to receive mine instruction."'
	db	00
L011B:	db	'You gather your gold and count it, finding that you have '
	db	00
L0155:	db	' gold altogether.'
	db	00
L0167:	db	'"Thou hast not the gold to train."'
	db	00
L018A:	db	'After a few target shots, he exclaims, "Thou art already as '
	db	'proficient as I! I can do nothing to improve thy coordinatio'
	db	'n of hand and eye!"'
	db	00
L0216:	db	'You pay '
	db	00
L021F:	db	' gold, and the training session begins.'
	db	00
L0247:	db	'You'
	db	00
L024B:	db	'you'
	db	00
	db	00
L0250:	db	's'
	db	00
L0252:	db	' and Bradman spend some time taking target practice with the'
	db	' bow. Shortly, '
	db	00
L029E:	db	' notice'
	db	00
L02A6:	db	' a significant increase in hand-eye coordination.'
	db	00
