L0000:	db	'you'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'"I am sorry, but thou dost not have enough practical experie'
	db	'nce to train at this time. If thou couldst return at a later'
	db	' date, I would be most happy to train thee."'
	db	00
L00A9:	db	'You gather your gold and count it, finding that you have '
	db	00
L00E3:	db	' gold altogether.'
	db	00
L00F5:	db	'"I regret that thou dost not seem to have enough gold to tra'
	db	'in here. Mayhaps at another time, when thy fortunes are more'
	db	' prosperous..."'
	db	00
L017D:	db	'"Thou art already as proficient as I! I am afraid that thou '
	db	'cannot be trained further in this."'
	db	00
L01DD:	db	'You pay '
	db	00
L01E6:	db	' gold, and the training session begins.'
	db	00
L020E:	db	'you'
	db	00
L0212:	db	'complete'
	db	00
L021B:	db	'feel'
	db	00
L0220:	db	'your'
	db	00
L0225:	db	'spend'
	db	00
L022B:	db	'you'
	db	00
L022F:	db	'completes'
	db	00
L0239:	db	'feels'
	db	00
L023F:	db	'their'
	db	00
L0245:	db	'spends'
	db	00
L024C:	db	'them'
	db	00
L0251:	db	'Denby hands '
	db	00
L025E:	db	' a chart with runes printed on it. "Study these runes and me'
	db	'morize them," he says. After '
	db	00
L02B8:	db	' '
	db	00
L02BA:	db	' this task, '
	db	00
L02C7:	db	' '
	db	00
L02C9:	db	' that there is a bit of knowledge in '
	db	00
L02EF:	db	' mind that was not there earlier.~~"Now we shall exercise. P'
	db	'ractice what I teach thee at least twice a day. Then thou sh'
	db	'alt become more agile and limber." ^'
	db	00
L038C:	db	' '
	db	00
L038E:	db	' a while mimicking the movements which Denby shows '
	db	00
L03C2:	db	'. Finally, Denby teaches '
	db	00
L03DC:	db	' a few magic words to intone for meditational purposes. When'
	db	' the training session is complete, '
	db	00
L043C:	db	' '
	db	00
L043E:	db	' much more energized and ready for anything that might come '
	db	00
L047B:	db	' way...*'
	db	00
