	; Function at file offset 0014BFEAH
	.funcnumber  0878H
	.data
	.msize       049FH
	.dsize       039FH
L0000:	db	'"Thou dost not have enough practical experience to study fig'
	db	'hting with me at this time!" he scoffs.'
	db	00
L0064:	db	'You gather your gold and count it, finding that you have '
	db	00
L009E:	db	' gold altogether.'
	db	00
L00B0:	db	'"Hmmm... it appears thou art without the necessary amount of'
	db	' gold. When thy coffers are more full, I might be able to he'
	db	'lp thee." He smirks.'
	db	00
L013D:	db	'"Thou art already close in skill to me! Thou hast peaked in '
	db	'thine own potential. There is nothing further I can do for t'
	db	'hee."'
	db	00
L01BB:	db	'You pay '
	db	00
L01C4:	db	' gold, and the training session begins.'
	db	00
L01EC:	db	'you'
	db	00
L01F0:	db	'The session, which consists of various techniques involving '
	db	'sleight of hand and strike feints, takes a fairly short amou'
	db	'nt of time.~ De Snel straightens suddenly and sheathes his b'
	db	'lade. "That is all for now. If thou dost wish more training,'
	db	' thou couldst most assuredly benefit from mine experience." '
	db	'He looks '
	db	00
L0326:	db	' up and down insolently. "Thou seemest to be an apt pupil. T'
	db	'hou mayest return at a later time and advance thy training."'
	db	00
