L0000:	db	'"Art thou in need of healing, curing, or resurrection?"'
	db	00
L0038:	db	'"Which of my services dost thou have need of?"'
	db	00
L0067:	db	'resurrect'
	db	00
L0071:	db	'cure poison'
	db	00
L007D:	db	'heal'
	db	00
L0082:	db	'heal'
	db	00
L0087:	db	'cure poison'
	db	00
L0093:	db	'heal'
	db	00
L0098:	db	'healed'
	db	00
L009F:	db	'cure poison'
	db	00
L00AB:	db	'cured of poison'
	db	00
L00BB:	db	'"Whom dost thou wish to have '
	db	00
L00D9:	db	'?"'
	db	00
L00DC:	db	'"Though I want thy business, I am pleased to see my services'
	db	' are not needed!"'
	db	00
L012A:	db	'resurrect'
	db	00
L0134:	db	'"Well, I do not seem to see anyone who needs mine assistance'
	db	'. Unless thou art carrying someone in thy packs...." He laug'
	db	'hs.*'
	db	00
L01B1:	db	'"My price is '
	db	00
L01BF:	db	' gold. Dost thou agree?"'
	db	00
L01D8:	db	'heal'
	db	00
L01DD:	db	'cure poison'
	db	00
L01E9:	db	'resurrect'
	db	00
L01F3:	db	'"Thou dost not have that much gold! Mayhaps thou couldst ret'
	db	'urn with more and purchase the service then."'
	db	00
L025D:	db	'"Then thou must look elsewhere for that service."'
	db	00
L028F:	db	'"Very well. If thou hast need of my services later, I will b'
	db	'e available."'
	db	00
