	.data
	.msize       0D8CH
	.dsize       0C0CH
L0000:	db	'With Elynor standing before the gathered members of The Fell'
	db	'owship, the ceremony begins. "My brothers in The Fellowship,'
	db	' I greet you on this occasion and thank you for your attenda'
	db	'nce. The events which have transpired in this town threaten '
	db	'to drive us apart. I do not need to remind you that the firs'
	db	't value of the Triad of Inner Strength states that we must S'
	db	'trive For Unity. Now is the time when all those who hate and'
	db	' fear us may be conspiring against us."'
	db	00
L01CC:	db	'"There are those who fear awareness for it illuminates their'
	db	' own limitations. There are those who despise change for the'
	db	' better because they have spent their whole lives teaching t'
	db	'hemselves to love the mediocrity with which they have surrou'
	db	'nded themselves. These are the people who perceive our Fello'
	db	'wship as a threat."'
	db	00
L030C:	db	'"And there are those who are very uncertain about the merits'
	db	' of our Fellowship. Those who have heard the words of those '
	db	'who are against us but who see with their own eyes the subst'
	db	'antial good that The Fellowship does and the difference it m'
	db	'akes in the lives of its members every single day. Those und'
	db	'ecided may still be brought into our family. We must Trust O'
	db	'ur Brothers-yet-to-be. But most importantly, we must keep ou'
	db	'r enemies from spreading their prejudices against us. To do '
	db	'that we must show their beliefs to be untrue."'
	db	00
L051B:	db	'"We must prove ourselves worthy of the trust we would have o'
	db	'ur fellow citizens\tplace in us. Once we have sufficiently d'
	db	'isplayed this worthiness, it will only be a matter of time b'
	db	'efore we receive our reward of trust. It is as inevitable as'
	db	' night following day. As our enemies will one day receive th'
	db	'eir own inevitable reward for which they have made themselve'
	db	's worthy."'
	db	00
L068D:	db	'"Now I would like to hear from our members who have gathered'
	db	' here this evening. Share with us how The Fellowship has hel'
	db	'ped thee!"'
	db	00
L0710:	db	'"The Fellowship has improved mine ability to run my business'
	db	'," says Gregor.*'
	db	00
L075D:	db	'"The Fellowship has taught me how to face mine own potential'
	db	' for greatness unquestioningly," says Owen.*'
	db	00
L07C6:	db	'"Thank thee for sharing, brother!"*'
	db	00
L07EA:	db	'You notice that Burnside has apparently nodded off. After a '
	db	'nudge from the person next to him, his eyes pop open. "Umm..'
	db	'. what was that question again...?" he asks sheepishly.*'
	db	00
L089B:	db	'"The Fellowship has helped me to have more courage to deal w'
	db	'ith the unexpected terrors of life," says William.*'
	db	00
L090B:	db	'"The Fellowship has helped me to have the firm hand that is '
	db	'necessary as the supervisor of the mine," says Mikos.*'
	db	00
L097E:	db	'"Everything about this Fellowship gives me the creeps!" says'
	db	' Spark.*'
	db	00
L09C3:	db	'"Elynor is certainly going out of her way to make them feel '
	db	'like they are persecuted," says Iolo.*'
	db	00
L0A26:	db	'"These Fellowship members seem fixated upon their own person'
	db	'al gain and very little else," says Shamino.*'
	db	00
L0A90:	db	'"Why are these people so fascinated by The Fellowship anyway'
	db	'? I do not understand it."*'
	db	00
L0AE8:	db	'With that Elynor is once again the center of attention of th'
	db	'e meeting. "Let us now begin our evening\'s meditations." Af'
	db	'ter a few minutes of silence you begin to realize\tthat this'
	db	' meditation is going to continue for quite some time and tha'
	db	't now might be a good time to leave inconspicuously.*'
	db	00
