L0056:	db	'blacksmith'
	db	00
L0061:	db	'"That is not right. Thou shouldst do some more work."*'
	db	00
L0098:	db	'"What didst thou find at the murder site?"'
	db	00
L00C3:	db	'a bucket'
	db	00
L00CC:	db	'a key'
	db	00
L00D2:	db	'a body'
	db	00
L00D9:	db	'nothing'
	db	00
L00E1:	db	'a key'
	db	00
L00E7:	db	'a body'
	db	00
L00EE:	db	'"I know that! What ELSE didst thou find? Thou shouldst look '
	db	'again, Avatar!"*'
	db	00
L013B:	db	'a bucket'
	db	00
L0144:	db	'"Yes, obviously it is filled with poor Christopher\'s own bl'
	db	'ood. But surely there was something else that might point us'
	db	' in the direction of the killer or killers - thou shouldst l'
	db	'ook again, Avatar."*'
	db	00
