	db	'ing the Avatar. My public duty disallows me to give thee the'
	db	' password. I am sorry."'
	db	00
L09E8:	db	'"All right, '
	db	00
L09F5:	db	'. I thank thee for all thine help."*'
	db	00
L0A1A:	db	'"Hmmm. Methinks thou shouldst continue the investigation. Be'
	db	' sure to talk with Gilberto and Johnson. Question them close'
	db	'ly."*'
	db	00
