	; Function at file offset 00152A22H
	.funcnumber  0892H
	.data
	.msize       060EH
	.dsize       051FH
L0000:	db	'Adjhar appears to have resumed the stance of a more traditio'
	db	'nal golem guardian -- staunch and unmoving. However, it is i'
	db	'mpossible to miss the glimmer of intelligence in his eyes.'
	db	00
L00B3:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L00B7:	db	'job'
	db	00
L00BB:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00C0:	db	'name'
	db	00
L00C5:	db	'"As thou must know by now, my creator chose to call me Adjha'
	db	'r."'
	db	00
L0105:	db	'name'
	db	00
L010A:	db	'job'
	db	00
L010E:	db	'"I was created to be one of many protectors to the Shrines o'
	db	'f the Three Principles. However," he pauses, "my duty also i'
	db	'ncluded being the keeper of the Talisman of Love."'
	db	00
L01B9:	db	'job'
	db	00
L01BD:	db	'Talisman'
	db	00
L01C6:	db	'Talisman'
	db	00
L01CF:	db	'"Dost thou want the Talisman of Love?"'
	db	00
L01F6:	db	'Talisman'
	db	00
L01FF:	db	'"I was put here to protect the Shrines and prevent any from '
	db	'acquiring the Talisman. Any except the Avatar who demonstrat'
	db	'ed knowledge and understanding of Love. The Talisman is thin'
	db	'e, Avatar."~He brings his stone hand to his heart and opens '
	db	'a panel on the front of his chest. Reaching inside with his '
	db	'other hand, he brings forth a beautiful yellow talisman.'
	db	00
L0364:	db	'He places the Talisman in your palm. ~"Thou hast earned this'
	db	' and the honors and powers associated with it. Thou art trul'
	db	'y an Avatar."'
	db	00
L03EA:	db	'"I am sorry, but thou must be less burdened to receive this '
	db	'one of three greatest of all blessings."'
	db	00
L044F:	db	'"Thou art truly deserving of such an artifact. But if thou d'
	db	'ost not wish to utilize the Shrines, I must respect thy wish'
	db	'es."'
	db	00
L04CC:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L04D0:	db	'"I bid thee farewell."*'
	db	00
L04E8:	db	'"Mark the wisdom of the Shrine of Love well, Avatar."*'
	db	00
