	; Function at file offset 001568AFH
	.funcnumber  089FH
	.data
	.msize       04C5H
	.dsize       039AH
L0000:	db	'you'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'Jakher looks into your eyes, sizing you up intellectually. "'
	db	'Thou dost need to learn more on the field of battle. If we s'
	db	'poke now I would be wasting my breath. Thou wouldst not unde'
	db	'rstand a word I said."'
	db	00
L00CF:	db	'You gather your gold and count it, finding that you have '
	db	00
L0109:	db	' gold altogether.'
	db	00
L011B:	db	'"Thou dost not seem to have as much gold as I require to tra'
	db	'in here. Mayhaps at another time, when thy fortunes are more'
	db	' prosperous..."'
	db	00
L01A3:	db	'"Thou art already well-versed in the tactics of the battlefi'
	db	'eld. I am afraid that I am unable to train thee further in t'
	db	'his."'
	db	00
L0221:	db	'You pay '
	db	00
L022A:	db	' gold, and the training session begins.'
	db	00
L0252:	db	'Jakher\'s eyes glow bright as he begins to explain some of t'
	db	'he strategies used by great military leaders in awesome batt'
	db	'les fought in ages past. He whispers to '
	db	00
L02F2:	db	' conspiratorially as he draws maps in the dirt. After some t'
	db	'ime, '
	db	00
L0334:	db	' can practically feel some of his shrewdness starting to be '
	db	'absorbed.'
	db	00
L037A:	db	'"I look forward to thy return."'
	db	00
