L0000:	db	'"I am sorry, but it appears thou dost not have enough knowle'
	db	'dge of elementary studies to train at this time. If thou cou'
	db	'ldst return at a future date, I could instruct thee then."'
	db	00
L00B3:	db	'You gather your gold and count it, finding that you have '
	db	00
L00ED:	db	' gold altogether.'
	db	00
L00FF:	db	'"I am sorry, but thou dost not seem to have enough gold to t'
	db	'rain now."'
	db	00
L0146:	db	'After giving a few test questions, she exclaims, "Thou art e'
	db	'asily as well educated as I! There is nothing I have that co'
	db	'uld help thee."'
	db	00
