	db	00
L0203:	db	'you'
	db	00
	db	00
L0208:	db	's'
	db	00
L020A:	db	' and Jillian study for some time. In addition, she teaches a'
	db	' little on the theory of magic. Afterwards, '
	db	00
L0273:	db	' notice'
	db	00
L027B:	db	' an increase in knowledge and magical understanding.'
	db	00
