L0000:	db	'"I can still heal, cure poison, and sometimes resurrect. Art'
	db	' thou in need of one of these?"'
	db	00
L005C:	db	'"Of which service dost thou have need?"'
	db	00
L0084:	db	'resurrect'
	db	00
L008E:	db	'cure poison'
	db	00
L009A:	db	'heal'
	db	00
L009F:	db	'heal'
	db	00
L00A4:	db	'cure poison'
	db	00
L00B0:	db	'heal'
	db	00
L00B5:	db	'healed'
	db	00
L00BC:	db	'cure poison'
	db	00
L00C8:	db	'cured of poison'
	db	00
L00D8:	db	'"Who dost thou wish to be '
	db	00
L00F3:	db	'?"'
	db	00
L00F6:	db	'"\'Tis good to hear that thou art well. Do not hesitate to c'
	db	'ome and see me if thou dost need healing of any kind."'
	db	00
L0168:	db	'resurrect'
	db	00
L0172:	db	'"I do apologize, '
	db	00
L0184:	db	', but I do not see anyone who must be resurrected. I must be'
	db	' able to see the body. If thou art carrying thine unlucky co'
	db	'mpanion, please lay them on the ground."'
	db	00
L0225:	db	'"Indeed, this person is badly wounded. I will attempt to ret'
	db	'urn them to health."'
	db	00
L0276:	db	'"Of course, it will never cost thee anything to use mine hea'
	db	'ling services."'
	db	00
L02C2:	db	'heal'
	db	00
L02C7:	db	'"Done!"'
	db	00
L02CF:	db	'cure poison'
	db	00
L02DB:	db	'"Done!"'
	db	00
L02E3:	db	'resurrect'
	db	00
L02ED:	db	'"Done!"'
	db	00
L02F5:	db	'"If thou hast need of my services later, I will be here."'
	db	00
