	.dsize       03D1H
L0000:	db	'"If thou wishest to seek out this isle, thou mayest use my s'
	db	'hip. It now sits upon the southern shore of Vesper and is ca'
	db	'lled the Golden Ankh. Please, feel free to use it for as lon'
	db	'g as thou hast need of it."'
	db	00
L00D0:	db	'Lord British hands you the deed to the ship.'
	db	00
L00FD:	db	'Lord British hands you the deed to the ship, but it slips fr'
	db	'om your hands and falls to the floor.'
	db	00
L015F:	db	'"I have also focused a magical crystal to the entrance of th'
	db	'e Castle of Fire which I refurbished after thy battle with E'
	db	'xodus. Here, take it. Perhaps it will give thee some insight'
	db	'. Although, be warned, it is not at all stable and might be '
	db	'prone to shatter the nearer thou findest thyself to the loca'
	db	'tion to which it is tuned."'
	db	00
L02A7:	db	'Lord British gives you the crystal.'
	db	00
L02CB:	db	'Lord British gives you the crystal, but it slips from your h'
	db	'ands and falls to the floor. Luckily, it remains intact.'
	db	00
L0340:	db	'Lord British gives you the crystal, and once again your over'
	db	'loaded condition makes you clumsy. Luckily, it remains intac'
	db	't after its little fall.'
	db	00
