L0000:	db	'you'
	db	00
L0004:	db	'"I am afraid thou dost not have enough practical experience '
	db	'to train at this time. If thou couldst return at a later dat'
	db	'e, I would be most happy to provide thee with my services."'
	db	00
L00B8:	db	'You gather your gold and count it. You have '
	db	00
L00E5:	db	' altogether.'
	db	00
L00F2:	db	'Markus stretches. He shrugs and says, "I regret that thou do'
	db	'st not have enough gold to meet my price. Perhaps later, whe'
	db	'n thou hast made thy fortune pillaging the land..."'
	db	00
L019E:	db	'You pay '
	db	00
L01A7:	db	' gold, and the training session begins.'
	db	00
L01CF:	db	'Markus blinks and seems to come out of his boredom. "Thou ar'
	db	't already as proficient as I! Thou cannot be trained further'
	db	' here."~~Markus returns the gold.'
	db	00
L0269:	db	'"Very well," Markus says, stifling a yawn. "Here we go."~~Ma'
	db	'rkus wields his sword and faces '
	db	00
L02C6:	db	'. He gives '
	db	00
L02D2:	db	' a few pointers in stance and balance, then demonstrates som'
	db	'e sample thrusts.'
	db	00
L0320:	db	'Before long, '
	db	00
L032E:	db	' and the trainer are trading blows with weapons. He is obvio'
	db	'usly very good at what he does, and the experience is valuab'
	db	'le to '
	db	00
L03AD:	db	'. When the session is over, it is felt that there has been a'
	db	' gain in combat ability.*'
	db	00
