L0000:	db	'"I am sorry, but thou hast overextended thy muscles. If thou'
	db	' couldst return at a later date, I would be quite willing to'
	db	' train thee."'
	db	00
L0086:	db	'You gather your gold and count it, finding that you have '
	db	00
L00C0:	db	' gold altogether.'
	db	00
L00D2:	db	'"I regret that thou dost not seem to have the right amount o'
	db	'f gold to train here. Mayhaps, at another time, when thy pur'
	db	'ses are more full..."'
	db	00
L0160:	db	'She seems amazed.~~"Thou art already stronger than I! I am s'
	db	'orry, but I cannot help thee grow any further."'
	db	00
L01CC:	db	'You pay '
	db	00
L01D5:	db	' gold, and the training session begins.'
	db	00
L01FD:	db	'You'
	db	00
L0201:	db	'you'
	db	00
	db	00
L0206:	db	's'
	db	00
L0208:	db	' and Penni work out and spar for some time. After stretching'
	db	', '
	db	00
L0247:	db	' feel'
	db	00
L024D:	db	' a little stronger and a bit more skilled in combat.'
	db	00
