	db	00
L0106:	db	' gold altogether.'
	db	00
L0118:	db	'"I must apologize, but I need my full fee to permit me to co'
	db	'ntinue my research. Mayhaps, at another time, when thou hast'
	db	' more money, I can teach thee."'
	db	00
L01B0:	db	'After a few moments of questioning, he says, "Thou art alrea'
	db	'dy past my tutelage. I must humbly apologize, for there is n'
	db	'othing new I can teach thee."'
	db	00
