L0000:	db	'feels'
	db	00
L0006:	db	'you'
	db	00
L000A:	db	'you'
	db	00
L000E:	db	'feel'
	db	00
L0013:	db	'her'
	db	00
L0017:	db	'him'
	db	00
L001B:	db	'"I am sorry, but thou dost not have enough experience to tra'
	db	'in at this time. Return at a later date and I would be most '
	db	'happy to lead a session."'
	db	00
L00AD:	db	'"It seems that thou hast not enough gold. Do return when tho'
	db	'u art a bit wealthier."'
	db	00
L0101:	db	'"I am amazed! Thou art already as experienced as I! Thou can'
	db	'not be trained further by me."'
	db	00
L015C:	db	'Rayburt takes your money. "The session shall begin."'
	db	00
L0191:	db	'Rayburt first instructs '
	db	00
L01AA:	db	' to lie on the floor and relax. He teaches '
	db	00
L01D6:	db	' breathing exercises and techniques with which to cleanse th'
	db	'e mind of all thoughts.'
	db	00
L022A:	db	'After a while, he asks '
	db	00
L0242:	db	' to stand up and illustrates balance and control, relating i'
	db	't to meditation and concentration.'
	db	00
L02A1:	db	'Finally, he demonstrates several good moves involving hand-t'
	db	'o-hand combat, and combat using a sword. By the end of the h'
	db	'our, '
	db	00
L031F:	db	' '
	db	00
L0321:	db	' much more knowledgeable and proficient in this unusual form'
	db	' of fighting.*'
	db	00
