L0000:	db	'It is most fortunate that thou fell so near our shelter. Tho'
	db	'u must have a protector watching over thee.@'
	db	00
L0069:	db	'It was Elizabeth and Abraham who found thee and delivered th'
	db	'ee to us.'
	db	00
L00AF:	db	'"Thank goodness thou art with us again! We were all very wor'
	db	'ried over thy condition.~~"Thou hast been unconscious for so'
	db	' long that we thought thou hadst lost thy life!~~'
	db	00
L0159:	db	'*'
	db	00
L015B:	db	'"They brought thee here along their way to Britain."'
	db	00
L0190:	db	'"They brought thee here along their way to Minoc."'
	db	00
L01C3:	db	'"They brought thee to us as they were on their way here to P'
	db	'aws, but they have since left for Jhelom."'
	db	00
L022A:	db	'"They brought thee here along their way to Jhelom."'
	db	00
L025E:	db	'"They brought thee here along their way to Britain."'
	db	00
L0293:	db	'"They brought thee here along their way to Vesper."'
	db	00
L02C7:	db	'"They brought thee here along their way to Moonglow."'
	db	00
L02FD:	db	'"They brought thee here along their way to Terfin."'
	db	00
L0331:	db	'"They brought thee here along their way to the Fellowship me'
	db	'ditation retreat near Serpent\'s Hold."'
	db	00
L0394:	db	'"They brought thee here along their way to Buccaneer\'s Den.'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L03D1:	db	'"They brought thee here and then returned to Buccaneer\'s De'
	db	'n."'
	db	00
L0410:	db	'"It is truly mysterious how this continues to happen to thee'
	db	'!"'
	db	00
