	.dsize       0225H
L0000:	db	'"Where, oh where has my dear husband gone. I cannot stand to'
	db	' be away from him!"*'
	db	00
L0051:	db	'As far as you can tell, the couple haven\'t released their e'
	db	'mbrace since they were first reunited, and they show no sign'
	db	' of doing so at any time in the near future.'
	db	00
L00F5:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L00F9:	db	'sacrifice'
	db	00
L0103:	db	'sacrifice'
	db	00
L010D:	db	'"No, '
	db	00
L0113:	db	'. She is my life. If thou takest her, thou takest mine heart'
	db	'." Trent holds on tightly to his wife.'
	db	00
L0176:	db	'"I cannot leave my lord like this. Surely thou canst underst'
	db	'and, '
	db	00
L01B8:	db	'."'
	db	00
L01BB:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L01BF:	db	'The couple continue staring into one another\'s eyes as if t'
	db	'o make up for all of the years they lost.*'
	db	00
