	.dsize       041AH
L0000:	db	'"I am sorry, but thou dost not have enough practical experie'
	db	'nce to train at this time. Return another day after thou has'
	db	't slain a few more creatures."'
	db	00
L0097:	db	'"I regret that thou dost not seem to have enough gold to tra'
	db	'in here. Mayhaps at another time, when thy fortunes are more'
	db	' prosperous."'
	db	00
L011D:	db	'"Thou art already as proficient as I! I am afraid that thou '
	db	'cannot be trained further by me!"'
	db	00
L017B:	db	'you'
	db	00
L017F:	db	'are'
	db	00
L0183:	db	'have'
	db	00
L0188:	db	'you'
	db	00
L018C:	db	'your'
	db	00
L0191:	db	'manage'
	db	00
L0198:	db	'she'
	db	00
L019C:	db	'her'
	db	00
L01A0:	db	'her'
	db	00
L01A4:	db	'he'
	db	00
L01A7:	db	'him'
	db	00
L01AB:	db	'his'
	db	00
L01AF:	db	'is'
	db	00
L01B2:	db	'has'
	db	00
L01B6:	db	'manages'
	db	00
L01BE:	db	'"On guard!" Sentri cries as he draws his sword. ^'
	db	00
L01F0:	db	' '
	db	00
L01F2:	db	' forced to respond with the most easily readied weapon '
	db	00
L022A:	db	' '
	db	00
L022C:	db	'. Without a word, Sentri advances upon '
	db	00
L0254:	db	', swinging his blade in a seemingly wild, yet entirely contr'
	db	'olled manner. ^'
	db	00
L02A0:	db	' '
	db	00
L02A2:	db	' forced to block his blows to the best of '
	db	00
L02CD:	db	' ability. Luckily, Sentri stops just short of striking '
	db	00
L0305:	db	', which he is often able to do. Slowly but surely, over the '
	db	'course of the training session, '
	db	00
L0362:	db	' blocking improves and '
	db	00
L037A:	db	' '
	db	00
L037C:	db	' to get in a few thrusts of '
	db	00
L0399:	db	' own. ^'
	db	00
L03A1:	db	' agility improves, and the improvement is tangibly perceptib'
	db	'le.'
	db	00
L03E1:	db	'"I enjoyed that!" Sentri exclaims after it is all over.*'
	db	00
