L0000:	db	'The couple haven\'t released their embrace since they were f'
	db	'irst reunited as far as you can tell, and they show no sign '
	db	'of doing so any time in the near future.'
	db	00
L00A0:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L00A4:	db	'sacrifice'
	db	00
L00AE:	db	'"No, '
	db	00
L00B4:	db	'. Wouldst thou take my beloved from me so shortly after our '
	db	'reunion? Another will have to perform this terrible task." R'
	db	'owena holds on tightly to her husband.'
	db	00
L0153:	db	'"I cannot leave my lady like this. Surely thou dost understa'
	db	'nd, '
	db	00
L0194:	db	'."'
	db	00
L0197:	db	'sacrifice'
	db	00
L01A1:	db	'bye'
	db	00
L01A5:	db	'The couple continue staring into one another\'s eyes as if t'
	db	'o make up for all of the years they lost.*'
	db	00
L020B:	db	'"Why, I must again find my darling Rowena! Where could she h'
	db	'ave gone to?*'
	db	00
