	; Function at file offset 0016E049H
	.funcnumber  0919H
	.data
	.msize       0534H
	.dsize       04D8H
L0000:	db	'"The Fellowship is a society of spiritual seekers who strive'
	db	' to reach the highest levels of human potential and to share'
	db	' this philosophy freely with all people. The Fellowship was '
	db	'formed twenty years ago by Batlin with the full approval and'
	db	' support of Lord British."'
	db	00
L010B:	db	'"The Fellowship is a wonderful organization that is open to '
	db	'all the people of Britannia. I have learned so much through '
	db	'studying its philosophy and it has helped me to live my life'
	db	' to the fullest. Through The Fellowship I am able to achieve'
	db	' what I have set out to do in life and I am a better person '
	db	'for having joined."'
	db	00
L024B:	db	'"The Fellowship is the philosophical group devoted to the te'
	db	'achings of a truly great man named Batlin. In the absence of'
	db	' the Avatar, Batlin has become a sort of spiritual father fo'
	db	'r the people of Britannia. Through his speeches and writings'
	db	' he has changed the lives of many people, including my own."'
	db	00
L0378:	db	'"The Fellowship is a group that has been gaining much popula'
	db	'rity in recent years with the people of Britannia. While on '
	db	'the surface it may simply appear to be a scholarly society s'
	db	'tudying its particular philosophy, its teachings have the po'
	db	'wer to forever alter the shape of Britannian society. Its ce'
	db	'remonies are deeply moving experiences."'
	db	00
L04CD:	db	'philosophy'
	db	00
