	; Function at file offset 0016E581H
	.funcnumber  091AH
	.data
	.msize       0430H
	.dsize       03F1H
L0000:	db	'"The Fellowship advances the philosophy of \'sanguine cognit'
	db	'ion\', a way to apply a confident order of thought to one\'s'
	db	' life, through what is called the Triad of Inner Strength. T'
	db	'he Triad is simply three basic principles that, when applied'
	db	' in unison, enable one to be more creative, satisfied, and s'
	db	'uccessful in life. They are: Strive For Unity, Trust Thy Bro'
	db	'ther, and Worthiness Precedes Reward. Strive For Unity basic'
	db	'ally means that people should cooperate and work together. T'
	db	'rust Thy Brother implies that we are all the same and that w'
	db	'e should not hate or fear each other. Worthiness Precedes Re'
	db	'ward suggests that we must each strive to be worthy of that '
	db	'which we want out of life."'
	db	00
L02AD:	db	'"Dost thou want to join?"'
	db	00
L02C7:	db	'"Then thou shouldst go immediately to see Batlin at the Fell'
	db	'owship Hall headquarters in Britain."'
	db	00
L0329:	db	'"Oh. Well, perhaps thou canst become enlightened another tim'
	db	'e."'
	db	00
L0369:	db	'"Oh! I just now noticed thy medallion! Thou dost already kno'
	db	'w all of this! Thou art one of us! Excuse me for going on an'
	db	'd on about it!"'
	db	00
