L0000:	db	'"Excellent! Dost thou have some loaves for me?"'
	db	00
L0030:	db	'"Very good! Let me see how many thou dost have..."'
	db	00
L0063:	db	'"Thou have not made enough bread to be worthy of any payment'
	db	' at all."'
	db	00
L00A9:	db	'"Scrumptious! '
	db	00
L00B8:	db	' loaves! That means I owe thee '
	db	00
L00D8:	db	' gold. Here thou art! I shall take the loaves from thee now!'
	db	'"'
	db	00
L0116:	db	'"Come back and work for me at any time!"'
